ne, proceed directly to the shuttle pick-up point.   For International Bookings: From the arrivals hall, turn left and walk past the Coffee Club. Continue straight ahead towards the exit doors located in the far corner of the terminal. Exit the terminal and head down the ramp to your left, following the pathway to the end of the covered walkway. Cross the pedestrian crossing and wait at shuttle bay 3/4 for the Goldcar shuttle.   For Domestic Bookings: From the baggage claim area, exit the terminal through the main doors. Walk towards the skywalk and proceed up the travelator. At the top of the travelator, turn left and walk across the skywalk to the second travelator on your right. Exit the terminal, walk across the Skywalk and go down the travelator to B1/B2 on the ground floor. Please wait here for the Goldcar shuttle to collect you.", "dropoff_instructions": "After collecting your luggage, please call our phone number to arrange your shuttle pick-up on on 07 3006 7442 and International Dialling: +61 7 3006 7442. If you are unable to reach us by phone, proceed directly to the shuttle pick-up point. \n\nFor International Bookings: From the arrivals hall, turn left and walk past the Coffee Club. Continue straight ahead towards the exit doors located in the far corner of the terminal. Exit the terminal and head down the ramp to your left, following the pathway to the end of the covered walkway. Cross the pedestrian crossing and wait at shuttle bay 3/4 for the Goldcar shuttle. \n\nFor Domestic Bookings: From the baggage claim area, exit the terminal through the main doors. Walk towards the skywalk and proceed up the travelator. At the top of the travelator, turn left and walk across the skywalk to the second travelator on your right. Exit the terminal, walk across the Skywalk and go down the travelator to B1/B2 on the ground floor. Please wait here for the Goldcar shuttle to collect you.", "location_type": "Shuttle Bus", "logo_url": "https://cdn.rcstatic.com/sp/images