tomatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats\n\n3. **Nissan Versa (Compact)**\n   - **Price:** $60.64\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Rating:** 7.8/10 (Good)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats\n\n4. **Polestar 2 (Premium)**\n   - **Price:** $103.34\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Rating:** 7.8/10 (Good)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Fully electric\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats\n\n### **Summary**\n- The prices for car rentals at **San Diego Marriott La Jolla** are **identical** for both pickup dates.\n- The **lowest price** is **$58.70** for the **Hyundai Veloster (Economy)**.\n- The **highest price** is **$103.34** for the **Polestar 2 (Premium)**.\n- All rentals include **free cancellation** and **unlimited mileage**.\n\nWould you like to proceed with a booking or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
