oyota RAV4 (Intermediate)**\n   - **Price**: $56.06\n   - **Supplier**: Dollar\n   - **Rating**: 7.0 (Good)\n   - **Features**: \n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats, 4 small suitcases\n   - **Pickup/Drop-off**: Shuttle Bus at LAX\n\n#### Rental Period 2: November 17, 2024 (8:00 AM) to November 18, 2024 (8:00 AM)\n1. **Hyundai Veloster (Economy)**\n   - **Price**: $44.98\n   - **Supplier**: Hertz\n   - **Rating**: 7.7 (Very Good)\n   - **Features**: \n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 4 seats, 2 small suitcases\n   - **Pickup/Drop-off**: Shuttle Bus at LAX\n\n2. **Toyota Corolla (Intermediate)**\n   - **Price**: $50.97\n   - **Supplier**: Hertz\n   - **Rating**: 7.7 (Very Good)\n   - **Features**: \n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats, 3 small suitcases\n   - **Pickup/Drop-off**: Shuttle Bus at LAX\n\n3. **Nissan Versa (Compact)**\n   - **Price**: $46.94\n   - **Supplier**: Hertz\n   - **Rating**: 7.7 (Very Good)\n   - **Features**: \n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats, 2 small suitcases\n   - **Pickup/Drop-off**: Shuttle Bus at LAX\n\n4. **Kia e-Niro (Compact - Fully Electric)**\n   - **Price**: $49.74\n   - **Supplier**: Dollar\n   - **Rating**: 6.9 (OK)\n   - **Features**: \n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats, 2 small suitcases\n   - **Pickup/Drop-off**: Shuttle Bus at LAX\n\n5. **Hyundai Accent (Compact)**\n   - **Price**: $49.89\n   - **Supplier**: Dollar\n   - **Rating**: 6.9 (OK)\n   - **Features**: \n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Free cancellation\n     - 5 seats, 3 small suitcases\n   - **Pickup/Drop-off**: Shuttle Bus at LAX\n\n### Summary of Price Differences\n- **Economy (Hyundai Veloster)**:\n  - **November 16**: $44.98\n  - **November 17**: $44.98\n  - **Difference**: **No change**\n\n- **Intermediate (Toyota Corolla)**:\n  - **November 16**: $50.97\n  - **November 17**: $50.97\n  - **Difference**: **No change**\n\n- **Compact (Nissan Versa)**:\n  - **November 16**: $46.94\n  - **November 17**: $46.94\n  - **Difference**: **No change**\n\n- **Compact (Kia e-Niro)**:\n  - **November 16**: $49.74\n  - **November 17**: $49.74\n  - **Difference**: **No change**\n\n- **Intermediate (Toyota RAV4)**:\n  - **November 16**: $56.06\n  - **November 17**: Not available (replaced by Hyundai Accent at $49.89)\n\n### Conclusion\nThe prices for car rentals at LAX remain consistent between **November 16** and **November 17**, 2024, for the same vehicle models. The lowest price is **$44.98** for the **Hyundai Veloster (Economy)** on both dates. The only change is the replacement of the **Toyota RAV4** with the **Hyundai Accent** on **November 17**, which is priced at **$49.89**."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
