ge:** Unlimited\n   - **Transmission:** Automatic\n   - **Seats:** 5\n   - **Suitcases:** 3 small\n\n2. **Rental Starting on December 4, 2024 (Two Days After Tomorrow):**\n   - **Vehicle:** Tesla Model 3 (Intermediate)\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** **$64.02** (Total Drive Away Price)\n   - **Location:** Downtown Houston\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Transmission:** Automatic\n   - **Seats:** 5\n   - **Suitcases:** 3 small\n\n### Conclusion:\n- **Price Difference:** There is **no price difference** between renting a car on **December 3, 2024**, and **December 4, 2024**. Both rentals cost **$64.02** for a Tesla Model 3 from Hertz.\n- **Recommendation:** You can choose either date based on your convenience, as the price remains consistent for both days.\n\nIf you need further assistance or wish to book, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
