wift\n- **Car Class**: Compact\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Seats**: 5\n- **Doors**: 2\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel as when picked up)\n- **Suitcases Capacity**:\n  - Small: 1\n  - Big: 1\n\n### Pricing\n- **Total Price**: $198.84 USD\n- **Deposit**: $134.01 USD (payable at pick-up)\n- **Drive Away Price**: $198.84 USD (approximate)\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n\n### Included in Rental\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Pick-Up and Drop-Off Details\n- **Pick-Up Location**: \n  - **Address**: 51-53, Mort Street, Shop 5, Braddon, Australia, ACT 2612\n  - **Time**: December 20, 2024, at 3:00 PM\n- **Drop-Off Location**: \n  - **Address**: 55, Pirrama Road, Entry via Bus/Light Rail Interchange, Pyrmont, Australia, NSW 2009\n  - **Time**: December 21, 2024, at 9:00 PM\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier**: Budget\n- **Rating**: 9.2/10 (Superb, based on 87 reviews)\n- **Pick-Up Time Rating**: 8.5/10\n- **Drop-Off Time Rating**: 9.3/10\n- **Location Rating**: 9.5/10\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment at Pick-Up**: The main driver must have a credit or debit card in their own name.\n- **Security Deposit**: $200 AUD (approximately $134.01 USD) is required at pick-up.\n- **Damage Excess**: $5,445 AUD (approximately $3,648.42 USD) may be charged in case of damage or theft.\n\n### Extras Available\n- **Additional Driver**: $10.14 USD per rental (max 3)\n- **Baby Seat**: $26.80 USD per rental (max 2, for babies up to 9 kg)\n- **Booster Seat**: $40.58 USD per rental (max 2, for children 18-45 kg)\n\n### Insurance Package\n- **Full Protection**: $87.37 USD (includes coverage for damage or theft, with free cancellation)\n\nIf you have any further questions or need assistance with booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 2, "total_call_num": 2, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including detailed information about the vehicle, pricing, pick-up and drop-off details, and additional options."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
