redit or debit card in their own name at pickup.\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: $7.32 USD per rental\n2. **Baby Seat**: $29.28 USD per rental (for babies up to 9 kg)\n3. **Booster Seat**: $29.28 USD per rental (for children 18-45 kg)\n4. **Child Seat**: $29.28 USD per rental (for children 9-18 kg)\n\nIf you need any further assistance or wish to proceed with the booking, please let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 2, "total_call_num": 2, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information about the vehicle and rental details is addressed, including pickup and drop-off locations, vehicle specifications, rental duration, pricing, and additional options."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
