iver must have a credit card in their own name.\n- **Security Deposit**: $3,685.28 AUD (refundable upon return if no damages)\n- **Damage Excess**: $5,500 AUD (covered by Full Protection if purchased)\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: $4.69 USD (per rental)\n2. **Snow Chains**: $11.06 USD (per rental)\n3. **Baby Seat**: $11.06 USD (per rental)\n4. **Booster Seat**: $11.06 USD (per rental)\n5. **Child Seat**: $11.06 USD (per rental)\n\n### Supplier Contact\n- **Supplier**: Europcar\n- **Rating**: 8.8/10 (Fabulous)\n- **Pick-Up Instructions**: Provided at the time of booking.\n\n### Next Steps\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need any additional information?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 2, "total_call_num": 2, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
