ion\n\n### Summary\n- **Lowest Price:** US$228.73 (Hyundai Accent & Chevrolet Spark)\n- **Highest Price:** US$239.04 (Nissan Sentra)\n\nAll vehicles are provided by **Dollar** and include unlimited mileage and free cancellation. The prices are approximate and converted from Indian Rupees (INR) to US Dollars (USD) for your convenience. \n\nWould you like to proceed with a booking or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
