: "Here are the details for your friend's car rental at Munich Airport:\n\n### Car Rental Details\n- **Pick-Up Location:** Munich Airport (Terminalstraße Mitte, Airportcenter, Ebene 3, München, Germany)\n  - **Date:** November 18, 2024\n  - **Time:** 09:00 AM\n- **Drop-Off Location:** Berlin Downtown - Alex (8, Alexanderplatz, Berlin, Germany)\n  - **Date:** November 23, 2024\n  - **Time:** 03:00 PM\n\n### Vehicle Information\n- **Vehicle Model:** Volkswagen Polo\n- **Type:** Economy\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Suitcases:** 1 small, 0 big\n- **Mileage Allowance:** 2400 kilometres per rental\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Europcar\n- **Supplier Rating:** 8.0 (Very Good) based on 4,024 reviews\n- **Opening Times:**\n  - **Pick-Up:** 07:00 AM - 12:00 AM\n  - **Drop-Off:** 00:00 AM - 12:00 AM\n- **Pick-Up Instructions:** The desk is in the 'Munich Airport Center' (located between Terminals 1 and 2).\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Base Price:** $253.12 (USD)\n- **Drive Away Price:** $312.38 (USD)\n- **Deposit:** $253.12 (USD)\n- **One Way Fee:** $55.00 (EUR)\n- **Theft Excess:** $950.00 (EUR)\n- **Damage Excess:** $950.00 (EUR)\n\n### Insurance Packages\n- **Full Protection Package:**\n  - **Price:** $103.23 (USD)\n  - **Coverage Includes:**\n    - Damage Excess & Theft Excess (covers up to $1,023.63)\n    - Windows, mirrors, wheels, and tyres\n    - Key loss & roadside assistance\n  - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation available\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.0 (Very Good)\n- **Recent Reviews:**\n  1. **Rating:** 5.7 (Solo Traveller)\n     - **Feedback:** \"Car had so many scratches and finally Europcar did not mark them all.\"\n  2. **Rating:** 8.9 (Family)\n     - **Feedback:** \"Got a free upgrade; staff didn't push for additional insurance.\"\n  3. **Rating:** 8.3 (Group)\n     - **Feedback:** \"Fast drop-off, but long wait during pickup.\"\n  4. **Rating:** 7.4 (Couple)\n     - **Feedback:** \"Car performed well, but pickup process was a nightmare.\"\n  5. **Rating:** 9.1 (Family)\n     - **Feedback:** \"Staff upgraded the vehicle; drop-off location was confusing.\"\n\n### Summary\nYour friend can rent a **Volkswagen Polo** from **Europcar** at Munich Airport. The total cost for the rental is **$312.38**, including all fees. Adding the **Full Protection insurance** will cost an additional **$103.23**. The supplier has a good reputation, but recent reviews suggest some minor issues during pickup and drop-off.\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
