es:** 1 small\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** 1500 kilometres per rental\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n\n### Insurance Packages\n- **Insurance Option:** Full Protection\n- **Total Protection Price:** $103.23 USD\n- **Coverage Includes:**\n  - Damage Excess & Theft Excess (Covers up to $1,293 USD)\n  - Windows, mirrors, wheels, and tires\n  - Key loss & roadside assistance\n- **Cancellation:** Free cancellation available\n\n### Additional Fees\n- **One-Way Fee:** €55\n- **Deposit:** €500\n- **Theft Excess:** €1,200\n- **Damage Excess:** €1,200\n- **Mileage Fee:** €0.54 per km beyond 1500 km\n\nIf your friend needs any further assistance or wishes to proceed with the booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
