}, {"score": "9.3", "title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.3, "displayValue": "9.3"}}, {"title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "8.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}}], "subtitle": "2,448 reviews", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.4", "rawValue": 8.4}, "average": "8.4", "title": "Very good"}, "name": "Sixt"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"details": {"disclaimers": {"title": "Exclusions apply."}, "priceDisplay": {"displayPrice": "US$93.85", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "title": "Total protection price"}, "pageTitle": "Protect your excess?", "footer": {"placeholders": [{"link": {"title": "Insurance information"}, "type": "LINK", "id": "{link}"}], "body": "For details of who provides and distributes the insurance available on our platform: {link}\n\n(The cover price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees.)"}}, "type": "insurance", "forcedStepCta": {"bookWithout": "Go to book without Full Protection", "bookWith": "Go to book with Full Protection"}, "id": "RC_FULL_PROTECTION", "cta": {"attach": "Add Full Protection", "remove": "Remove Full Protection"}, "metadata": {"displayPrice": {"prePayable": true, "amount": 93.85, "currency": "USD"}, "name": "Insurance", "id": "b7aaa789-7999-4bc4-adab-d27e9dacc0c2", "basePrice": {"amount": 7893.16, "prePayable": true, "currency": "INR"}}, "price": {"displayPrice": "US$93.85", "label": "Total protection price", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}}, "moreInformation": {"label": "Protection options", "calloutBanner": {"title": "Please note:", "content": "Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars."}, "moreInfoData": {"body": {"atAGlance": {"title": "Full Protection is typically much cheaper than over-the-counter protection (the protection price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees).", "list": [{"title": "Damage Excess & Theft Excess", "content": "Your car comes with standard damage cover (CDW) with an excess of US$1,942.13 and Theft Protection (TP) with an excess of US$1,942.13. If the bodywork is damaged or the car is stolen, the car hire company could charge you up to the excess amount - but Rentalcover.com will refund you."}, {"content": "Protection products often have exclusions, but Full Protection protects every exterior and mechanical part of your car, from wheels and windows to engine, roof & undercarriage.", "title": "Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres"}, {"content": "If you break down, lose your key(s) or lock yourself out, Rentalcover.com will refund any call-out charges, towing fees and key replacement costs.", "title": "Key loss & roadside assistance"}]}}, "header": {"subtitle": "Make sure you're fully protected on your rental car", "title": "Full Protection"}}, "priceDisplay": {"title": "Total protection price", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "displayPrice": "US$93.85"}}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Details for Your Friend\n\n#### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name**: Sixt\n- **Location**: Terminal 2 Landside Arrivals, London, United Kingdom, TW6 1EF\n- **Rating**: 8.4 out of 10 (Very Good)\n- **Contact Information**: \n  - **Opening Times**:\n    - **Pick-up (1 Dec)**: 07:00 - 22:00\n    - **Drop-off (6 Dec)**: 08:00 - 18:00\n  - **Pick-up Instructions**: \n    - **T2/T3**: Branch in T2 Arrivals hall. From T3, wait at Bus Stop 17 for a Shuttle or make your own way to T2.\n    - **T5**: Follow signs for Car Rental, pass exits of Heathrow Express and London Underground, take the elevator to the first floor, and turn right to reach the Sixt counter.\n\n#### Reviews\n- **Overall Rating**: 8.4 (Very Good)\n- **Customer Reviews**:\n  - **Positive Feedback**:\n    - \"The service both when collecting the car and returning was outstanding.\" (Rating: 9.4)\n    - \"The staff were very nice especially Sonija.\" (Rating: 9.7)\n  - **Negative Feedback**:\n    - \"It is virtually impossible to find the car rental return location.\" (Rating: 9.4)\n    - \"We arrived at the airport after a long flight with our baby and went to the Sixt counter to be told that our luggage wouldn't fit in the car we booked.\" (Rating: 6.3)\n\n#### Vehicle Details\n- **Vehicle Type**: Volkswagen Polo (Economy)\n- **Features**:\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 4\n  - **Transmission**: Manual\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: 900 miles per rental\n- **Price**:\n  - **Drive Away Price**: $276.67 (approx.)\n  - **Deposit**: $300 (refundable)\n\n#### Insurance Packages\n- **Full Protection Package**:\n  - **Total Protection Price**: $93.85 (Free cancellation)\n  - **Coverage Includes**:\n    - **Damage Excess & Theft Excess**: Refund up to $1,942.13 if the car is damaged or stolen.\n    - **Comprehensive Protection**: Covers all exterior and mechanical parts (wheels, windows, engine, roof, undercarriage).\n    - **Key Loss & Roadside Assistance**: Refunds call-out charges, towing fees, and key replacement costs.\n  - **Note**: Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars.\n\n### Summary\nYour friend can rent a Volkswagen Polo from Sixt at London Heathrow Airport for approximately **$276.67** with a **$300 deposit**. The insurance package costs **$93.85** for comprehensive coverage. The supplier has a good rating (8.4/10), and the vehicle includes essential features like air conditioning and manual transmission. \n\nWould you like to proceed with booking or need more details?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
