ing the car and caused a big hassle. The staff was really helpful tho through it all. ", "epochDay": 20020, "rating": "9.1", "type": "Group", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.1, "displayValue": "9.1"}, "date": "Thu, Oct 24 2024", "positive": "Staff was so kind and the process was so fast and easy. Car was way better than I expected too. "}, {"positive": "Quite smooth", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.4", "rawValue": 7.4}, "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024", "type": "Couple", "rating": "7.4", "epochDay": 20013, "negative": "Car parked fair distance from rental desk, staff good but not very friendly"}, {"type": "Solo traveller", "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.6", "rawValue": 6.6}, "negative": "I found it ridiculous that a EURO 1100 hold deposit was needed when picking the car up.", "epochDay": 20013, "rating": "6.6"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8", "rawValue": 8}, "date": "Mon, Oct 14 2024", "type": "Group", "epochDay": 20010, "rating": "8.0", "negative": "The AVIS representative downstairs by the car was not very friendly. Damage to the car consisted of  2 sizable dents on each side of the car, small dent in the hood, and scratches under the hatchback on the suitcase storage surface. The steering wheel was too sensitive. Sitting in the back seat was uncomfortable  due to the bounciness of the car there.  The car was described as a hybrid. However, this was", "positive": "I liked the room in the car, spacious enough for 4 adults. The car ran smoothly. "}]}}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"customerReviews": {"reviews": [{"type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 10, "displayValue": "10"}, "positive": "New car with purple color made it easy to find in parking lots", "rating": "10", "date": "Thu, Oct 24 2024", "epochDay": 20020}, {"date": "Thu, Oct 24 2024", "rating": "9.1", "negative": "When googling Avis for drop off, Google took us to a fake location in the Noord that did not exist. Made us late returning the car and caused a big hassle. The staff was really helpful tho through it all. ", "epochDay": 20020, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.1", "rawValue": 9.1}, "positive": "Staff was so kind and the process was so fast and easy. Car was way better than I expected too. ", "type": "Group"}, {"type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.4", "rawValue": 7.4}, "positive": "Quite smooth", "epochDay": 20013, "negative": "Car parked fair distance from rental desk, staff good but not very friendly", "rating": "7.4", "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024"}, {"type": "Solo traveller", "epochDay": 20013, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.6, "displayValue": "6.6"}, "negative": "I found it ridiculous that a EURO 1100 hold deposit was needed when picking the car up.", "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024", "rating": "6.6"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8", "rawValue": 8}, "positive": "I liked the room in the car, spacious enough for 4 adults. The car ran smoothly. ", "type": "Group", "epochDay": 20010, "date": "Mon, Oct 14 2024", "rating": "8.0", "negative": "The AVIS representative downstairs by the car was not very friendly. Damage to the car consisted of  2 sizable dents on each side of the car, small dent in the hood, and scratches under the hatchback on the suitcase storage surface. The steering wheel was too sensitive. Sitting in the back seat was uncomfortable  due to the bounciness of the car there.  The car was described as a hybrid. However, this was"}], "title": "Customer reviews", "sort": {"pageTitle": "Sort by", "ctaTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"label": "Newest first", "id": "date.descending"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}}}, "supplier": {"title": "Rental company", "name": "Avis", "rating": {"average": "8.7", "subtitle": "1,885 reviews", "breakdown": [{"title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "score": "8.4", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.4", "rawValue": 8.4}}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.8", "rawValue": 8.8}, "title": "Helpfulness", "score": "8.8"}, {"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.9, "displayValue": "7.9"}, "title": "Pick-up speed", "score": "7.9"}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "score": "9.3", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.3, "displayValue": "9.3"}}, {"score": "9.1", "title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.1", "rawValue": 9.1}}], "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.7", "rawValue": 8.7}, "title": "Fabulous"}}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"details": {"priceDisplay": {"suffix": "Free cancellation", "title": "Total protection price", "displayPrice": "US$88.36"}, "disclaimers": {"title": "Exclusions apply."}, "footer": {"body": "For details of who provides and distributes the insurance available on our platform: {link}\n\n(The cover price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees.)", "placeholders": [{"id": "{link}", "type": "LINK", "link": {"title": "Insurance information"}}]}, "pageTitle": "Protect your excess?"}, "cta": {"attach": "Add Full Protection", "remove": "Remove Full Protection"}, "metadata": {"name": "Insurance", "id": "540fe5f2-1c41-4d19-8b7a-ff059e940fa9", "basePrice": {"amount": 7431.71, "currency": "INR", "prePayable": true}, "displayPrice": {"prePayable": true, "currency": "USD", "amount": 88.36}}, "price": {"label": "Total protection price", "displayPrice": "US$88.36", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}}, "forcedStepCta": {"bookWith": "Go to book with Full Protection", "bookWithout": "Go to book without Full Protection"}, "type": "insurance", "id": "RC_FULL_PROTECTION", "moreInformation": {"priceDisplay": {"suffix": "Free cancellation", "title": "Total protection price", "displayPrice": "US$88.36"}, "moreInfoData": {"body": {"atAGlance": {"title": "Full Protection is typically much cheaper than over-the-counter protection (the protection price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees).", "list": [{"content": "Your car comes with standard damage cover (CDW) with an excess of US$1,629.72 and Theft Protection (TP) with an excess of US$1,629.72. If the bodywork is damaged or the car is stolen, the car hire company could charge you up to the excess amount - but Rentalcover.com will refund you.", "title": "Damage Excess & Theft Excess"}, {"content": "Protection products often have exclusions, but Full Protection protects every exterior and mechanical part of your car, from wheels and windows to engine, roof & undercarriage.", "title": "Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres"}, {"content": "If you break down, lose your key(s) or lock yourself out, Rentalcover.com will refund any call-out charges, towing fees and key replacement costs.", "title": "Key loss & roadside assistance"}]}}, "header": {"title": "Full Protection", "subtitle": "Make sure you're fully protected on your rental car"}}, "calloutBanner": {"title": "Please note:", "content": "Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars."}, "label": "Protection options"}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the details for your friend's car rental at Amsterdam Schiphol Airport:\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Avis\n- **Address:** 5, Aankomstpassage, Amsterdam, Holland, 1118 AX\n- **Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous) based on 1,885 reviews\n- **Opening Hours for Pickup (November 8th):** 07:00 - 22:00\n- **Opening Hours for Drop-off (November 13th):** 08:00 - 18:00\n\n### Vehicle Details\n- **Vehicle Type:** Mini car\n- **Model:** Toyota Aygo\n- **Transmission:** Manual gearbox\n- **Seats:** 4\n- **Doors:** 4\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Drive Away Price:** $172.25 USD\n- **Deposit:** $172.25 USD\n- **Base Price:** $14,487.30 INR (approximately $172.25 USD)\n- **Insurance Package (Full Protection):** $88.36 USD (includes all applicable taxes and fees, with free cancellation)\n\n### Insurance Coverage Details (Full Protection)\n- **Damage Excess & Theft Excess:** Covers up to $1,629.72 USD. If the car is damaged or stolen, the rental company may charge up to this amount, but Rentalcover.com will refund you.\n- **Comprehensive Coverage:** Protects every exterior and mechanical part of the car, including wheels, windows, engine, roof, and undercarriage.\n- **Additional Benefits:** Covers call-out charges, towing fees, and key replacement costs if you break down, lose your keys, or lock yourself out.\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous)\n- **Key Aspects:**\n  - **Value for Money:** 8.4\n  - **Helpfulness:** 8.8\n  - **Pickup Speed:** 7.9\n  - **Drop-off Speed:** 9.3\n  - **Car Cleanliness:** 9.1\n\n#### Sample Reviews:\n1. **Rating:** 10/10  \n   **Comment:** \"New car with purple color made it easy to find in parking lots.\"  \n   **Type:** Couple  \n   **Date:** October 24, 2024\n\n2. **Rating:** 9.1/10  \n   **Positive:** \"Staff was so kind and the process was so fast and easy. Car was way better than I expected too.\"  \n   **Negative:** \"When googling Avis for drop off, Google took us to a fake location in the Noord that did not exist.\"  \n   **Type:** Group  \n   **Date:** October 24, 2024\n\n3. **Rating:** 7.4/10  \n   **Positive:** \"Quite smooth.\"  \n   **Negative:** \"Car parked fair distance from rental desk, staff good but not very friendly.\"  \n   **Type:** Couple  \n   **Date:** October 17, 2024\n\n### Summary\nYour friend can rent a **Toyota Aygo** from **Avis** at **Amsterdam Schiphol Airport** for **$172.25 USD**. The insurance package (**Full Protection**) is available for **$88.36 USD**, providing comprehensive coverage. The supplier has excellent reviews, especially for drop-off speed and car cleanliness.\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
