asy to use.", "epochDay": 19981, "type": "Family", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.7", "rawValue": 9.7}}]}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"metadata": {"displayPrice": {"amount": 92.57, "prePayable": true, "currency": "USD"}, "name": "Insurance", "id": "26f197bf-ebc1-4102-b4a2-6fca298485db", "basePrice": {"amount": 7785.6, "currency": "INR", "prePayable": true}}, "type": "insurance", "price": {"label": "Total protection price", "displayPrice": "US$92.57", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}}, "moreInformation": {"priceDisplay": {"displayPrice": "US$92.57", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "title": "Total protection price"}, "calloutBanner": {"content": "Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars.", "title": "Please note:"}, "label": "Protection options", "moreInfoData": {"body": {"atAGlance": {"title": "Full Protection is typically much cheaper than over-the-counter protection (the protection price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees).", "list": [{"title": "Damage Excess & Theft Excess", "content": "Your car comes with standard damage cover (CDW) with an excess of US$824.86 and Theft Protection (TP) with an excess of US$565.62. If the bodywork is damaged or the car is stolen, the car hire company could charge you up to the excess amount - but Rentalcover.com will refund you."}, {"title": "Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres", "content": "Protection products often have exclusions, but Full Protection protects every exterior and mechanical part of your car, from wheels and windows to engine, roof & undercarriage."}, {"title": "Key loss & roadside assistance", "content": "If you break down, lose your key(s) or lock yourself out, Rentalcover.com will refund any call-out charges, towing fees and key replacement costs."}]}}, "header": {"subtitle": "Make sure you're fully protected on your rental car", "title": "Full Protection"}}}, "cta": {"attach": "Add Full Protection", "remove": "Remove Full Protection"}, "id": "RC_FULL_PROTECTION", "details": {"pageTitle": "Protect your excess?", "priceDisplay": {"suffix": "Free cancellation", "displayPrice": "US$92.57", "title": "Total protection price"}, "footer": {"placeholders": [{"type": "LINK", "id": "{link}", "link": {"title": "Insurance information"}}], "body": "For details of who provides and distributes the insurance available on our platform: {link}\n\n(The cover price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees.)"}, "disclaimers": {"title": "Exclusions apply."}}, "forcedStepCta": {"bookWith": "Go to book with Full Protection", "bookWithout": "Go to book without Full Protection"}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the details for your friend's car rental from Stockholm Arlanda Airport to Gothenburg:\n\n### Car Rental Details\n- **Pick-Up Location**: Stockholm Arlanda Airport (ARN)\n  - **Address**: 4, Vingvägen, Building 182, Stockholm, Sweden, 190 60\n  - **Pick-Up Date & Time**: November 30, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n  - **Opening Hours**: 07:00 AM - 08:00 PM\n  - **Instructions**: Proceed to the Europcar desk located in the car rental center. Flight number is mandatory.\n\n- **Drop-Off Location**: Gothenburg Downtown - Grafiska Vagen\n  - **Address**: 4, Grafiska vägen, Din Bil, Göteborg, Sweden, 412 64\n  - **Drop-Off Date & Time**: December 5, 2024, at 02:00 PM\n  - **Opening Hours**: Open 24 hours\n\n### Vehicle Information\n- **Vehicle**: Seat Arona (Compact car)\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Seats**: 5\n- **Doors**: 4\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Suitcases**: 1 small, 0 big\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Drive Away Price**: $326.36 USD\n- **Base Price**: $170.93 USD\n- **Deposit**: $170.93 USD\n- **Fees**:\n  - **Administration Fee**: $250 SEK\n  - **Theft Excess**: $6000 SEK\n  - **One Way Fee**: $1649 SEK\n  - **Damage Excess**: $8750 SEK\n\n### Insurance Packages\n- **Full Protection Insurance**: $92.57 USD\n  - **Coverage**:\n    - **Damage Excess & Theft Excess**: Refund for charges up to $824.86 USD (damage) and $565.62 USD (theft).\n    - **Windows, Mirrors, Wheels & Tyres**: Full coverage for all exterior and mechanical parts.\n    - **Key Loss & Roadside Assistance**: Refund for call-out charges, towing fees, and key replacement costs.\n  - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation.\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier**: Europcar\n- **Rating**: 8.7/10 (Fabulous) based on 1,107 reviews\n- **Customer Reviews**:\n  1. **Rating**: 10/10 (Couple) - \"Fuss free rental experience!\"\n  2. **Rating**: 6/10 (Family) - \"Car was good, but baby seat was dirty.\"\n  3. **Rating**: 7.7/10 (Couple) - \"Received charges after car return without notice.\"\n  4. **Rating**: 10/10 (Solo Traveller) - \"👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻\"\n  5. **Rating**: 9.7/10 (Family) - \"Shuttle is frequent and easy to use.\"\n\n### Summary\n- **Total Estimated Cost**: $326.36 USD (drive away price) + $92.57 USD (insurance) = **$418.93 USD**\n- **Deposit Required**: $170.93 USD\n\nIf your friend needs further assistance or wishes to proceed with the booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including supplier details, reviews, and prices of the insurance packages."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
