isedRating": {"rawValue": 8, "displayValue": "8"}}, {"negative": "Das war eine Katastrofe\nWiE kan eine grosse internationale\nFirma so viel Fehler machen mit\nEinem Kund ?\nIch Werde bald eine Reklamation\nSenden.\n\nDr. Vilma Stenius\n\n", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 4, "displayValue": "4"}, "epochDay": 20009, "positive": "Das war eine Katastrofe\nWie kan eine grosse internationale Firma\nSo fiel Fehler machen mit einem\nKund ? Och werde bald eine Reklamation\nSenden.", "type": "Solo traveller", "rating": "4.0", "date": "Sun, Oct 13 2024"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.1", "rawValue": 9.1}, "type": "Couple", "positive": "The ease of pickup however I was not aware I required an International drivers licence until I arrived at the counter. ", "epochDay": 20006, "date": "Thu, Oct 10 2024", "rating": "9.1"}, {"type": "Family", "positive": "Pick- up and drop-off were quick and efficient.  Staff were excellent.  No quibbles or problems at all.  It was a refreshing change to get the exact car we had booked.", "epochDay": 19999, "date": "Thu, Oct 3 2024", "rating": "9.1", "negative": "Directions for the pick-up and drop- off locations were not detailed enough and did not match signage at the airport.", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.1", "rawValue": 9.1}}, {"rating": "2.0", "date": "Fri, Sept 20 2024", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 2, "displayValue": "2"}, "negative": "I never got the car… can you please help me to get at least some partial refund. Thank you very much. Your help would be greatly appreciated. I been a long time customer ", "epochDay": 19986, "type": "Solo traveller"}], "sort": {"options": {"items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"id": "date.descending", "label": "Newest first"}, {"label": "Oldest first", "id": "date.ascending"}], "default": "score.descending"}, "ctaTitle": "Sort by", "pageTitle": "Sort by"}}}, "map": {"location": {"address": "Flughafen Wien-Schwechat, Parkhaus 4, Wien, Austria, 1300", "coordinates": {"longitude": 16.5608, "latitude": 48.12}, "title": "Supplier location"}}}}, {"api_status": true, "content": "There is a problem with your api call, please double-check for possible problems."}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"type": "insurance", "cta": {"attach": "Add Full Protection", "remove": "Remove Full Protection"}, "price": {"displayPrice": "US$103.23", "label": "Total protection price", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}}, "details": {"priceDisplay": {"title": "Total protection price", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "displayPrice": "US$103.23"}, "disclaimers": {"title": "Exclusions apply."}, "footer": {"body": "For details of who provides and distributes the insurance available on our platform: {link}\n\n(The cover price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees.)", "placeholders": [{"id": "{link}", "link": {"title": "Insurance information"}, "type": "LINK"}]}, "pageTitle": "Protect your excess?"}, "moreInformation": {"calloutBanner": {"content": "Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars.", "title": "Please note:"}, "priceDisplay": {"displayPrice": "US$103.23", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "title": "Total protection price"}, "label": "Protection options", "moreInfoData": {"body": {"atAGlance": {"title": "Full Protection is typically much cheaper than over-the-counter protection (the protection price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees).", "list": [{"title": "Damage Excess & Theft Excess", "content": "Your car comes with standard damage cover (CDW) with an excess of US$1,616.25 and Theft Protection (TP) with an excess of US$1,616.25. If the bodywork is damaged or the car is stolen, the car hire company could charge you up to the excess amount - but Rentalcover.com will refund you."}, {"title": "Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres", "content": "Protection products often have exclusions, but Full Protection protects every exterior and mechanical part of your car, from wheels and windows to engine, roof & undercarriage."}, {"title": "Key loss & roadside assistance", "content": "If you break down, lose your key(s) or lock yourself out, Rentalcover.com will refund any call-out charges, towing fees and key replacement costs."}]}}, "header": {"title": "Full Protection", "subtitle": "Make sure you're fully protected on your rental car"}}}, "forcedStepCta": {"bookWithout": "Go to book without Full Protection", "bookWith": "Go to book with Full Protection"}, "id": "RC_FULL_PROTECTION", "metadata": {"basePrice": {"currency": "INR", "prePayable": true, "amount": 8682.48}, "name": "Insurance", "id": "309e0c88-630e-410c-add6-26f49f93a6af", "displayPrice": {"currency": "USD", "prePayable": true, "amount": 103.23}}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the details for your friend's car rental at Vienna International Airport:\n\n### Car Rental Details\n- **Pick-Up Location:** Vienna International Airport\n  - **Address:** Flughafen Wien-Schwechat, Parkhaus 4, Wien, Austria, 1300\n  - **Pick-Up Date & Time:** December 10, 2024, at 08:00 AM\n- **Drop-Off Location:** Salzburg Airport W. A. Mozart\n  - **Address:** 95, Innsbrucker Bundesstraße, Salzburg, Austria, 5020\n  - **Drop-Off Date & Time:** December 15, 2024, at 05:00 PM\n- **Vehicle:** Volkswagen Polo\n  - **Type:** Economy\n  - **Transmission:** Manual\n  - **Seats:** 4\n  - **Doors:** 4\n  - **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n  - **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n  - **Suitcases:** Small (0), Big (0)\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Base Price:** $298.13 USD (approx.)\n- **Total Drive Away Price:** $298.13 USD\n- **Deposit:** $298.13 USD\n- **Fee Breakdown:**\n  - **Administration Fee:** $71 EUR\n  - **Theft Excess:** $1500 EUR\n  - **Damage Excess:** $1500 EUR\n  - **Deposit:** $1000 EUR\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Megadrive\n- **Supplier Rating:** 8.4/10 (Very Good) based on 2,520 reviews\n- **Pick-Up Instructions:** \n  - Exit the baggage claim area, turn left and walk through the pedestrian tunnel to Car park 4 (P4). The desk is on level 0. Serviced by Buchbinder.\n- **Opening Times:**\n  - **Pick-Up (Dec 10):** 08:00 AM - 04:00 PM\n  - **Drop-Off (Dec 15):** 00:00 AM - 12:00 AM\n\n### Insurance Packages\n- **Full Protection Package:**\n  - **Total Protection Price:** $103.23 USD\n  - **Coverage Includes:**\n    - Damage Excess & Theft Excess (up to $1,616.25 USD)\n    - Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres\n    - Key loss & roadside assistance\n  - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.4/10\n  - **Value for Money:** 8.0\n  - **Helpfulness:** 8.4\n  - **Pick-Up Speed:** 7.7\n  - **Drop-Off Speed:** 9.0\n  - **Car Cleanliness:** 9.0\n\n#### Recent Reviews:\n1. **Couple (Oct 24, 2024):** \n   - *Positive:* Professional staff at the counter, easy drop-off.\n   - *Negative:* Long waiting time at pick-up.\n   - **Rating:** 8.0/10\n   \n2. **Solo Traveller (Oct 13, 2024):**\n   - *Negative:* Issues with customer service and errors.\n   - **Rating:** 4.0/10\n\n3. **Couple (Oct 10, 2024):**\n   - *Positive:* Easy pick-up process.\n   - **Rating:** 9.1/10\n\n4. **Family (Oct 3, 2024):**\n   - *Positive:* Quick and efficient pick-up and drop-off.\n   - *Negative:* Directions for locations were not detailed enough.\n   - **Rating:** 9.1/10\n\nIf your friend would like to proceed with the booking or needs further assistance, feel free to ask!"}], "message": [{"error_type": "value_error", "content": "Parameter search_key value is not correct in prediction."}], "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including supplier details, reviews, and insurance package prices."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
