 Denmark, 2770", "name": "Sixt", "pickup_instructions": "T1: In parking area P1. Signposted from the Arrivals Hall. T2 & T3: Its a 12 minute walk to the office, or use other complimentary shuttle bus service from the Clarion Hotel. If you need any help, please call 004532462944 / 004532462943.", "may_require_credit_card_guarantee": false}, "rating_info": {"average": 8.5, "location": 8.7, "cleanliness": 9, "dropoff_time": 9.5, "average_text": "Excellent", "no_of_ratings": 1691, "efficiency": 8.9, "condition": 8.8, "pickup_time": 6.8, "value_for_money": 8.2}, "content": {"supplier": {"rating": {"subtitle": "1,691 reviews", "average": "8.5", "title": "Very good", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.5, "displayValue": "8.5"}}, "name": "Sixt"}, "badges": [{"type": "CONSTRUCTIVE", "text": "Free cancellation", "variation": "DEFAULT"}, {"type": "ACCENT", "variation": "DEFAULT", "text": "Fully electric"}]}, "freebies": ["Amendments"], "fee_info": {"tax": 0, "fee": 0}}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Vehicle_Supplier_Details", "arguments": {"vehicle_id": "731078736", "search_key": ""}}, {"name": "Vehicle_Supplier_Review", "arguments": {"vehicle_id": "731078736", "search_key": ""}}, {"name": "Get_Packages", "arguments": {"vehicle_id": "731078736", "search_key": ""}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"reviews": {"customerReviews": {"sort": {"ctaTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"label": "Newest first", "id": "date.descending"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}], "default": "score.descending"}, "pageTitle": "Sort by"}, "reviews": [{"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "type": "Family", "rating": "9.4", "date": "Mon, Oct 21 2024", "epochDay": 20017, "positive": "Var drive very Well. And quiet. Got the bridge toll added at counter which helped", "negative": "Adblue Low indicator came on a few times which i Disney know how to handle. Gas tank was not intuitivele placed"}, {"date": "Sun, Sept 29 2024", "rating": "9.4", "epochDay": 19995, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "type": "Couple", "negative": "I was told the fuel tank was full at pick, but it was actually just over half."}, {"epochDay": 19993, "positive": "SCAM ALERT!!! I found a low price for a rental with Sixt on booking.com. When I checked in, I was given a low quality car and made to pay charges above the agreed upon amount I reserved through Booking.com. Even WORSE, Sixt is charging me 500euro that they claim I made a tiny scratch on the car. There was no damage done to this car during my rental, it was impossible as we drove from the airport to our Airbnb and parked in a private driveway with zero other cars. There were many scratches already on the car when I picked it up and no agent documented the condition. They claim I did damage and they previous rental return inspection proves it was me, but they refuse to produce any documents form that inspection.  ", "negative": "I was fooled by the low price… they switched the car and made me paid extra charges at pickup. Now they charge me 500 euro for damage I did not do! They are running a scam, surely this will also happen to the next person renting this car. ", "type": "Family", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 4, "displayValue": "4"}, "date": "Fri, Sept 27 2024", "rating": "4.0"}, {"epochDay": 19981, "positive": "Car wasn’t ready at fast track when I got there . \nAnd price was very high for that kind of car. Rented a suv before and for half the price. \n", "negative": "Car wasn’t ready at fast track when I got there . \nAnd price was very high for that kind of car. Rented a suv before and for half the price. \n", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8", "rawValue": 8}, "type": "Family", "date": "Sun, Sept 15 2024", "rating": "8.0"}, {"positive": "Size of car is very useful for our family of 4 people with 4 big size luggage.  ", "epochDay": 19978, "negative": "I think we should have to inspect the car with someone before taking the car.  But only one at the counter with a paper describe the damage points.  This is made some unreliable when we return the car.", "date": "Thu, Sept 12 2024", "rating": "7.1", "type": "Family", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.1, "displayValue": "7.1"}}], "title": "Customer reviews"}, "supplier": {"rating": {"subtitle": "1,691 reviews", "average": "8.5", "title": "Very good", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.5", "rawValue": 8.5}, "breakdown": [{"score": "8.2", "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.2, "displayValue": "8.2"}}, {"title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "score": "8.9"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.8", "rawValue": 6.8}, "title": "Pick-up speed", "score": "6.8"}, {"score": "9.5", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.5, "displayValue": "9.5"}, "title": "Drop-off speed"}, {"score": "9.0", "title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9", "rawValue": 9}}]}, "title": "Rental company", "name": "Sixt"}}, "details": {"openingTimes": {"title": "Opening times", "pickUp": {"subtitle": "Sixt, Copenhagen Airport", "hours": "07:00 - 23:00", "title": "Pick-up (20 Dec)"}, "dropOff": {"subtitle": "Sixt, Aarhus - Aarhus C", "title": "Drop-off (25 Dec)", "hours": "08:00 - 17:00"}}, "location": {"address": "Lufthavnsboulevarden 5, Kastrup, Denmark, 2770"}, "supplier": {"name": "Sixt", "rating": {"breakdown": [{"score": "8.2", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.2, "displayValue": "8.2"}, "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire"}, {"score": "8.9", "title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}}, {"score": "6.8", "title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.8", "rawValue": 6.8}}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRat