and made to pay charges above the agreed upon amount I reserved through Booking.com. Even WORSE, Sixt is charging me 500euro that they claim I made a tiny scratch on the car. There was no damage done to this car during my rental, it was impossible as we drove from the airport to our Airbnb and parked in a private driveway with zero other cars. There were many scratches already on the car when I picked it up and no agent documented the condition. They claim I did damage and they previous rental return inspection proves it was me, but they refuse to produce any documents form that inspection.  ", "date": "Fri, Sept 27 2024", "type": "Family", "negative": "I was fooled by the low price… they switched the car and made me paid extra charges at pickup. Now they charge me 500 euro for damage I did not do! They are running a scam, surely this will also happen to the next person renting this car. ", "epochDay": 19993, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4", "rawValue": 4}, "rating": "4.0"}, {"positive": "Car wasn’t ready at fast track when I got there . \nAnd price was very high for that kind of car. Rented a suv before and for half the price. \n", "type": "Family", "date": "Sun, Sept 15 2024", "negative": "Car wasn’t ready at fast track when I got there . \nAnd price was very high for that kind of car. Rented a suv before and for half the price. \n", "epochDay": 19981, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8", "rawValue": 8}, "rating": "8.0"}, {"epochDay": 19978, "negative": "I think we should have to inspect the car with someone before taking the car.  But only one at the counter with a paper describe the damage points.  This is made some unreliable when we return the car.", "type": "Family", "date": "Thu, Sept 12 2024", "positive": "Size of car is very useful for our family of 4 people with 4 big size luggage.  ", "rating": "7.1", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.1", "rawValue": 7.1}}]}, "supplier": {"title": "Rental company", "rating": {"breakdown": [{"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.2, "displayValue": "8.2"}, "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "score": "8.2"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "title": "Helpfulness", "score": "8.9"}, {"score": "6.8", "title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.8, "displayValue": "6.8"}}, {"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.5, "displayValue": "9.5"}, "title": "Drop-off speed", "score": "9.5"}, {"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9, "displayValue": "9"}, "title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "9.0"}], "title": "Very good", "subtitle": "1,691 reviews", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.5", "rawValue": 8.5}, "average": "8.5"}, "name": "Sixt"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"details": {"priceDisplay": {"title": "Total protection price", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "displayPrice": "US$120.21"}, "pageTitle": "Protect your excess?", "disclaimers": {"title": "Exclusions apply."}, "footer": {"body": "For details of who provides and distributes the insurance available on our platform: {link}\n\n(The cover price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees.)", "placeholders": [{"id": "{link}", "type": "LINK", "link": {"title": "Insurance information"}}]}}, "id": "RC_FULL_PROTECTION", "cta": {"remove": "Remove Full Protection", "attach": "Add Full Protection"}, "moreInformation": {"moreInfoData": {"header": {"subtitle": "Make sure you're fully protected on your rental car", "title": "Full Protection"}, "body": {"atAGlance": {"list": [{"content": "Your car comes with standard damage cover (CDW) with an excess of US$722.25 and Theft Protection (TP) with an excess of US$722.25. If the bodywork is damaged or the car is stolen, the car hire company could charge you up to the excess amount - but Rentalcover.com will refund you.", "title": "Damage Excess & Theft Excess"}, {"title": "Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres", "content": "Protection products often have exclusions, but Full Protection protects every exterior and mechanical part of your car, from wheels and windows to engine, roof & undercarriage."}, {"content": "If you break down, lose your key(s) or lock yourself out, Rentalcover.com will refund any call-out charges, towing fees and key replacement costs.", "title": "Key loss & roadside assistance"}], "title": "Full Protection is typically much cheaper than over-the-counter protection (the protection price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees)."}}}, "calloutBanner": {"title": "Please note:", "content": "Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars."}, "priceDisplay": {"displayPrice": "US$120.21", "suffix": "Free cancellation", "title": "Total protection price"}, "label": "Protection options"}, "price": {"label": "Total protection price", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}, "displayPrice": "US$120.21"}, "type": "insurance", "metadata": {"id": "106c304a-c899-428a-9eb0-a9fade6e6f5e", "basePrice": {"prePayable": true, "currency": "INR", "amount": 10110.13}, "displayPrice": {"prePayable": true, "currency": "USD", "amount": 120.21}, "name": "Insurance"}, "forcedStepCta": {"bookWith": "Go to book with Full Protection", "bookWithout": "Go to book without Full Protection"}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the details for your friend's car rental at Copenhagen Airport:\n\n### Vehicle Information\n- **Vehicle Name:** Renault Zoe\n- **Vehicle Type:** Compact car\n- **Transmission:** Automatic\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Doors:** 5\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** 600 kilometers per rental\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n- **Fuel Type:** Fully electric\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n- **Badges:** Green Vehicle\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Total Price:** $390.99 USD\n- **Base Price:** $32,883.80 INR\n- **Deposit:** $390.99 USD\n- **One Way Fee:** $562.50 DKK\n- **Damage Excess:** $5,000 DKK\n- **Theft Excess:** $5,000 DKK\n- **Admin Fee:** $150 DKK\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Sixt\n- **Address:** Lufthavnsboulevarden 5, Kastrup, Denmark, 2770\n- **Rating:** 8.5 out of 10 (Very good)\n- **Pickup Location:** Copenhagen Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n- **Pickup Instructions:** \n  - T1: In parking area P1. Signposted from the Arrivals Hall.\n  - T2 & T3: 12-minute walk to the office or use complimentary shuttle bus service from Clarion Hotel.\n  - Contact: 004532462944 / 004532462943\n- **Opening Times:**\n  - Pickup (20 Dec): 07:00 - 23:00\n  - Dropoff (25 Dec): 08:00 - 17:00\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.5 (Based on 1,691 reviews)\n- **Rating Breakdown:**\n  - Overall Value for Money: 8.2\n  - Helpfulness: 8.9\n  - Pick-up Speed: 6.8\n  - Drop-off Speed: 9.5\n  - Car Cleanliness: 9.0\n\n#### Recent Reviews:\n1. **Rating:** 9.4 (Family)\n   - **Date:** Mon, Oct 21 2024\n   - **Positive:** \"Var drive very Well. And quiet. Got the bridge toll added at counter which helped\"\n   - **Negative:** \"Adblue Low indicator came on a few times which I didn't know how to handle. Gas tank was not intuitively placed.\"\n\n2. **Rating:** 9.4 (Couple)\n   - **Date:** Sun, Sept 29 2024\n   - **Negative:** \"I was told the fuel tank was full at pick, but it was actually just over half.\"\n\n3. **Rating:** 4.0 (Family)\n   - **Date:** Fri, Sept 27 2024\n   - **Positive:** \"SCAM ALERT!!! I found a low price for a rental with Sixt on booking.com.\"\n   - **Negative:** \"They switched the car and made me pay extra charges at pickup.\"\n\n### Insurance Packages\n- **Full Protection Price:** $120.21 USD (Free cancellation)\n- **Coverage Includes:**\n  - Damage Excess & Theft Excess refund.\n  - Protection for windows, mirrors, wheels, and tires.\n  - Key loss & roadside assistance.\n- **Exclusions:** Apply (details available in the insurance information link).\n\nIf your friend needs more details or assistance with the booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
