car, from wheels and windows to engine, roof & undercarriage."}, {"content": "If you break down, lose your key(s) or lock yourself out, Rentalcover.com will refund any call-out charges, towing fees and key replacement costs.", "title": "Key loss & roadside assistance"}], "title": "Full Protection is typically much cheaper than over-the-counter protection (the protection price you see includes all applicable taxes and fees)."}}, "header": {"subtitle": "Make sure you're fully protected on your rental car", "title": "Full Protection"}}, "label": "Protection options", "calloutBanner": {"content": "Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars.", "title": "Please note:"}}, "price": {"displayPrice": "US$111.24", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}, "label": "Total protection price"}, "cta": {"remove": "Remove Full Protection", "attach": "Add Full Protection"}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the details for your friend's car rental at Charles de Gaulle Airport:\n\n### Car Rental Details\n- **Pick-Up Location**: Paris Charles de Gaulle Airport, Terminal 2D\n- **Pick-Up Date & Time**: November 5, 2024, at 10:00 AM\n- **Drop-Off Location**: Lyon Train Station - Perrache\n- **Drop-Off Date & Time**: November 10, 2024, at 4:00 PM\n- **Vehicle**: Volkswagen ID.4 (Intermediate)\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Suitcases**: 2 small\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n  - **Features**: Fully electric\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Base Price**: $374.17 USD\n- **Drive Away Price**: $440.93 USD (approximate)\n- **Deposit**: $374.17 USD\n- **One-Way Fee**: $60 EUR\n- **Theft Excess**: $2,500 EUR\n- **Damage Excess**: $2,500 EUR\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier**: Europcar\n- **Rating**: 7.5/10 (Good)\n- **Address**: Paris Charles De Gaulle Airport, Terminal 2D, Paris, France - Mainland\n- **Opening Hours (Pick-Up)**:\n  - November 5: 08:00 AM - 10:00 PM\n- **Opening Hours (Drop-Off)**:\n  - November 10: 00:00 AM - 11:59 PM\n\n### Customer Reviews\nEuropcar has received positive feedback from customers:\n- **Overall Value for Money**: 7.4/10\n- **Helpfulness**: 7.6/10\n- **Pick-Up Speed**: 6.0/10\n- **Drop-Off Speed**: 8.5/10\n- **Car Cleanliness**: 8.0/10\n\n#### Sample Reviews:\n1. **Rating**: 4.9/5  \n   - *Negative*: \"We did not have the car I was supposed to. So we took another one and it cost us $750 CAD more.\"\n   - *Date*: August 21, 2024\n\n2. **Rating**: 7.4/10  \n   - *Positive*: \"Prep of car, clean, full tank.\"\n   - *Negative*: \"It took almost 2 hours to get it. Was not ready on time.\"\n   - *Date*: August 12, 2024\n\n### Insurance Packages\n- **Full Protection Package**: $111.24 USD\n  - **Coverage**:\n    - Damage Excess & Theft Excess: Refunds up to $2,781.63 USD if charged.\n    - Windows, mirrors, wheels & tyres: Protects every exterior and mechanical part.\n    - Key loss & roadside assistance: Refunds call-out charges and key replacement costs.\n  - **Cancellation**: Free cancellation available.\n  - **Note**: Your own car insurance is unlikely to cover hire cars.\n\n### Summary\nYour friend can rent a **Volkswagen ID.4** from **Europcar** at Charles de Gaulle Airport. The total cost for the rental is approximately **$440.93 USD**, with an option to add **Full Protection Insurance** for an additional **$111.24 USD**. Europcar has a good overall rating, though some customers noted delays during pick-up. \n\nWould your friend like to proceed with the booking or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
