Newest first"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}], "default": "score.descending"}, "pageTitle": "Sort by"}, "reviews": [{"negative": "Line so long, just 2 persons for over 20 customers", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.3, "displayValue": "8.3"}, "positive": "Staff kindness \n", "type": "Solo traveller", "epochDay": 20002, "date": "Sun, Oct 6 2024", "rating": "8.3"}, {"epochDay": 20000, "type": "Solo traveller", "positive": "Avis has quality vehicles", "rating": "8.6", "date": "Fri, Oct 4 2024", "negative": "The long wait to pick up the vehicle ", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.6, "displayValue": "8.6"}}, {"date": "Thu, Oct 3 2024", "rating": "8.9", "positive": "Great car, better than I ordered, friendly service", "type": "Solo traveller", "epochDay": 19999, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "negative": "Car hire center was said to be inside the terminal, but that is not the case, you have to take a bus first."}, {"rating": "6.9", "date": "Mon, Sept 23 2024", "epochDay": 19989, "positive": "Availability and convenience", "type": "Family", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.9", "rawValue": 6.9}, "negative": "Staff couldn't care less about the customer. \"Just sign and go\". Not even hello."}, {"positive": "I goy yo the counter and there was a line of about 30 people and just 1 person at the counter.  We got a car with the tires all worn out.   You could see the steel on the tires!!!!  I have pictures", "type": "Couple", "epochDay": 19988, "date": "Sun, Sept 22 2024", "rating": "4.0", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4", "rawValue": 4}}], "title": "Customer reviews"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"customerReviews": {"title": "Customer reviews", "reviews": [{"type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.6, "displayValue": "8.6"}, "date": "Wed, Oct 23 2024", "epochDay": 20019, "positive": "Good car, easy return ", "negative": "Terrible long wait for the car even though we are reward members! The machine wouldn't take my credit card so we had to start again at another machine.  Clerk was kind, but why not have more of them??", "rating": "8.6"}, {"epochDay": 20014, "type": "Couple", "date": "Fri, Oct 18 2024", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "10", "rawValue": 10}, "negative": "-", "rating": "10", "positive": "Value for money."}, {"epochDay": 20010, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4.9", "rawValue": 4.9}, "date": "Mon, Oct 14 2024", "type": "Group", "positive": "Received small car. Could not fit all our bags. Man at counter didn't care.", "negative": "Attitude of person", "rating": "4.9"}, {"epochDay": 19984, "type": "Solo traveller", "date": "Wed, Sept 18 2024", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.4, "displayValue": "7.4"}, "negative": "I took the first car and they told me that it had exceeded the usual mileage and that it had to be returned. I took another car and it turned out that it needed an engine oil change. Then I took a third car.", "rating": "7.4"}, {"positive": "The team member that assisted me was very helpful and friendly ", "rating": "9.7", "epochDay": 19980, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.7, "displayValue": "9.7"}, "date": "Sat, Sept 14 2024", "type": "Solo traveller"}], "sort": {"pageTitle": "Sort by", "ctaTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"items": [{"id": "score.descending", "label": "Highest scores"}, {"label": "Lowest scores", "id": "score.ascending"}, {"id": "date.descending", "label": "Newest first"}, {"label": "Oldest first", "id": "date.ascending"}], "default": "score.descending"}}}, "supplier": {"rating": {"average": "8.3", "subtitle": "163 reviews", "breakdown": [{"title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.7, "displayValue": "7.7"}, "score": "7.7"}, {"score": "8.2", "title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.2", "rawValue": 8.2}}, {"score": "7.3", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.3, "displayValue": "7.3"}, "title": "Pick-up speed"}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.5, "displayValue": "9.5"}, "score": "9.5"}, {"score": "8.8", "title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.8, "displayValue": "8.8"}}], "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.3, "displayValue": "8.3"}, "title": "Very good"}, "name": "Hertz", "title": "Rental company"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Availability at Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport\n\n#### Available Cars for Rent on **November 16, 2024** (Pickup at 7 PM)\n1. **Avis - Ford Fusion**\n   - **Type:** Full-size car\n   - **Price:** $428.62 (approx. drive-away price)\n   - **Deposit:** $250\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Rating:** 7.7 (Good) based on 264 reviews\n   - **Customer Reviews:**\n     - **Positive:** \"Staff kindness\"\n     - **Negative:** \"Long lines, only 2 staff for over 20 customers\"\n   - **Supplier Rating Breakdown:**\n     - Overall Value: 8.0\n     - Helpfulness: 8.1\n     - Pickup Speed: 4.6\n     - Drop-off Speed: 9.0\n     - Car Cleanliness: 7.9\n\n2. **Hertz - Hyundai Veloster**\n   - **Type:** Economy car\n   - **Price:** $392.79 (approx. drive-away price)\n   - **Deposit:** $273.98 - $684.96\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Rating:** 8.3 (Very Good) based on 163 reviews\n   - **Customer Reviews:**\n     - **Positive:** \"Good car, easy return\"\n     - **Negative:** \"Long wait for the car even as a reward member\"\n   - **Supplier Rating Breakdown:**\n     - Overall Value: 7.7\n     - Helpfulness: 8.2\n     - Pickup Speed: 7.3\n     - Drop-off Speed: 9.5\n     - Car Cleanliness: 8.8\n\n### Summary\n- **Pickup Date:** November 16, 2024, at 7 PM\n- **Return Date:** November 22, 2024, at 7 PM\n- **Location:** Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport\n\nBoth suppliers (Avis and Hertz) have good ratings and offer reliable vehicles for your business trip. If you need further assistance or wish to book, let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides information about car rental availability and user reviews for suppliers other than Budget, but it does not address the availability of cars for rent on November 15th, 2024."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
