s\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus Zone (Terminals 1E, 2D, and 3G)\n\n2. **Hyundai Accent (Compact)**\n   - **Supplier:** Dollar\n   - **Price:** $298.02 (Total for the week)\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus Zone (Terminals 1E, 2D, and 3G)\n\n3. **Nissan Altima (Full-size)**\n   - **Supplier:** Dollar\n   - **Price:** $323.57 (Total for the week)\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus Zone (Terminals 1E, 2D, and 3G)\n\n4. **Dodge Grand Caravan (Full-size)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $426.56 (Total for the week)\n   - **Rating:** 7.9/10 (Good)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus Zone (Terminal 1D)\n\n5. **Ford Expedition (Full-size)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $420.03 (Total for the week)\n   - **Rating:** 7.9/10 (Good)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus Zone (Terminal 1D)\n\n### User Reviews for Hertz (Supplier)\n- **Overall Rating:** 7.9/10 (Good)\n- **Customer Feedback:**\n  - **Positive:** \"The counter lady was really friendly and helpful.\" (Rating: 8.6)\n  - **Positive:** \"Better than expected! Drop-off was a breeze.\" (Rating: 9.4)\n  - **Negative:** \"I was charged almost twice the original price.\" (Rating: 6.6)\n  - **Negative:** \"Long wait, wrong car, red tape… never again.\" (Rating: 4.3)\n\n### Summary\n- **Tomorrow (Dec 10):** Multiple options available from Dollar.\n- **Day After Tomorrow (Dec 11):** Options from both Dollar and Hertz.\n- **Hertz Reviews:** Generally positive with an average rating of 7.9/10, though some customers reported issues with pricing and service.\n\nWould you like to proceed with a booking or need more details?"}], "message": "Success.",