able for the price. \nLocation is easy to find ", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.7", "rawValue": 7.7}, "epochDay": 20019}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.7", "rawValue": 7.7}, "epochDay": 20017, "date": "Mon, Oct 21 2024", "negative": "The waiting time was over an hour at the counter.  It is absurd they have two or at times three employees working at the counter for a line of more than 20-30 clients. All the other rent a cars the line was small or quick.  ", "positive": "The car was good for the price ", "type": "Couple", "rating": "7.7"}, {"type": "Couple", "rating": "9.7", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.7, "displayValue": "9.7"}, "epochDay": 20016, "date": "Sun, Oct 20 2024", "negative": "Giving back the ride", "positive": "Ease of booking. Ease of collecting and vehicle received. "}, {"date": "Sat, Oct 19 2024", "negative": "No me informaron que no contaba con GPS .", "positive": "Excelente vehículo gran capacidad y cómodo.Facil de recoger y devolver en forma rápida.", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "epochDay": 20015, "type": "Couple", "rating": "8.9"}]}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"customerReviews": {"sort": {"options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"id": "score.descending", "label": "Highest scores"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"id": "date.descending", "label": "Newest first"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}, "ctaTitle": "Sort by", "pageTitle": "Sort by"}, "title": "Customer reviews", "reviews": [{"epochDay": 20020, "rating": "9.1", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.1", "rawValue": 9.1}, "negative": "The car I selected was not available and possibly last more time to pick it up and I had to select a dodge challenger which was not preferred by my wife ", "type": "Couple", "date": "Thu, Oct 24 2024", "positive": "Fast service"}, {"date": "Tue, Oct 22 2024", "negative": "They delivered the car to me with the front right tire losing air", "epochDay": 20018, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.4, "displayValue": "7.4"}, "rating": "7.4", "type": "Couple"}, {"type": "Solo traveller", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.3", "rawValue": 8.3}, "epochDay": 20013, "rating": "8.3", "negative": "additional misleading charges I didn’t agree to of $165", "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024"}, {"negative": "the car had over than 75K miles on it, so it was pretty much run and some noises, maybe in the suspension, maybe in its springs, ", "rating": "8.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}, "epochDay": 20012, "type": "Group", "date": "Wed, Oct 16 2024", "positive": "car model as required/expected"}, {"negative": "There was continues signal on display that right from tire was flat, while the pressure was good. This made me stop at a few gasoline stations to put air. ", "epochDay": 20011, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}, "rating": "8.9", "type": "Solo traveller", "positive": "Comfort ", "date": "Tue, Oct 15 2024"}]}, "supplier": {"title": "Rental company", "name": "Avis", "rating": {"subtitle": "2,775 reviews", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.3, "displayValue": "8.3"}, "average": "8.3", "breakdown": [{"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.9, "displayValue": "7.9"}, "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "score": "7.9"}, {"title": "Helpfulness", "score": "8.3", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.3, "displayValue": "8.3"}}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.7", "rawValue": 7.7}, "score": "7.7", "title": "Pick-up speed"}, {"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.3, "displayValue": "9.3"}, "title": "Drop-off speed", "score": "9.3"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8", "rawValue": 8}, "title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "8.0"}], "title": "Very good"}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Availability at Miami International Airport\n\n#### Availability on December 1, 2024 (Tomorrow)\n- **Total Cars Available**: 92\n- **Pick-Up Time**: 6:00 PM\n- **Drop-Off Time**: 6:00 PM on December 8, 2024\n- **Location**: Miami International Airport\n\n#### Availability on December 2, 2024 (Day After Tomorrow)\n- **Total Cars Available**: 0\n- **No cars are available for rent on this date.**\n\n---\n\n### Supplier Reviews (Excluding Sixt)\n\n#### 1. **Dollar**\n- **Overall Rating**: 8.2 (Very Good)\n- **Number of Reviews**: 7,729\n- **Breakdown**:\n  - **Overall Value for Money**: 8.0\n  - **Helpfulness**: 7.8\n  - **Pick-Up Speed**: 7.4\n  - **Drop-Off Speed**: 8.9\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 8.2\n\n##### Customer Reviews:\n1. **Rating**: 9.7  \n   **Type**: Couple  \n   **Date**: October 24, 2024  \n   **Feedback**: \"Ok\"\n\n2. **Rating**: 7.7  \n   **Type**: Family  \n   **Date**: October 23, 2024  \n   **Positive**: \"Price are reasonable for the price. Location is easy to find.\"  \n   **Negative**: \"No help with navigation system and no water for windshield cleaning.\"\n\n3. **Rating**: 7.7  \n   **Type**: Couple  \n   **Date**: October 21, 2024  \n   **Positive**: \"The car was good for the price.\"  \n   **Negative**: \"Long waiting time at the counter.\"\n\n---\n\n#### 2. **Avis**\n- **Overall Rating**: 8.3 (Very Good)\n- **Number of Reviews**: 2,775\n- **Breakdown**:\n  - **Overall Value for Money**: 7.9\n  - **Helpfulness**: 8.3\n  - **Pick-Up Speed**: 7.7\n  - **Drop-Off Speed**: 9.3\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 8.0\n\n##### Customer Reviews:\n1. **Rating**: 9.1  \n   **Type**: Couple  \n   **Date**: October 24, 2024  \n   **Positive**: \"Fast service.\"  \n   **Negative**: \"Selected car was not available.\"\n\n2. **Rating**: 7.4  \n   **Type**: Couple  \n   **Date**: October 22, 2024  \n   **Negative**: \"Front right tire was losing air.\"\n\n3. **Rating**: 8.9  \n   **Type**: Group  \n   **Date**: October 16, 2024  \n   **Positive**: \"Car model as required/expected.\"  \n   **Negative**: \"Car had over 75K miles and made noises.\"\n\n---\n\n### Recommendation\n- **Best Option**: Rent a car on **December 1, 2024**, as there are no available cars on December 2.\n- **Top Supplier**: **Avis** has a slightly higher overall rating (8.3) compared to Dollar (8.2). Both offer good value and cleanliness.\n\nIf you need further assistance or wish to book a car, please let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
