\n  - Avis (30 cars)\n  - Budget (40 cars)\n  - Dollar (58 cars)\n  - Sixt (14 cars)\n\n### User Reviews for Dollar (Supplier)\n- **Overall Rating:** 6.3/10 (OK)\n- **Number of Reviews:** 711\n- **Review Breakdown:**\n  - **Overall Value for Money:** 5.7\n  - **Helpfulness:** 5.7\n  - **Pick-up Speed:** 5.6\n  - **Drop-off Speed:** 8.0\n  - **Car Cleanliness:** 7.1\n\n#### Recent Customer Reviews:\n1. **Rating:** 2/10  \n   **Type:** Family  \n   **Date:** October 16, 2024  \n   **Positive:** None  \n   **Negative:** \"They closed before I landed and I couldn’t get my car.\"\n\n2. **Rating:** 8.6/10  \n   **Type:** Couple  \n   **Date:** October 14, 2024  \n   **Positive:** \"Easy to process.\"  \n   **Negative:** \"First, they didn’t want to rent to me.\"\n\n3. **Rating:** 2.6/10  \n   **Type:** Solo Traveller  \n   **Date:** September 10, 2024  \n   **Negative:** \"The security deposit being 10x more than my total rental cost is insane.\"\n\n### Summary\n- Cars are available for both dates, with a variety of suppliers.\n- Dollar has mixed reviews; consider other suppliers like **Budget** or **Sixt** if you prefer higher-rated options.\n\nWould you like me to check reviews for another supplier or proceed with booking?"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 4, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides car rental availability and user reviews for Dollar, but does not provide user reviews for suppliers other than Avis as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
