ailable Cars:** 154 cars are available for rent.\n   - **Suppliers:** Options include **Dollar**, **Sixt**, and **Avis**.\n   - **Example Vehicles:**\n     - **BMW X1** (Premium) from Sixt: $510.31\n     - **Toyota RAV4** (Intermediate) from Sixt: $455.38\n     - **Toyota Sienna** (Standard) from Dollar: $1521.73\n     - **BMW X3** (Premium) from Sixt: $526.80\n     - **Volkswagen Jetta** (Standard) from Dollar: $324.45\n\n### User Reviews for Suppliers (Excluding Sixt):\nI have retrieved user reviews for suppliers other than Sixt. Here are the details for **Dollar**:\n\n#### Dollar Supplier Reviews:\n- **Average Rating:** 7.5/10 (Good)\n- **Number of Reviews:** 4,322\n- **Detailed Ratings:**\n  - **Value for Money:** 7.1/10\n  - **Condition:** 7.8/10\n  - **Cleanliness:** 7.7/10\n  - **Pickup Time:** 6.1/10\n  - **Drop-off Time:** 9.2/10\n  - **Location:** 8.3/10\n  - **Efficiency:** 7.1/10\n\n### Summary:\n- **Availability:** Both dates have plenty of options, with 154 cars available each day.\n- **Suppliers:** Dollar and Avis are available besides Sixt.\n- **User Reviews:** Dollar has a solid rating of 7.5/10, with positive feedback on drop-off time and location efficiency.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking a car for either date, or do you need more information?"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides information on car availability and user reviews for Dollar, but it does not provide user reviews for Avis, which is another supplier besides Sixt."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
