"id": "date.descending", "label": "Newest first"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}}, "reviews": [{"rating": "8.6", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.6", "rawValue": 8.6}, "epochDay": 19976, "positive": "It was a hybrid car, so it was nicer drive.", "type": "Couple", "date": "Tue, Sept 10 2024", "negative": "That I paid for extra coverage through booking, but, Avis just mentioned we had the regular coverage and I had to pay extra, again, so it was no meaning paying anything extra with booking."}, {"date": "Sun, Aug 11 2024", "type": "Family", "epochDay": 19946, "positive": "The service at the counter was great. The member of staff was very helpful and pleasant.  ", "negative": "The car wasn’t particularly clean.  \n\nThe rear nearside rear quarter window didn’t close fully and had to be pulled up by had the rear of the way.  \n\nThe Apple Car Play was very temperamental.  \n\nThe car wandered a bit on the road.  ", "rating": "5.4", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "5.4", "rawValue": 5.4}}, {"epochDay": 19941, "date": "Tue, Aug 6 2024", "type": "Family", "rating": "6.6", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.6", "rawValue": 6.6}, "negative": "Additional amounts were charged by AVIS. Both booking.com and AVIS.com are not willing to help. Last time I do business with both (please note I am/was a genius 3 level, but that still does not help a single bit)"}, {"positive": "Very Good Service", "epochDay": 19921, "type": "Family", "date": "Wed, Jul 17 2024", "negative": "NA", "rating": "9.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}}, {"rating": "8.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}, "positive": "Automatic and hybrid model very fuel efficient ", "epochDay": 19900, "date": "Wed, Jun 26 2024", "type": "Solo traveller", "negative": "Limited view in rear view mirror"}], "title": "Customer reviews"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Availability at San Diego International Airport\n\n#### For Pickup on October 10, 2024 (Tomorrow)\n- **Total Options Available:** 85 cars\n- **Sample Options:**\n  1. **Supplier:** Dollar\n     - **Vehicle:** Compact car (Kia e-Niro)\n     - **Price:** $306.38 (approx.)\n     - **Rating:** 8.0/10 (Very Good, 1,294 reviews)\n     - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation.\n  \n  2. **Supplier:** Dollar\n     - **Vehicle:** Economy car (Chevrolet Spark)\n     - **Price:** $293.63 (approx.)\n     - **Rating:** 8.0/10 (Very Good, 1,294 reviews)\n     - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation.\n\n  3. **Supplier:** Dollar\n     - **Vehicle:** Intermediate car (Toyota RAV4)\n     - **Price:** $326.66 (approx.)\n     - **Rating:** 8.0/10 (Very Good, 1,294 reviews)\n     - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation.\n\n#### For Pickup on October 11, 2024 (Day After Tomorrow)\n- **Total Options Available:** 85 cars\n- **Sample Options:**\n  1. **Supplier:** Hertz\n     - **Vehicle:** Compact car (Nissan Versa)\n     - **Price:** $318.04 (approx.)\n     - **Rating:** 8.1/10 (Very Good, 102 reviews)\n     - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation.\n  \n  2. **Supplier:** Avis\n     - **Vehicle:** Full-size car (Chrysler Town & Country)\n     - **Price:** $598.59 (approx.)\n     - **Rating:** 8.1/10 (Very Good, 291 reviews)\n     - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation.\n\n  3. **Supplier:** Dollar\n     - **Vehicle:** Premium car (Chevrolet Suburban)\n     - **Price:** $461.03 (approx.)\n     - **Rating:** 8.0/10 (Very Good, 1,294 reviews)\n     - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation.\n\n---\n\n### User Reviews for Suppliers (Excluding Dollar)\n\n#### Hertz\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.1/10 (Very Good)\n- **Customer Reviews Breakdown:**\n  - **Value for Money:** 7.7\n  - **Helpfulness:** 7.4\n  - **Pick-up Speed:** 8.2\n  - **Drop-off Speed:** 9.1\n  - **Car Cleanliness:** 8.4\n- **Customer Reviews:** \n  - *Currently, no detailed customer reviews are available for this rental counter.*\n\n#### Avis\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.1/10 (Very Good)\n- **Customer Reviews Breakdown:**\n  - **Value for Money:** 7.0\n  - **Helpfulness:** 8.6\n  - **Pick-up Speed:** 7.2\n  - **Drop-off Speed:** 9.2\n  - **Car Cleanliness:** 8.5\n- **Customer Reviews:**\n  1. **Rating:** 8.6 (Couple, Sept 10, 2024)\n     - **Positive:** \"It was a hybrid car, so it was a nicer drive.\"\n     - **Negative:** \"Paid for extra coverage through booking, but Avis charged me again.\"\n\n  2. **Rating:** 5.4 (Family, Aug 11, 2024)\n     - **Positive:** \"Great service at the counter; staff was helpful and pleasant.\"\n     - **Negative:** \"Car wasn't clean; rear window didn't close properly; Apple Car Play was temperamental.\"\n\n  3. **Rating:** 6.6 (Family, Aug 6, 2024)\n     - **Negative:** \"Additional charges by Avis; Booking.com and Avis were unhelpful.\"\n\n  4. **Rating:** 9.4 (Family, Jul 17, 2024)\n     - **Positive:** \"Very good service.\"\n\n  5. **Rating:** 8.9 (Solo Traveller, Jun 26, 2024)\n     - **Positive:** \"Automatic and hybrid model very fuel efficient.\"\n     - **Negative:** \"Limited view in rearview mirror.\"\n\n### Summary\n- **Availability:** Cars are available for both dates (October 10 and 11, 2024).\n- **Top Non-Dollar Suppliers:** Hertz and Avis.\n- **Recommendation:** \n  - For **budget-friendly options**, consider Hertz (compact cars at ~$318).\n  - For **larger vehicles**, Avis offers full-size cars but at a higher price (~$598).\n  \nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
