re.descending", "items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"label": "Newest first", "id": "date.descending"}, {"label": "Oldest first", "id": "date.ascending"}]}, "ctaTitle": "Sort by", "pageTitle": "Sort by"}, "reviews": [{"rating": "8.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}, "epochDay": 20021, "type": "Couple", "negative": "Wading through the insurance options and requirements was very confusing. We bought the booking.com insurance and then were sold the super crew by budget at the time of pick up. It would be very helpful to have a concise description of all the various options, requirements and implications available to be better prepared when picking up a car.", "positive": "The car was cleaned and in good operating condition and performed well for the 2 weeks rental period. Having ApplePlay and the fact that it was a hybrid were pluses. ", "date": "Fri, Oct 25 2024"}, {"rating": "7.1", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.1, "displayValue": "7.1"}, "epochDay": 19998, "negative": "Counter girl confused us and sold extra insurance we had already bought through Booking.com for over $1400!  We worried the whole trip.  When returning the car, manager wrote it off.  Do not sign anything when picking up the car.", "type": "Group", "positive": "In and out fast", "date": "Wed, Oct 2 2024"}, {"epochDay": 19992, "negative": "I'm trying to contact Budget staff and no one is available even I sent email also still not received reply from them", "type": "Group", "date": "Thu, Sept 26 2024", "rating": "4.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 4.9, "displayValue": "4.9"}}, {"negative": "Always have to check all damages and scratches and make video of the car ", "positive": "All documents, payments and check in is done online or on the phone and car is ready just to pick it up with the kies already inside", "date": "Wed, Sept 18 2024", "type": "Family", "epochDay": 19984, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.6, "displayValue": "8.6"}, "rating": "8.6"}, {"date": "Sat, Sept 14 2024", "positive": "Return process was quick.", "type": "Family", "epochDay": 19980, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "5.7", "rawValue": 5.7}, "rating": "5.7"}], "title": "Customer reviews"}, "supplier": {"rating": {"title": "Good", "breakdown": [{"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.9, "displayValue": "6.9"}, "score": "6.9", "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire"}, {"score": "6.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.9, "displayValue": "6.9"}, "title": "Helpfulness"}, {"title": "Pick-up speed", "score": "6.7", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.7", "rawValue": 6.7}}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.7, "displayValue": "8.7"}, "score": "8.7"}, {"title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "7.5", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.5, "displayValue": "7.5"}}], "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.2, "displayValue": "7.2"}, "subtitle": "2,110 reviews", "average": "7.2"}, "title": "Rental company", "name": "Budget"}}, "details": {"supplier": {"rating": {"breakdown": [{"score": "6.9", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.9", "rawValue": 6.9}, "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire"}, {"title": "Helpfulness", "score": "6.9", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.9", "rawValue": 6.9}}, {"title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.7, "displayValue": "6.7"}, "score": "6.7"}, {"score": "8.7", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.7, "displayValue": "8.7"}, "title": "Drop-off speed"}, {"title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "7.5", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.5, "displayValue": "7.5"}}], "title": "Good", "average": "7.2", "subtitle": "2,110 reviews", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.2", "rawValue": 7.2}}, "name": "Budget", "title": "Rental company"}, "instructions": {"pickUp": "Car Rental Centre - Follow the 'Autonoleggi' signs from the Arrivals hall. The office is located in 'Torre Uffici 2'.", "title": "Pick-up instructions"}, "location": {"address": "Via dell'Aeroporto di Fiumicino, Fiumicino, Italy, 00050"}, "openingTimes": {"dropOff": {"subtitle": "Budget, Rome Ciampino Airport", "hours": "00:00 - 24:00", "title": "Drop-off (8 Dec)"}, "title": "Opening times", "pickUp": {"title": "Pick-up (1 Dec)", "hours": "07:00 - 24:00", "subtitle": "Budget, Fiumicino Airport"}}}, "map": {"location": {"address": "Via dell'Aeroporto di Fiumicino, Fiumicino, Italy, 00050", "title": "Supplier location", "coordinates": {"latitude": 41.794803, "longitude": 12.250492}}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Details\n- **Make and Model**: Nissan Qashqai\n- **Car Class**: Intermediate\n- **Transmission**: Manual\n- **Seats**: 5\n- **Doors**: 4\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel)\n- **Suitcases**: \n  - Big: 3\n  - Small: 0\n- **Price**: \n  - **Total Drive Away Price**: $294.67 USD\n  - **Base Price**: ₹24,866.36 INR\n  - **Deposit**: $212.96 USD\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n- **Included Features**:\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Info**:\n  - Payment card at pick-up: Credit or debit card required in the main driver's name.\n\n### Supplier Details\n- **Supplier Name**: Budget\n- **Supplier Rating**: 7.2 (Good, based on 2,110 reviews)\n- **Location Type**: Car Rental Centre\n- **Pick-Up Location**: \n  - **Address**: Via dell'Aeroporto di Fiumicino, Fiumicino, Italy, 00050\n  - **Coordinates**: Latitude 41.794803, Longitude 12.250492\n- **Drop-Off Location**:\n  - **Address**: 1651, Via Appia Nuova, Roma, Italy, 00040\n  - **Coordinates**: Latitude 41.799276, Longitude 12.590536\n- **Pick-Up Instructions**: Follow the 'Autonoleggi' signs from the Arrivals hall. The office is located in 'Torre Uffici 2'.\n- **Opening Times**:\n  - **Pick-Up (1 Dec)**: 07:00 - 24:00\n  - **Drop-Off (8 Dec)*