have rated Budget as 7.2 out of 10, Good.", "pick_up_location": "Pick-up information: Car Rental Centre"}, "specialOfferText": "Premium Package: price includes 1 additional driver and the first tank of fuel free", "badges": [{"type": "CONSTRUCTIVE", "text": "Free cancellation", "variation": "DEFAULT"}]}}, "packages": [{"id": "RC_EC_USA", "content": {"included": "Extra Cover included", "price": {"displayPrice": "US$41.25", "priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}, "label": "Total protection price"}, "cta": {"remove": "Remove Extra Cover", "attach": "Read more"}, "description": "Your car's zero-excess policy doesn't cover every kind of damage, or the other costs you might incur if something goes wrong. Why not add ₹ 236,300 of Extra Cover - from RentalCover.com?", "title": "Add insurance...", "subtitle": "for peace of mind"}}], "depots": {"pickup": {"city": "JFK Airport", "address": "305, Federal Circle, Jamaica, JFK Airport, USA, 11430", "location_id": "1765783", "country": "USA - New York", "iataCode": "JFK", "latitude": "40.6397", "longitude": "-73.7792", "name": "John F Kennedy International Airport", "id": "1765783", "location_type": "CAR_RENTAL_CENTRE", "country_code": "US"}, "dropoff": {"name": "LaGuardia Airport", "longitude": "-73.871834", "id": "1765913", "location_type": "SHUTTLE_BUS", "country_code": "US", "iataCode": "LGA", "latitude": "40.774583", "location_id": "1765913", "address": "88-08, 23rd Avenue, East Elmhurst, La Guardia Airport, USA, 11369"}}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"details": {"instructions": {"pickUp": "Car Rental Centre - -", "title": "Pick-up instructions"}, "openingTimes": {"pickUp": {"hours": "06:00 - 23:00", "subtitle": "Budget, John F Kennedy International Airport", "title": "Pick-up (24 Dec)"}, "title": "Opening times", "dropOff": {"hours": "00:00 - 24:00", "title": "Drop-off (28 Dec)", "subtitle": "Budget, LaGuardia Airport"}}, "supplier": {"title": "Rental company", "rating": {"localisedRating": {"r