: "Newest first"}, {"label": "Oldest first", "id": "date.ascending"}], "default": "score.descending"}}, "reviews": [{"type": "Solo traveller", "date": "Sun, Nov 3 2024", "epochDay": 20030, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.4", "rawValue": 7.4}, "positive": "250 usd was held on my card and then all types of charges were put on ", "rating": "7.4"}, {"type": "Couple", "date": "Sat, Nov 2 2024", "negative": "Tried to access Budget customer service by phone for clarification question on toll payment procedure as well as oil fuell message in car but did not get to speak with a representative (long waiting time and finally message of nobody being available….. excuse me ??? - we gave up and drove an extra detour of 70 miles to get to talk to personnel at a local Budget office. Also - was billed for Toll usage but did not get any detailled bill on dates and fees.", "epochDay": 20029, "positive": "Easy and correct handling procedure - no aggressive overselling effort for additionnal services - friendly and professional service at the desk", "rating": "9.1", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.1, "displayValue": "9.1"}}, {"type": "Family", "positive": "The drop off was easy", "rating": "4.9", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4.9", "rawValue": 4.9}, "date": "Mon, Oct 28 2024", "epochDay": 20024, "negative": "Long wait.\nAdditional charges even after asking not to add. It came to surprise after the return.\n"}, {"rating": "5.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.4, "displayValue": "5.4"}, "type": "Couple", "epochDay": 20021, "negative": "My details were not available to the counter staff at Budget.  My information was not passed from booking.com.  it took ages.  They got my details wrong.  They didn't get me the right type of vehicle initially.   Disasterous.", "date": "Fri, Oct 25 2024"}, {"type": "Family", "positive": "They gave an upgrade of the car since no cars were available ", "rating": "5.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.4, "displayValue": "5.4"}, "date": "Tue, Oct 22 2024", "negative": "There is a double charge for the rental amount one from rental cars.com and the same amount is charged again by budget and it is a rip off. I have no idea how to get that one charge reversed back to me.", "epochDay": 20018}]}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Details\n\n#### Vehicle Information\n- **Make and Model**: Hyundai Elantra\n- **Car Class**: Intermediate\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Seats**: 5\n- **Doors**: 2/4\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited\n- **Fuel Policy**: Free Tank (includes the first tank of fuel free)\n- **Suitcases Capacity**: \n  - Big: 1\n  - Small: 1\n- **Special Offer**: Premium Package includes 1 additional driver and the first tank of fuel free.\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n\n#### Pricing\n- **Total Price**: $549.22 USD (approximately ₹46,347.83 INR)\n- **Deposit**: $300 USD (held at pick-up)\n- **Payment Method**: Credit card required at pick-up (must be in the main driver's name)\n- **Pay When**: Pay Now\n\n#### What's Included\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n- Premium Package benefits\n\n#### Extras (Available at Additional Cost)\n- **Additional Driver**: $25 USD per rental (max 3)\n- **Baby Seat**: $72.50 USD per rental (max 2)\n- **Booster Seat**: $72.50 USD per rental (max 2)\n- **Child Seat**: $72.50 USD per rental (max 2)\n- **GPS**: $84.95 USD per rental (max 1)\n\n#### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier**: Budget\n- **Rating**: 7.2/10 (Good) based on 2,104 reviews\n- **Pick-up Location**: \n  - **Address**: 305, Federal Circle, Jamaica, JFK Airport, USA, 11430\n  - **Coordinates**: Latitude 40.6397, Longitude -73.7792\n  - **Opening Hours**: 06:00 - 23:00\n- **Drop-off Location**: \n  - **Address**: 88-08, 23rd Avenue, East Elmhurst, La Guardia Airport, USA, 11369\n  - **Coordinates**: Latitude 40.774583, Longitude -73.871834\n  - **Opening Hours**: 00:00 - 24:00\n\n#### Important Information\n- **Security Deposit**: $300 USD will be held on your credit card at pick-up.\n- **Pick-up Instructions**: The main driver must present a credit card in their own name.\n- **Drop-off Instructions**: Drop-off at the specified location during operating hours.\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Value for Money**: 7.4/10\n- **Helpfulness**: 6.6/10\n- **Pick-up Speed**: 5.0/10\n- **Drop-off Speed**: 9.2/10\n- **Car Cleanliness**: 7.7/10\n\n#### Sample Customer Feedback\n- **Positive**: \"Easy and correct handling procedure - no aggressive overselling effort for additional services.\"\n- **Negative**: \"Long wait times and unexpected charges after return.\"\n\n### Summary\nYou can rent a **Hyundai Elantra** from **Budget** at **John F. Kennedy International Airport** on **December 24, 2024, at 9:00 AM** and return it at **LaGuardia Airport** on **December 28, 2024, at 5:00 PM** for **$549.22 USD**. The rental includes unlimited mileage and a free tank of fuel. A security deposit of $300 USD will be required at pick-up. \n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need more information?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
