title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "score": "6.7"}, {"score": "6.7", "title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.7", "rawValue": 6.7}}, {"title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.3, "displayValue": "5.3"}, "score": "5.3"}, {"score": "8.9", "title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.9, "displayValue": "8.9"}}, {"title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.9", "rawValue": 7.9}, "score": "7.9"}], "average": "7.2", "subtitle": "1,781 reviews", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.2, "displayValue": "7.2"}, "title": "Good"}, "title": "Rental company"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Availability at Hartsfield-Jackson Atlanta International Airport\n\n#### **Available Cars for Rent on November 30, 2024 (Tomorrow) at 1 PM:**\n1. **Polestar 2 (Premium)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $284.37\n   - **Features:**\n     - Fully electric\n     - Free cancellation\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Seats: 5\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good, based on 184 reviews)\n\n2. **Toyota Corolla (Intermediate)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $303.95\n   - **Features:**\n     - Free cancellation\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Seats: 5\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good, based on 184 reviews)\n\n3. **Ford Expedition (Full-size)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $409.04\n   - **Features:**\n     - Free cancellation\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Seats: 7\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good, based on 184 reviews)\n\n---\n\n#### **Available Cars for Rent on December 1, 2024 (Day After Tomorrow) at 1 PM:**\n1. **Polestar 2 (Premium)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $284.37\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good, based on 184 reviews)\n\n2. **Dodge Grand Caravan (Full-size)**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Price:** $426.56\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good, based on 184 reviews)\n\n3. **Toyota RAV4 (Intermediate)**\n   - **Supplier:** Dollar\n   - **Price:** $306.01\n   - **Rating:** 7.2/10 (Good, based on 1,781 reviews)\n\n4. **Nissan Armada (Full-size)**\n   - **Supplier:** Dollar\n   - **Price:** $381.49\n   - **Rating:** 7.2/10 (Good, based on 1,781 reviews)\n\n---\n\n### User Reviews for Non-Hertz Suppliers (Dollar)\n#### **Overall Rating: 7.2/10 (Good)**\n- **Customer Reviews:**\n  1. **Rating: 6.9/10** (October 22, 2024)  \n     \"Entire experience was horrendous. On arrival at the counter, was told that the wait time for any vehicle was 2 to 3 hours.\"\n  2. **Rating: 7.7/10** (October 20, 2024)  \n     \"Shuttle from lot to terminal was great and unexpected. Lisa Alford, driver, was excellent.\"\n  3. **Rating: 10/10** (October 16, 2024)  \n     \"Good experience.\"\n  4. **Rating: 7.7/10** (October 11, 2024)  \n     \"Prepaid the amount but owed $97 at time of pickup.\"\n  5. **Rating: 7.4/10** (October 2, 2024)  \n     \"I rented an electric car.\"\n\n#### **Breakdown of Ratings:**\n- **Overall Value for Money:** 6.7/10  \n- **Helpfulness:** 6.7/10  \n- **Pick-up Speed:** 5.3/10  \n- **Drop-off Speed:** 8.9/10  \n- **Car Cleanliness:** 7.9/10  \n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Hertz:** Offers a variety of cars but has mixed reviews for pick-up speed.\n- **Dollar:** Provides competitive pricing but has some complaints about wait times.\n\nLet me know if you'd like to proceed with booking or need more details!"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 4, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including car availability for the specified dates and user reviews of suppliers other than Hertz."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
