o collect cars.\n\nHad already paid for additional drivers but been charged again plus extra amount for sat nav. Ended up paying £500 more than expected.\nBe VERY careful about booking with these! ", "rating": "4.9", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4.9", "rawValue": 4.9}, "positive": "Easy drop kff"}, {"type": "Family", "epochDay": 20006, "date": "Thu, Oct 10 2024", "negative": "No complaints....5 star.", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "rating": "9.4", "positive": "Excellent service, clean vehicle and was given an upgrade free of charge. "}, {"type": "Couple", "epochDay": 20005, "date": "Wed, Oct 9 2024", "rating": "6.0", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6, "displayValue": "6"}, "positive": "Nothing", "negative": "1. 2 hour wait for car\n2. No signs in lot for returning car. Long wait for bus to airport"}, {"negative": "The rate booked was inclusive of GPS. This was not clear on the voucher and so at my request Booking.com sent me an email confirming the rental included GPS\nWhen collecting the car Budget said GPS was not included despite showing the email and wanted to charge me $21 per day. I refused and had to spend over 30 mins dealing with 3 members of staff until they finally conceded", "rating": "6.9", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.9, "displayValue": "6.9"}, "type": "Solo traveller", "date": "Sat, Sept 28 2024", "epochDay": 19994}, {"type": "Family", "epochDay": 19980, "date": "Sat, Sept 14 2024", "negative": "Unfortunately nothing good to say about rentalcars.com \nI used to book every trip through booking and Rentalcars, but after this issue l, never again, until there’s a change in policies. \nCustomer service is terrible. Didn’t resolve my issue, kept the money, and I never received a car from Rentalcars.com", "rating": "2.0", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 2, "displayValue": "2"}, "positive": "Unfortunately nothing good to say about rentalcars.com \nI used to book every trip through booking and Rentalcars, but after this issue l, never again, until there’s a change in policies. \nCustomer service is terrible. Didn’t resolve my issue, kept the money, and I never received a car from Rentalcars.com"}]}, "supplier": {"rating": {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.8", "rawValue": 6.8}, "breakdown": [{"title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.5", "rawValue": 6.5}, "score": "6.5"}, {"score": "6.4", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.4", "rawValue": 6.4}, "title": "Helpfulness"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4.5", "rawValue": 4.5}, "title": "Pick-up speed", "score": "4.5"}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.3", "rawValue": 9.3}, "score": "9.3"}, {"title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.2", "rawValue": 7.2}, "score": "7.2"}], "title": "OK", "average": "6.8", "subtitle": "821 reviews"}, "title": "Rental company", "name": "Budget"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"customerReviews": {"reviews": [{"negative": "Nothing really. A little difficult to find the shuttle to the lot when we first arrived at Denver airport.", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "type": "Couple", "epochDay": 20010, "positive": "Excellent service from the Hertz countrr staff and ease to find the lot on returning the car.", "date": "Mon, Oct 14 2024", "rating": "8.9"}, {"date": "Wed, Oct 9 2024", "positive": "Situation of the car", "rating": "9.7", "type": "Family", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.7, "displayValue": "9.7"}, "epochDay": 20005}, {"type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "negative": "It was confusing which car to pick from the third zone we were directed to. Only sedans were available and we booked compact SUV but it was very comfortable ride. ", "epochDay": 19991, "date": "Wed, Sept 25 2024", "positive": "The ease of picking up our rental car was great. It was the quickest one yet. ", "rating": "9.4"}, {"type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.1", "rawValue": 7.1}, "negative": "They didn’t take my international license nor my military issued drivers license from Germany ", "epochDay": 19980, "date": "Sat, Sept 14 2024", "rating": "7.1"}, {"rating": "8.6", "date": "Wed, Sept 11 2024", "epochDay": 19977, "type": "Group", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.6, "displayValue": "8.6"}, "negative": "First car had an odd smell\nSecond car had 2% oil life left\nThird car was great"}], "title": "Customer reviews", "sort": {"options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"label": "Newest first", "id": "date.descending"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}, "pageTitle": "Sort by", "ctaTitle": "Sort by"}}, "supplier": {"title": "Rental company", "name": "Hertz", "rating": {"breakdown": [{"score": "7.1", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.1", "rawValue": 7.1}, "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire"}, {"score": "7.8", "title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.8", "rawValue": 7.8}}, {"score": "6.9", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.9", "rawValue": 6.9}, "title": "Pick-up speed"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.8", "rawValue": 8.8}, "title": "Drop-off speed", "score": "8.8"}, {"score": "7.6", "title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.6", "rawValue": 7.6}}], "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.7, "displayValue": "7.7"}, "title": "Good", "subtitle": "183 reviews", "average": "7.7"}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Availability at Denver International Airport\n\n#### Availability for Pickup on **December 15, 2024 (Tomorrow at 12 PM)**:\n- **Supplier**: Dollar\n  - **Vehicle Type**: Economy (Chevrolet Spark)\n  - **Total Price**: $357.27\n  - **Rating**: 7.8/10 (Good, based on 2,100 reviews)\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n  - **Pickup Location**: Car Rental Centre at Denver International Airport\n\n- **Supplier**: Dollar\n  - **Vehicle Type**: Compact (Hyundai Accent)\n  - **Total Price**: $367.05\n  - **Rating**: 7.8/10 (Good, based on 2,100 reviews)\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n  - **Pickup Location**: Car Rental Centre at Denver International Airport\n\n#### Availability for Pickup on **December 16, 2024 (Day After Tomorrow at 12 PM)**:\n- **Supplier**: Budget\n  - **Vehicle Type**: Full-size (Dodge Grand Caravan)\n  - **Total Price**: $650.14\n  - **Rating**: 6.8/10 (OK, based on 821 reviews)\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n  - **Pickup Location**: Shuttle Bus at Denver International Airport\n  - **Special Offer**: Premium Package includes 1 additional driver and the first tank of fuel free.\n\n- **Supplier**: Hertz\n  - **Vehicle Type**: Intermediate (Tesla Model 3)\n  - **Total Price**: $504.79\n  - **Rating**: 7.7/10 (Good, based on 183 reviews)\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n  - **Pickup Location**: Shuttle Bus at Denver International Airport\n  - **Special Feature**: Fully electric vehicle.\n\n### User Reviews for Suppliers (Other Than Dollar)\n\n#### Budget:\n- **Overall Rating**: 6.8/10 (OK)\n- **Customer Feedback**:\n  - **Positive**: \"Excellent service, clean vehicle, and was given an upgrade free of charge.\"\n  - **Negative**: \"90-minute queue to pick up the car. Charged extra for sat nav despite prior payment.\"\n- **Breakdown**:\n  - **Value for Money**: 6.5/10\n  - **Helpfulness**: 6.4/10\n  - **Pickup Speed**: 4.5/10\n  - **Drop-off Speed**: 9.3/10\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 7.2/10\n\n#### Hertz:\n- **Overall Rating**: 7.7/10 (Good)\n- **Customer Feedback**:\n  - **Positive**: \"Excellent service from the Hertz counter staff and ease of finding the lot on returning the car.\"\n  - **Negative**: \"A little difficult to find the shuttle to the lot when first arriving at Denver airport.\"\n- **Breakdown**:\n  - **Value for Money**: 7.1/10\n  - **Helpfulness**: 7.8/10\n  - **Pickup Speed**: 6.9/10\n  - **Drop-off Speed**: 8.8/10\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 7.6/10\n\n### Summary:\n- **December 15**: Only Dollar cars are available.\n- **December 16**: Budget and Hertz options are available with competitive pricing and good reviews.\n\nWould you like to proceed with a booking or need more details on any specific option?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
