ews": [{"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.7, "displayValue": "9.7"}, "rating": "9.7", "date": "Thu, Oct 24 2024", "epochDay": 20020, "positive": "all perfect and easy", "type": "Couple"}, {"positive": "Cleanliness of the car.", "negative": "Took too long to pick up the car - the company asked us to provide the flight info prior to our arrival, yet it still took about 40/45 minutes to get the car ready for us. We ask to pre-pay the petrol when we are filling out the paper work, after all the waiting the counter staff forgot to ", "rating": "6.9", "date": "Wed, Oct 23 2024", "type": "Family", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.9", "rawValue": 6.9}, "epochDay": 20019}, {"epochDay": 20017, "date": "Mon, Oct 21 2024", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 10, "displayValue": "10"}, "rating": "10", "type": "Couple", "positive": "Perfect for our needs. Staff were great."}, {"rating": "9.7", "date": "Sat, Oct 19 2024", "positive": "Loved the car ", "negative": "Nothing ", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.7", "rawValue": 9.7}, "epochDay": 20015, "type": "Solo traveller"}, {"type": "Couple", "positive": "The staff made a real difference - they showed how other car rental businesses should be run!", "epochDay": 20015, "date": "Sat, Oct 19 2024", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.7, "displayValue": "9.7"}, "rating": "9.7"}], "title": "Customer reviews"}, "supplier": {"name": "Ace Rental Cars", "title": "Rental company", "rating": {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "subtitle": "1,612 reviews", "title": "Fabulous", "average": "8.9", "breakdown": [{"score": "8.8", "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.8, "displayValue": "8.8"}}, {"score": "9.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "title": "Helpfulness"}, {"score": "7.7", "title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.7, "displayValue": "7.7"}}, {"score": "9.5", "title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.5, "displayValue": "9.5"}}, {"score": "9.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "title": "Car cleanliness"}]}}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Details\n\n#### Vehicle Information\n- **Make and Model**: Mazda CX-5\n- **Vehicle Class**: Standard\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Number of Seats**: 5\n- **Number of Doors**: 4\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n- **Suitcases Capacity**: \n  - Big: 2 \n  - Small: 1\n- **Price**: \n  - **Base Price**: ₹22,673.84 (Approx. $269.59 USD)\n  - **Drive Away Price**: $1,596.29 USD (Approximate)\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation not available\n\n#### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name**: Ace Rental Cars\n- **Supplier Rating**: 8.9 out of 10 (Fabulous) based on 1,612 reviews\n- **Address**: \n  - **Pickup Location**: 17 Ross Drive, Perth, Australia, WA 6105\n  - **Drop-off Location**: 330, Nudgee Road, Brisbane, Australia, QLD 4011\n- **Pickup Instructions**: \n  - The courtesy Ace shuttle is available during operational hours. \n  - After collecting your luggage, call 1800 620 408 or +61 8 9479 5016 to arrange collection.\n  - **T1 Virgin**: Exit outside main door and wait by T1 domestic sign.\n  - **T1 International**: Exit outside main door and wait at bus stand L.\n  - **T3 & T4**: Exit outside and wait at the centre lane next to the rideshare sign.\n\n#### Fees and Extras\n- **One Way Fee**: $1,326.70 USD (Included in price)\n- **Damage Excess**: $3,913.77 USD (Payable if applicable)\n- **Additional Driver**: $9.96 USD per rental\n- **Baby Seat**: $11.94 USD per rental\n- **Booster Seat**: $11.94 USD per rental\n\n#### Opening Times\n- **Pickup (October 26, 2024)**: 09:00 AM - 05:00 PM\n- **Drop-off (October 28, 2024)**: 07:00 AM - 05:00 PM\n\n#### Customer Reviews\n1. **Rating**: 9.7 (Couple)\n   - **Comment**: \"All perfect and easy.\"\n2. **Rating**: 6.9 (Family)\n   - **Positive**: \"Cleanliness of the car.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"Took too long to pick up the car.\"\n3. **Rating**: 10 (Couple)\n   - **Comment**: \"Perfect for our needs. Staff were great.\"\n\n### Summary\nYou will be renting a **Mazda CX-5** from **Ace Rental Cars** at **Perth Airport** on **October 26, 2024, at 9:00 AM** and returning it at **Brisbane Airport** on **October 28, 2024, at 4:00 PM**. The total approximate cost is **$1,596.29 USD**, including a one-way fee. Additional options like extra drivers or child seats are available at extra cost."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information about the vehicle and the supplier is addressed in detail."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
{"id": "Car-Rental-89", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "I need to go on a business trip to Massachusetts, USA soon and want to rent a car at Billings Logan International Airport to get around the city easily. To decide the date for booking the flight ticket, could you check if there are any cars available for rent at 11 PM tomorrow (November 10th, 2024) or the day after tomorrow? I'll return the car at the same time and place on the 17th. Additionally, I want to know the user reviews of suppliers other than Budget."}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Car_Location", "arguments": {"query": "Billings Logan International Airport"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"country": "United States", "type": "airport", "city": "Billings", "iata_code": "BIL", "name": "Billings Logan International Airport", "coordinates": {"latitude": 45.8077011108398, "longitude": -108.542999267578}}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Car_Rentals", "arguments": {"pick_up_latitude": 45.8077011108398, "pick_up_longitude": -108.542999267578, "drop_off_latitude": 45.8077011108398, "drop_off_longitude": -108.542999267578, "pick_up_date": "2024-11-10", "drop_off_date": "2024-11-17", "pick_up_time": "23:00", "drop_off_time": "23:00"}}, {"name": "Search_Car_Rentals", "arguments": {"pick_up_latitude": 45.8077011108398, "pick_up_longitude": -108.542999267578, "drop_off_latitude": 45.8077011108398, "drop_off_longitude": -108.542999267578, "pick_up_date": "2024-11-11", "drop_off_date": "2024-11-17", "pick_up_time": "23:00", "drop_off_time": "23:00"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"filter": [{"title": "Location", "layout": {"is_collapsed": "false", "collapsed_count": 2, "layout_type": "list", "is_collapsable": "false"}, "id": "depotLocationType", "categories": [{"count": 11, "name": "Airport (in terminal)", "id": "depotLocationType::IN_TE