\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel as at pick-up)\n- **Suitcases**: \n  - Small: 1\n  - Big: 1\n- **Price**: $357.69 (USD)\n- **Deposit**: $250 (refundable upon return)\n- **Free Cancellation**: No\n\n### What's Included\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pick-up**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Opening Times**:\n  - **Pick-up (October 26, 2024)**: 08:00 - 15:00 at Avis, Boston - Center Plaza\n  - **Drop-off (October 28, 2024)**: 00:00 - 24:00 at Avis, Logan International Airport\n\n### Supplier Details\n- **Supplier**: Avis\n- **Address**: 1 Center Plaza, Government Center, Boston, MA, USA, 02108\n- **Rating**: 8.0 out of 10 (Very Good) based on 116 reviews\n- **Customer Reviews Breakdown**:\n  - Overall Value for Money: 8.1\n  - Helpfulness: 7.2\n  - Pick-up Speed: 8.2\n  - Drop-off Speed: 9.2\n  - Car Cleanliness: 7.4\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: $39 per rental (max 3)\n2. **Baby Seat**: $43.5 per rental (max 2)\n3. **Booster Seat**: $43.5 per rental (max 2)\n4. **Child Seat**: $43.5 per rental (max 2)\n5. **GPS**: $50.97 per rental (max 1)\n\n### Insurance Package\n- **Extra Cover**: $24.75 (provides ₹235,500 of additional coverage for peace of mind)\n\n### Drop-off Location\n- **Address**: 15 Transportation Way, Boston, MA, USA, 02128\n- **Type**: Shuttle Bus\n- **IATA Code**: BOS (Logan International Airport)\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking or need any further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
