sedRating": {"displayValue": "4", "rawValue": 4}}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.6, "displayValue": "9.6"}, "score": "9.6"}, {"score": "8.1", "title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.1, "displayValue": "8.1"}}], "title": "Good"}}, "customerReviews": {"title": "Customer reviews", "reviews": [{"type": "Family", "epochDay": 20013, "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024", "rating": "8.0", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8, "displayValue": "8"}, "positive": "Clean", "negative": "They charged additionall cost that we don’t agree in the contract. "}, {"date": "Sat, Oct 12 2024", "epochDay": 20008, "type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.7, "displayValue": "7.7"}, "rating": "7.7", "negative": "The car did not lock , bad gas mileage , unstable car."}, {"epochDay": 20006, "date": "Thu, Oct 10 2024", "type": "Group", "negative": "Waiting time at rental desk was far too long ; one and a half hours. We thought we were getting free additional drivers from the paperwork but were told it was only for spouses! They wanted extra money. Then the car was not there and they were waiting for cars to come in. We were offered a small car, a truck before the one we took arrived; not the car we booked though. It seemed like we paid money out, then it was pot luck what you got. ", "positive": "The car we finally got was an upgrade. ", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.7", "rawValue": 7.7}, "rating": "7.7"}, {"epochDay": 19997, "date": "Tue, Oct 1 2024", "type": "Couple", "positive": "The car was good", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.7", "rawValue": 7.7}, "rating": "7.7", "negative": "The length of time in line at Budget to pick up the car. It took over 2 hours. The representative mislead us into paying for a tank of petrol saying it would cost $5.40 a gallon when in reality it was $3.50"}, {"date": "Mon, Sept 30 2024", "epochDay": 19996, "type": "Family", "negative": "I took me 3hrs lining up in the queue in front of Budget desk to get my car. Can't understand I have booked the car and indicate approx my pick up time, still took me 3hrs to get my car.  The explanation from Budget stuffs was they don't expect so many people show up at the same time to pick up car which I totally disagree for this argument. As majority of people were not walk in, they all booked in advance with pick up time indicated. It's budget issue to accept so many orders but do not have adequate staffs to handle. ", "positive": "The car that I rent is similar as I expected. ", "rating": "5.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.4, "displayValue": "5.4"}}], "sort": {"ctaTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"id": "score.descending", "label": "Highest scores"}, {"label": "Lowest scores", "id": "score.ascending"}, {"id": "date.descending", "label": "Newest first"}, {"label": "Oldest first", "id": "date.ascending"}]}, "pageTitle": "Sort by"}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Availability at Seattle-Tacoma International Airport\n\n#### Availability on **November 25, 2024 (Tomorrow)**\n1. **Hertz**\n   - **Vehicle:** Volkswagen Jetta\n   - **Price:** $265.26\n   - **Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous, 221 reviews)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n2. **Hertz**\n   - **Vehicle:** Toyota Corolla\n   - **Price:** $267.89\n   - **Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous, 221 reviews)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n3. **Hertz**\n   - **Vehicle:** Nissan Versa\n   - **Price:** $256.55\n   - **Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous, 221 reviews)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n4. **Hertz**\n   - **Vehicle:** Buick Encore\n   - **Price:** $293.18\n   - **Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous, 221 reviews)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n---\n\n#### Availability on **November 26, 2024 (Day After Tomorrow)**\n1. **Budget**\n   - **Vehicle:** Dodge Grand Caravan\n   - **Price:** $606.86\n   - **Rating:** 7.1 (Good, 698 reviews)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Car Rental Centre\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Special Offer:** Premium Package (includes 1 additional driver and first tank of fuel free)\n\n2. **Avis**\n   - **Vehicle:** Chrysler Town & Country\n   - **Price:** $630.56\n   - **Rating:** 7.3 (Good, 263 reviews)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Car Rental Centre\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n---\n\n### User Reviews for **Budget (Non-Hertz Supplier)**\n\n#### Overall Rating\n- **Score:** 7.1 (Good)\n- **Based on:** 698 reviews\n\n#### Breakdown of Ratings:\n1. **Overall Value for Money:** 6.9\n2. **Helpfulness:** 6.4\n3. **Pick-up Speed:** 4.0\n4. **Drop-off Speed:** 9.6\n5. **Car Cleanliness:** 8.1\n\n#### Sample Customer Reviews:\n1. **Family Trip (Rating: 8.0)**\n   - **Positive:** Clean vehicle.\n   - **Negative:** Additional costs charged that weren't agreed upon.\n   - **Date:** October 17, 2024\n\n2. **Couple Trip (Rating: 7.7)**\n   - **Positive:** The car was good.\n   - **Negative:** Misleading pricing for fuel; took over 2 hours to pick up the car.\n   - **Date:** October 1, 2024\n\n3. **Group Trip (Rating: 7.7)**\n   - **Positive:** Received an upgraded vehicle.\n   - **Negative:** Long waiting time at the rental desk (1.5 hours); unclear additional driver policy.\n   - **Date:** October 10, 2024\n\n### Summary\n- **Availability:** Cars are available for both dates (November 25 and 26, 2024).\n- **Non-Hertz Options:** Budget and Avis are available with competitive pricing and good ratings.\n- **Recommendation:** If you prefer a non-Hertz supplier, **Budget** offers a good balance of price and quality with a special package.\n\nWould you like to proceed with a booking or need more details?"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "con