e and Model**: MG ZS\n- **Car Type**: Intermediate\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Seats**: 5\n- **Doors**: 4\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Suitcase Capacity**: \n  - Small: 0\n  - Big: 3\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same fuel level as pickup)\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Drive Away Price**: $219.60 (USD)\n- **Base Price**: $101.37 (USD)\n- **Deposit**: $101.37 (USD)\n- **Included Fees**:\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Additional Fees**:\n  - One Way Fee: $118.23 (USD)\n  - Damage Excess: $3,612.68 (USD) (payable at counter)\n  - Theft Excess: $3,612.68 (USD) (payable at counter)\n  - Deposit: $985.28 (USD) (payable at counter)\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier**: Goldcar\n- **Supplier Rating**: 7.7/10 (Good) based on 180 reviews\n- **Pickup Location**: \n  - **Address**: 342 King Street, Mascot, Sydney, Australia, NSW 2020\n  - **Type**: Shuttle Bus\n- **Drop-off Location**: \n  - **Address**: 189D South Centre Road, Tullamarine, Melbourne, Australia\n  - **Type**: Shuttle Bus\n- **Pickup Instructions**: \n  - Call +61 2 9207 9404 to request a shuttle pick-up.\n  - Wait at Bay 22 for the blue 'Park on King' shuttle van.\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card Requirement**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name at pick-up.\n- **Additional Services** (Extra Cost):\n  - **Additional Driver**: $12.81 (USD) per rental\n  - **Baby Seat**: $19.71 (USD) per rental (for babies up to 9 kg / 20 lbs)\n  - **Child Seat**: $19.71 (USD) per rental (for children 9-18 kg / 20-40 lbs)\n  - **Booster Seat**: $19.71 (USD) per rental (for children 18-45 kg / 40-100 lbs)\n\n### Summary\n- **Pickup**: Sydney Kingsford Smith Airport on November 26, 2024, at 10:00 AM\n- **Drop-off**: Melbourne Airport on November 28, 2024, at 3:00 PM\n- **Total Rental Duration**: 3 days\n\nI