**: Car Rental Centre\n- **Pick-Up Location**: \n  - **Address**: 780, McDonnell Road, San Francisco, USA, 94128\n  - **Coordinates**: Latitude 37.6189, Longitude -122.375\n- **Drop-Off Location**:\n  - **Address**: 1659 Airport Boulevard, San Jose, USA, 95110\n  - **Coordinates**: Latitude 37.36476729, Longitude -121.9223305\n- **Opening Hours**:\n  - **Pick-Up (Nov 20)**: 07:00 AM - 11:00 PM\n  - **Drop-Off (Nov 22)**: Open 24 hours\n- **Pick-Up Instructions**: Take the \"AirTrain\" Blue Line to the \"Rental Car Station\" stop.\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Method**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Security Deposit**: $640.96 (refundable)\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating**: 7.9/10\n- **Key Feedback**:\n  - **Positive**: \n    - \"Brand new VW SUV\" (Rating: 9.1/10)\n    - \"No problems.\" (Rating: 8.9/10)\n  - **Negative**:\n    - \"Large line to pick up car. Processing was slow.\" (Rating: 9.1/10)\n    - \"Had to pay extra insurance and taxes.\" (Rating: 6.9/10)\n\n### Extras Available\n- **Additional Driver**: $40.50 per rental\n- **Baby Seat**: $41.97 per rental (for babies up to 9 kg)\n- **Child Seat**: $41.97 per rental (for children 9-18 kg)\n- **Booster Seat**: $41.97 per rental (for children 18-45 kg)\n\n### Insurance Package\n- **Total Protection Price**: $26.49\n- **Coverage**: ₹236,400 of Extra Cover from RentalCover.com.\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need more information?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
