"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.2, "displayValue": "9.2"}, "score": "9.2"}], "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.8", "rawValue": 8.8}, "title": "Fabulous", "subtitle": "156 reviews", "average": "8.8"}, "name": "Goldcar"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"priceInformation": {"items": [{"text": "The price in ₹ (INR) has been converted to show you the approximate price in US$ (USD).", "icon": "EXCHANGE"}, {"text": "You'll pay for your car today in ₹ (INR). If you pay for anything when you pick up the car, you'll pay in A$ (AUD).", "icon": "HAND"}], "title": "About the price"}, "footer": {"subtitle": "Total rental price", "title": "US$326.64", "cta": {"title": "Next step"}}, "priceBreakdown": {"total": {"primaryPrice": {"prefix": "approx.", "price": "US$326.64"}, "title": "Total rental price", "subtitle": "(including any taxes, fees & extras)"}, "sections": [{"subtotal": {"secondaryPrice": "(₹ 17,082.43)", "primaryPrice": {"price": "US$204.14", "title": "Subtotal", "prefix": "approx."}, "title": "Payable today"}, "items": [{"price": "US$204.14", "title": "Car rental price"}]}, {"subtotal": {"secondaryPrice": "(AUD 180.00)", "title": "Payable at pickup", "primaryPrice": {"title": "Subtotal", "prefix": "approx.", "price": "US$122.50"}}, "items": [{"title": "One way fee", "price": "US$122.50"}]}]}, "product": {"vehicle": {"title": "Nissan Juke", "subtitle": "or similar"}, "duration": "7 days", "supplier": {"name": "Goldcar"}, "pickUp": {"dateTime": "Fri, 01 Nov · 09:00", "name": "Sydney Kingsford Smith Airport"}, "dropOff": {"dateTime": "Thu, 07 Nov · 15:00", "name": "Melbourne Airport"}}, "title": "Booking summary"}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Details\n- **Make and Model:** Nissan Juke\n- **Vehicle Type:** Compact car\n- **Transmission:** Automatic\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Doors:** 4\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n- **Suitcases Capacity:** \n  - Big: 0\n  - Small: 3\n- **Airbags:** Yes\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n- **Unlimited Mileage:** Yes\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Goldcar\n- **Supplier Rating:** 8.8 (Fabulous) based on 156 reviews\n- **Location Type:** Shuttle Bus\n- **Pickup Address:** 342 King Street, Mascot, Sydney, Australia, NSW 2020\n- **Drop-off Address:** 189D South Centre Road, Tullamarine, Melbourne, Australia\n- **Pickup Instructions:** \n  - Call '0061292079404' to arrange the shuttle service.\n  - A blue shuttle with 'Park on King/Goldcar' will take you to the rental counter.\n  - If the counter staff are unavailable, exit through the main doors on the Arrivals level and wait at Bay 5 (Domestic Terminal) or Bay 22 (International Terminal).\n\n### Booking Summary\n- **Pickup Location:** Sydney Kingsford Smith Airport\n- **Pickup Date & Time:** November 1, 2024, at 09:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Location:** Melbourne Airport\n- **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 7, 2024, at 03:00 PM\n- **Rental Duration:** 7 days\n- **Total Rental Price:** **US$326.64** (approx. ₹17,082.43)\n  - **Payable Today:** US$204.14 (approx. ₹17,082.43)\n  - **Payable at Pickup:** US$122.50 (approx. AUD 180.00)\n\n#### What's Included:\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW).\n- Theft Cover.\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL).\n\n#### Important Information:\n- **Payment Card Required:** The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Security Deposit:** AUD 1,500 (approx. US$1,020.83) payable at pickup.\n- **Damage Excess:** AUD 5,500 (approx. US$3,743.03).\n- **Theft Excess:** AUD 5,500 (approx. US$3,743.03).\n\n### Customer Reviews (Goldcar)\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.8/10 (Fabulous)\n- **Recent Reviews:**\n  - **Rating:** 8.3/10 (Couple)\n    - *Positive:* \"Great service, staff very friendly and professional.\"\n    - *Negative:* \"Could not call on phone for shuttle, had to pay for cab. Car had terrible turbo lag.\"\n  \n  - **Rating:** 9.1/10 (Family)\n    - *Positive:* \"Friendly staff.\"\n    - *Negative:* \"Make of car - MG only 3 cylinders.\"\n\n  - **Rating:** 10/10 (Solo Traveller)\n    - *Positive:* \"Staff were happy and courteous! So easy to deal with.\"\n\n### Extras Available:\n- **Additional Driver:** US$30.94 per rental.\n- **Baby Seat:** US$47.67 per rental (for babies up to 9 kg).\n- **Booster Seat:** US$47.67 per rental (for children 18-45 kg).\n- **Child Seat:** US$47.67 per rental (for children 9-18 kg).\n\n### Next Steps:\n- **Confirm Booking:** Proceed to the next step to finalize your reservation.\n- **Review Rental Terms:** Ensure you understand all terms and conditions before confirming.\n\nIf you have any further questions or need assistance, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
