Q / Off-airport. I had no instructions on how to get from the airport to the HQ.", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.6", "rawValue": 8.6}, "rating": "8.6", "type": "Family"}, {"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8, "displayValue": "8"}, "rating": "8.0", "type": "Couple", "epochDay": 20002, "negative": "You quoted full insurance \nBut it was with a third party\nYou then sent an email whilst I was on the trip requesting more money for the insurance to be covered\nVery poor form!", "date": "Sun, Oct 6 2024"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.1", "rawValue": 7.1}, "rating": "7.1", "type": "Couple", "epochDay": 19992, "date": "Thu, Sept 26 2024", "negative": "Was expecting i30 or similar and did end up getting a vehicle not familiar with. The car was much bigger than a i30 which is a hatchback receive a larger type of sedan car. "}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "10", "rawValue": 10}, "rating": "10", "type": "Family", "positive": "Great customer service and friendly smiles.", "epochDay": 19992, "negative": "Nothing", "date": "Thu, Sept 26 2024"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "10", "rawValue": 10}, "type": "Solo traveller", "rating": "10", "positive": "Efficient and easy ", "epochDay": 19991, "date": "Wed, Sept 25 2024"}]}, "supplier": {"title": "Rental company", "name": "Europcar", "rating": {"breakdown": [{"score": "7.1", "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.1, "displayValue": "7.1"}}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.9", "rawValue": 7.9}, "title": "Helpfulness", "score": "7.9"}, {"title": "Pick-up speed", "score": "7.6", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.6, "displayValue": "7.6"}}, {"score": "8.9", "title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.6", "rawValue": 8.6}, "title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "8.6"}], "title": "Very good", "subtitle": "2,300 reviews", "average": "8.0", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8, "displayValue": "8"}}}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"priceBreakdown": {"sections": [{"subtotal": {"title": "Payable today", "primaryPrice": {"title": "Subtotal", "prefix": "approx.", "price": "US$1,557.07"}, "secondaryPrice": "(₹ 130,956.16)"}, "items": [{"price": "US$1,557.07", "title": "Car rental price"}]}, {"items": [{"price": "US$1,341.30", "title": "One way fee"}], "subtotal": {"primaryPrice": {"prefix": "approx.", "price": "US$1,341.30", "title": "Subtotal"}, "title": "Payable at pickup", "secondaryPrice": "(AUD 2,000.00)"}}], "total": {"primaryPrice": {"prefix": "approx.", "price": "US$2,898.37"}, "title": "Total rental price", "subtitle": "(including any taxes, fees & extras)"}}, "title": "Booking summary", "product": {"dropOff": {"name": "Alexandria Downtown", "dateTime": "Thu, 14 Nov · 16:00"}, "supplier": {"name": "Europcar"}, "pickUp": {"dateTime": "Sun, 10 Nov · 10:00", "name": "Melbourne Airport"}, "vehicle": {"title": "Tesla Model Y", "subtitle": "or similar"}, "duration": "5 days"}, "footer": {"cta": {"title": "Next step"}, "subtitle": "Total rental price", "title": "US$2,898.37"}, "priceInformation": {"items": [{"text": "The price in ₹ (INR) has been converted to show you the approximate price in US$ (USD).", "icon": "EXCHANGE"}, {"icon": "HAND", "text": "You'll pay for your car today in ₹ (INR). If you pay for anything when you pick up the car, you'll pay in A$ (AUD)."}], "title": "About the price"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Details\n- **Make and Model**: Tesla Model Y\n- **Car Class**: Premium\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Seats**: 5\n- **Doors**: 5\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (Return the car with the same battery charge level as at pickup)\n- **Unlimited Mileage**: No\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n- **Green Vehicle**: Fully electric\n- **Suitcase Capacity**: \n  - Small: 3\n  - Big: 0\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier**: Europcar\n- **Supplier Rating**: 8.0/10 (Very Good) based on 2,300 reviews\n- **Pickup Location**: \n  - **Name**: Melbourne Airport\n  - **Address**: Arrival Drive, T2 Terminal Building, Tullamarine, Australia, VIC 3045\n  - **Location Type**: In Terminal\n- **Drop-off Location**: \n  - **Name**: Alexandria Downtown\n  - **Address**: 1053, Bourke Street, Waterloo, Australia, NSW 2017\n  - **Location Type**: Downtown\n\n### Supplier Reviews\nEuropcar has received positive feedback from customers:\n- **Overall Value for Money**: 7.1/10\n- **Helpfulness**: 7.9/10\n- **Pickup Speed**: 7.6/10\n- **Drop-off Speed**: 8.9/10\n- **Car Cleanliness**: 8.6/10\n\n#### Sample Customer Reviews:\n1. **Rating**: 8.6/10 (Excellent)  \n   - **Positive**: \"New and reliable car. Help from Europcar at the airport to get me to Europcar HQ.\"  \n   - **Negative**: \"Having not been at Melbourne Airport before I thought I'd be picking up the car at the airport. However, I had to get it from the HQ / Off-airport. I had no instructions on how to get from the airport to the HQ.\"  \n   - **Date**: Fri, Oct 11, 2024\n\n2. **Rating**: 8.0/10 (Very Good)  \n   - **Negative**: \"You quoted full insurance but it was with a third party. You then sent an email whilst I was on the trip requesting more money for the insurance to be covered. Very poor form!\"  \n   - **Date**: Sun, Oct 6, 2024\n\n### Booking Summary\n- **Pickup Date & Time**: November 10, 2024, at 10:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Date & Time**: November 14, 2024, at 4:00 PM\n- **Rental Duration**: 5 days\n- **Vehicle**: Tesla Model Y (or similar)\n\n#### Price Breakdown\n- **Payable Today (Approx.)**:  \n  - **Car Rental Price**: US$1,557.07 (₹130,956.16)  \n  - **Total**: **US$1,557.07**  \n- **Payable at Pickup**:  \n  - **One Way Fee**: US$1,341.30 (AUD 2,000.00)  \n  - **Total**: **US$1,341.30**  \n\n#### Total Rental Price (Including Taxes, Fees & Extras)\n- **Approx. Total**: **US$2,898.37**\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card Requirement**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Free Cancellation**: Up to 48 hours before pickup.\n- **Insurance**: Includes Collision Damage Waiver (CDW), Theft Cover, and Third-Party Liability (TPL).\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: US$23.45 (AUD 35)\n2. **Snow Chains**: US$55.35 (AUD 82.50)\n3. **Baby Seat**: US$55.35 (AUD 82.50)\n4. **Booster Seat**: US$55.35 (AUD 82.50)\n5. **Child Seat**: US$55.35 (AUD 82.50)\n\nIf you'd like to proceed with the booking or need any further assistance, please let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
