International Airport, Brisbane, Australia, QLD 4008\n  - **Location Type**: In Terminal\n- **Drop-off Location**: \n  - **Address**: Sugarbird Lady Road, Perth, Australia, WA 6105\n  - **Location Type**: In Terminal\n\n### Customer Reviews (Hertz)\n- **Overall Rating**: 8.9\n- **Key Highlights**:\n  - **Value for Money**: 8.2\n  - **Helpfulness**: 8.8\n  - **Pick-up Speed**: 8.3\n  - **Drop-off Speed**: 9.6\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 9.3\n\n#### Recent Customer Feedback:\n1. **Rating**: 9.7 (Group)\n   - **Positive**: \"Hertz has always been great. I have a membership with them and even though I hadn’t used them for a couple of years all my details were there.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"The insurance package offered was more expensive than Hertz internal package and required a Hertz package to action.\"\n   - **Date**: October 22, 2024\n\n2. **Rating**: 9.7 (Couple)\n   - **Positive**: \"Value.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"Nothing.\"\n   - **Date**: October 15, 2024\n\n3. **Rating**: 9.1 (Couple)\n   - **Positive**: \"Great heads-up display.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"Nothing.\"\n   - **Date**: October 12, 2024\n\n### Booking Summary\n- **Pick-up**: \n  - **Date**: November 15, 2024\n  - **Time**: 08:00 AM\n  - **Location**: Brisbane Airport\n- **Drop-off**: \n  - **Date**: November 21, 2024\n  - **Time**: 02:00 AM\n  - **Location**: Perth Airport\n- **Duration**: 6 days\n\n#### Price Breakdown\n- **Subtotal (Payable Today)**:\n  - **Car Rental Price**: US$958.57 (₹80,620.20)\n- **Additional Fees (Payable at Pickup)**:\n  - **One Way Fee**: US$1,215.48 (AUD 1,830.40)\n- **Total Rental Price**: **approx. US$2,174.05**\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Requirement**: The main driver must have a credit or debit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Security Deposit**: A deposit of **US$132.81** (AUD 200) is required at pick-up.\n- **Damage Excess**: **US$3,917.90** (AUD 5,900) is applicable.\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: US$18.26 per rental\n2. **Baby Seat**: US$58.44 per rental\n3. **Booster Seat**: US$58.44 per rental\n4. **Child Seat**: US$58.44 per rental\n\n### Next Steps\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or explore other options?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
