n- **Suitcases:** \n  - Big: 1\n  - Small: 1\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel as when picked up)\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n\n#### Pricing Information\n- **Base Price:** ₹47,853.77 (approx. **$568.98 USD**)\n- **Drive Away Price:** **$1,897.08 USD** (approximate)\n- **Payable Today:** **$568.98 USD** (approx. ₹47,853.77)\n- **Payable at Pickup:** **$1,328.10 USD** (approx. AUD $2,000.00)\n  - **One Way Fee:** $1,328.10 USD (for returning the car at a different location)\n\n#### Total Rental Price\n- **Approximate Total:** **$1,897.08 USD**\n\n#### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier:** Ace Rental Cars\n- **Supplier Rating:** 9.0/10 (Superb)\n- **Number of Reviews:** 1,614\n- **Location Type:** Shuttle Bus\n- **Pickup Instructions:** \n  - Call **1800 620 408** or **+61 8 9479 5016** after collecting your luggage.\n  - Shuttle departs 30 minutes before closing time.\n  - Wait at designated signs:\n    - T1 Domestic: Outside main door by T1 domestic sign.\n    - T1 International: Outside main door at bus stand L.\n    - T3 & T4: Outside at the center lane next to rideshare sign.\n\n#### Pickup and Drop-off Details\n- **Pickup Location:** \n  - **Name:** Perth Airport (PER)\n  - **Address:** 17 Ross Drive, Perth, WA 6105, Australia\n  - **Date & Time:** November 20, 2024, at 09:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Location:** \n  - **Name:** Brisbane Airport (BNE)\n  - **Address:** 330 Nudgee Road, Brisbane, QLD 4011, Australia\n  - **Date & Time:** November 26, 2024, at 03:00 PM\n\n#### What's Included\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n#### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating:** 9.0/10 (Superb)\n- **Recent Reviews:**\n  1. **Rating:** 9.7/10 (Couple)\n     - **Positive:** \"All perfect and easy.\"\n  2. **Rating:** 6.9/10 (Family)\n     - **Positive:** \"Cleanliness of the car.\"\n     - **Negative:** \"Took too long to pick up the car.\"\n  3. **Rating:** 10/10 (Couple)\n     - **Positive:** \"Perfect for our needs. Staff were great.\"\n  4. **Rating:** 9.7/10 (Solo Traveller)\n     - **Positive:** \"Loved the car.\"\n\n### Next Steps\n1. **Confirm Booking:** Proceed to the next step to finalize your reservation.\n2. **Review Rental Terms:** Ensure you understand the terms, including payment methods and cancellation policies.\n3. **Prepare for Pickup:** Have a credit or debit card in the main driver's name ready at pickup.\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need any further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
