nd Transportation'. Wait for the blue and white McCarran Rent-A-Car shuttle bus.\n\n### Booking Summary\n- **Pickup Date & Time**: Thursday, December 5, 2024, at 10:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Date & Time**: Wednesday, December 11, 2024, at 4:00 PM\n- **Rental Duration**: 7 days\n- **Total Price**: **US$343.68** (including taxes and fees)\n  - **Payable Today**: **US$236.87**\n  - **Payable at Pickup**: **US$106.81** (includes fees like AP CONC FEE RECOV, COUNTY MVR TAX, etc.)\n\n### Important Information\n1. **Payment Card Requirement**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n2. **Deposit**: A deposit of **US$267.20 - US$668.01** is required at pickup.\n3. **Free Cancellation**: Available up to 48 hours before pickup.\n4. **Included in Price**:\n   - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n   - Theft Cover\n   - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Customer Reviews\n- **Overall Rating**: 7.5/10\n- **Key Feedback**:\n  - **Value for Money**: 7.1/10\n  - **Helpfulness**: 7.0/10\n  - **Pickup Speed**: 5.9/10\n  - **Drop-off Speed**: 9.2/10\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 7.8/10\n\n### Extras Available\n- **Additional Driver**: US$89.60\n- **Baby Seat**: US$97.93\n- **Booster Seat**: US$97.93\n- **Child Seat**: US$97.93\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need any further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
