er Reviews\n1. **Rating:** 9.7 (Couple) - \"Darryl was the desk clerk. He was just adorable and gave us an upgrade, to just make our day.\" (Sat, Oct 12 2024)\n2. **Rating:** 8.0 (Couple) - \"First car we had the dashboard computer didn’t work. It was replaced with another car which was fine until our last day when the battery went dead.\" (Sun, Oct 6 2024)\n3. **Rating:** 9.7 (Solo Traveller) - \"The ease of renting a car in the US.\" (Tue, Oct 1 2024)\n\n### Booking Summary\n- **Pickup Date & Time:** Sun, 01 Dec · 11:00\n- **Drop-off Date & Time:** Sat, 07 Dec · 17:00\n- **Duration:** 7 days\n\n#### Price Breakdown\n- **Car Rental Price:** $280.51 USD (Payable today)\n- **One Way Fee:** $98.25 USD (Payable at pickup)\n- **Total Rental Price (approx.):** $378.76 USD (including taxes and fees)\n\n#### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pickup:** Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n- **Security Deposit:** $684.96 USD (included in the total price).\n\n### What's Included\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Extras Available\n- **Additional Driver:** $94.50 USD\n- **Baby Seat:** $91.00 USD\n- **Booster Seat:** $91.00 USD\n- **Child Seat:** $91.00 USD\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need any further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including detailed information about the vehicle, the supplier, and the booking summary."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
