unt": 0, "taxIncluded": true}, "distanceUnit": "M"}, {"alwaysPayable": true, "price": {"taxIncluded": true, "currency": "AUD", "maximumAmount": 5500, "minimumAmount": 5500, "amount": 5500}, "distanceUnit": "M", "displayPrice": {"minimumAmount": 3652.28, "amount": 3652.28, "maximumAmount": 3652.28, "currency": "USD", "taxIncluded": true}, "includedInPrice": false, "name": "DAMAGE_EXCESS", "unlimited": false}]}, "label": "Standard car with:", "id": "733424481", "price": {"payWhen": "PAY_NOW", "display": {"currency": "USD", "value": 390.19}, "driveAway": {"value": 523, "currency": "USD"}, "driveAwayBefore": {"value": 566.36, "currency": "USD"}, "displayBefore": {"currency": "USD", "value": 433.55}, "driveAwayPriceIsApprox": true, "base": {"currency": "INR", "value": 32816.77}}, "freeCancellation": true, "carClass": "Standard"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"customerReviews": {"sort": {"pageTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"id": "score.descending", "label": "Highest scores"}, {"label": "Lowest scores", "id": "score.ascending"}, {"id": "date.descending", "label": "Newest first"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}, "ctaTitle": "Sort by"}, "title": "Customer reviews", "reviews": [{"negative": "To much hidden fees.\nRental from the car supplier.\nPrice from booking.com is not really the final price. It’s haven’t included the hidden price from the supplier", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.4, "displayValue": "5.4"}, "type": "Group", "rating": "5.4", "epochDay": 20021, "date": "Fri, Oct 25 2024"}, {"epochDay": 20020, "date": "Thu, Oct 24 2024", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "negative": "Taking a bus to and from hire car desk", "rating": "8.9", "type": "Couple"}, {"rating": "5.1", "type": "Couple", "positive": "Not much", "negative": "Next to zero information on where to get picked up and taken to actual offsite depot. \nWhen called to find out the operator had no information and could not tell me where to get picked up from.\nBooked the car with return time of 5am. Was informed at the time of pick up that they in fact are not open at 5am and didn’t have a shuttle bus service until 5:30am. To which I explained that was too late for my flight to which they just explained you can leave the car out the front and arrange an Uber to the airport. This is exactly what we did and despite several calls to confirm the car was left out the front and request someone to confirm they had it, 4 days later we are yet to receive confirmation or our deposit back. Will never book them again", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.1, "displayValue": "5.1"}, "date": "Mon, Oct 21 2024", "epochDay": 20017}, {"epochDay": 20014, "date": "Fri, Oct 18 2024", "negative": "The upgrade to a Ford Everest was a $8000 excess not the $5900 for the Pajero.\nEuropcar made it very clear they didn't recognise the insurance cover and made me doubt if I was covered or not.  In the end I paid an additional $800 for Europcar nil excess cover for peace of mind.  That in effect doubled the cost of the hire and was very poor value for money.\nIt felt like a scam!!!", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.7, "displayValue": "5.7"}, "rating": "5.7", "type": "Couple", "positive": "The car was good but...."}, {"rating": "6.0", "type": "Solo traveller", "positive": "Nothing", "negative": "Lazy, rude attendant. \nI ended up with a Haval!! Worst car I have ever driven. \nNo explanation given on the vehicle’s idiosyncrasies or where to find anything! He didn’t leave his desk. \nI would never use Europcar again, or Booking.com. Amount to pay at pickup was quoted by Booking.com at $250. When in reality I had to pay $350-ish before they’d release the car. “Taxes” was the explanation. \n*Staff at drop off in Brisbane were excellent. ", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6", "rawValue": 6}, "date": "Thu, Oct 17 2024", "epochDay": 20013}]}, "supplier": {"name": "Europcar", "rating": {"average": "6.8", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.8, "displayValue": "6.8"}, "subtitle": "1,442 reviews", "title": "OK", "breakdown": [{"score": "5.7", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 5.7, "displayValue": "5.7"}, "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire"}, {"title": "Helpfulness", "score": "6.2", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.2, "displayValue": "6.2"}}, {"title": "Pick-up speed", "score": "6.5", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "6.5", "rawValue": 6.5}}, {"localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.2, "displayValue": "8.2"}, "score": "8.2", "title": "Drop-off speed"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.2", "rawValue": 8.2}, "score": "8.2", "title": "Car cleanliness"}]}, "title": "Rental company"}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"title": "Booking summary", "footer": {"cta": {"title": "Next step"}, "subtitle": "Total rental price", "title": "US$523.00"}, "product": {"vehicle": {"subtitle": "or similar", "title": "MG HS"}, "pickUp": {"dateTime": "Mon, 25 Nov · 08:00", "name": "Sydney Kingsford Smith Airport"}, "dropOff": {"dateTime": "Sun, 01 Dec · 14:00", "name": "Melbourne Airport"}, "duration": "7 days", "supplier": {"name": "Europcar"}}, "priceBreakdown": {"total": {"primaryPrice": {"price": "US$523.00", "prefix": "approx."}, "subtitle": "(including any taxes, fees & extras)", "title": "Total rental price"}, "sections": [{"items": [{"title": "Car rental price", "price": "US$433.55"}, {"subtitle": "Europcar are giving you this discount", "title": "10% off car rental price*", "price": "US$-43.35", "note": "* Applies to cost of car only"}], "subtotal": {"primaryPrice": {"price": "US$390.19", "prefix": "approx.", "title": "Subtotal"}, "title": "Payable today", "secondaryPrice": "(₹ 32,816.77)"}}, {"items": [{"price": "US$132.81", "title": "One way fee"}], "subtotal": {"primaryPrice": {"prefix": "approx.", "title": "Subtotal", "price": "US$132.81"}, "secondaryPrice": "(AUD 200.00)", "title": "Payable at pickup"}}]}, "priceInformation": {"items": [{"text": "The price in ₹ (INR) has been converted to show you the approximate price in US$ (USD).", "icon": "EXCHANGE"}, {"icon": "HAND", "text": "You'll pay for your car today in ₹ (INR). If you pay for anything when you pick up the car, you'll pay in A$ (AUD)."}], "title": "About the price"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Car Rental Details\nYou're planning to rent a car from **Sydney Kingsford Smith Airport** on **November 25, 2024, at 8:00 AM** and return it at **Melbourne Airport** on **December 1, 2024, at 2:00 PM**. Below are the details of the vehicle, supplier, and booking summary:\n\n#### Vehicle Information\n- **Make and Model:** MG HS (Standard Car)\n- **Transmission:** Automatic\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Doors:** 4\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Suitcases Capacity:**\n  - Small: 1\n  - Big: 2\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel)\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n- **Rating:** 6.8/10 (Good)\n- **Average Customer Review:** 6.8/10 (Based on 1,442 reviews)\n\n#### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Europcar\n- **Supplier Address:** Sydney International Airport, Europcar Rental Desk - T2/T3, Mascot, Australia, NSW 2020\n- **Pick-up Instructions:** T2 / T3 domestic terminals - exit the building and go to the Europcar shuttle bus waiting bay (opposite the baggage carousel).\n- **Supplier Rating:** 6.8/10 (OK)\n- **Customer Reviews Highlights:**\n  - **Positive:** \"The car was good.\"\n  - **Negative:** \"Too much hidden fees. Price from booking.com is not really the final price.\"\n  - **Recent Review:** \"Next to zero information on where to get picked up and taken to actual offsite depot.\"\n\n#### Booking Summary\n- **Total Rental Price:** Approximately **US$523.00** (including taxes, fees & extras)\n- **Breakdown:**\n  - **Car Rental Price:** US$433.55\n  - **Discount (10% off car rental price):** US$-43.35\n  - **Subtotal (Payable Today):** Approximately US$390.19\n  - **One Way Fee (Payable at Pickup):** US$132.81 (AUD 200.00)\n- **Payment Method:** Credit card required at pick-up (main driver must have a credit card in their own name).\n- **Important Information:** \n  - Security deposit required: AUD 200 (approx. US$132.81)\n  - Damage excess: AUD 5,500 (approx. US$3,652.28)\n\n### Additional Options\n- **Insurance:** Full Protection available for **US$158.01** (refunds your deposit if the car is damaged or stolen).\n- **Extras:**\n  - Additional Driver: US$32.55 per rental\n  - Baby Seat: US$58.44 per rental\n  - Booster Seat: US$58.44 per rental\n  - Child Seat: US$58.44 per rental\n  - Snow Chains: US$76.72 per rental\n\n### Next Steps\nIf you'd like to proceed with the booking or need further assistance, please let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
