 Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information:**\n  - Payment card at pick-up: Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n- **Extras Available:**\n  - Additional driver: $105\n  - Mobile WiFi: $154\n  - Baby seat: $98\n  - Booster seat: $98\n  - Child seat: $98\n\n---\n\n### Option 2: Kia e-Niro (Compact Car - Fully Electric)\n- **Supplier:** Dollar\n- **Rating:** 7.9/10 (Good, based on 4,421 reviews)\n- **Price:** $425.49 (USD)\n- **Pick-up Location:** San Francisco International Airport (Car Rental Center)\n- **Drop-off Location:** San Diego International Airport\n- **Pick-up Date & Time:** November 20, 2024, at 09:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 26, 2024, at 04:00 PM\n- **Specifications:**\n  - **Transmission:** Automatic\n  - **Seats:** 5\n  - **Doors:** 5\n  - **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n  - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n  - **Suitcases Capacity:** 1 small, 1 big\n  - **Fuel Policy:** Like for like (return with the same battery level)\n- **Included:**\n  - Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information:**\n  - Payment card at pick-up: Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n- **Extras Available:**\n  - Additional driver: $94.50\n  - Baby seat: $97.93\n  - Booster seat: $97.93\n  - Child seat: $97.93\n\n### Summary:\n- **Option 1** offers a spacious vehicle suitable for larger groups or families, with a higher price point.\n- **Option 2** is an eco-friendly electric car, more budget-friendly but smaller in size.\n\nBoth options provide unlimited mileage and essential coverages. Lily can choose based on her preferences for space, budget, and environmental considerations."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
