llar rated 7.0 out of 10 (Good) based on 8,154 reviews.\n\n#### Option 2: Volkswagen Jetta (Standard Car)\n- **Make & Model**: Volkswagen Jetta\n- **Rental Duration**: 6 days (November 10, 2024, 8 AM to November 15, 2024, 6 PM)\n- **Pickup Location**: Los Angeles International Airport (LAX)\n- **Drop-off Location**: Philadelphia International Airport (PHL)\n- **Price**:\n  - **Base Price**: $236.87 USD\n  - **Drive Away Price**: Approximately $480.20 USD\n- **Specifications**:\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 2\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same fuel level)\n- **What's Included**:\n  - Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information**:\n  - **Payment Card at Pick-up**: Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n  - **Supplier Rating**: Dollar rated 7.0 out of 10 (Good) based on 8,154 reviews.\n\n### Summary\nBoth options provide reliable vehicles with unlimited mileage and essential inclusions like free cancellation and insurance coverage. The **Volkswagen Jetta** is slightly cheaper in base price, while the **Nissan Sentra** offers a comparable drive-away price. Lily can choose based on her preference for car type or budget."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
