:\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 2/4\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel)\n  - **Suitcases**: Small (1), Big (1)\n- **Important Info**:\n  - **Payment Card**: Credit card required at pickup (in the driver's name).\n  - **Security Deposit**: $250.\n\n---\n\n### Car 2: Ford Escape (Intermediate)\n- **Supplier**: Avis\n- **Rating**: 6.6/10 (OK, based on 240 reviews)\n- **Pickup Location**: Denver International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n  - **Address**: 8500, Peña Boulevard, Denver, CO, USA, 80249\n  - **Instructions**: Exit baggage claim and proceed to stand number 4 at the shuttle bus pickup zone.\n- **Drop-off Location**: Salt Lake City International Airport (In Terminal)\n  - **Address**: 3921 W Terminal Drive, Salt Lake City, UT, USA, 84116\n- **Price**: $821.09 (Total Drive Away Price)\n- **Deposit**: $250\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes (up to 48 hours before pickup)\n- **Specifications**:\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 4\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel)\n  - **Suitcases**: Big (3)\n- **Important Info**:\n  - **Payment Card**: Credit card required at pickup (in the driver's name).\n  - **Security Deposit**: $250.\n\n### Summary of Inclusions for Both Cars:\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pickup.\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW).\n- Theft Cover.\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL).\n\n### Optional Extras (Available for Both Cars):\n- **Additional Driver**: $65 (per rental).\n- **Baby Seat**: $87 (per rental).\n- **Child Seat**: $87 (per rental).\n- **Booster Seat**: $87 (per rental).\n- **GPS**: $135.92 (per rental).\n\nIf you need further assistance or booking details, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
