: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 2\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Suitcases**: 1 big, 1 small\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel)\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n- **Included Features**:\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information**:\n  - **Payment at Pickup**: Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n  - **Security Deposit**: $684.96 USD (maximum amount).\n\n### Option 2: Toyota Corolla (Intermediate)\n- **Supplier**: Hertz\n- **Rating**: 8.7/10 (Fabulous, based on 221 reviews)\n- **Pickup Location**: Seattle-Tacoma International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n  - **Address**: 3150 S 160th St, Suite 510, Seattle, WA 98158\n  - **Instructions**: Exit the baggage claim area and proceed to level 3 for the shuttle bus service to the rental office.\n- **Drop-off Location**: Portland International Airport (Car Rental Centre)\n  - **Address**: 7000 Northeast Airport Way, Portland, OR 97218\n- **Price Details**:\n  - **Base Price**: $330.32 USD\n  - **Drive Away Price**: $428.57 USD (approx.)\n  - **Deposit**: $684.96 USD (refundable)\n  - **One Way Fee**: $98.25 USD\n- **Car Specifications**:\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 4\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Suitcases**: 1 big, 1 small\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel)\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n- **Included Features**:\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information**:\n  - **Payment at Pickup**: Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n  - **Security Deposit**: $684.96 USD (maximum amount).\n\n### Additional Notes:\n- **Insurance**: Optional extra cover available for $65.97 USD, providing additional peace of mind.\n- **Extras Available**:\n  - Additional Driver: $108 USD\n  - Baby Seat: $91 USD\n  - Booster Seat: $91 USD\n  - Child Seat: $91 USD\n\nBoth options offer reliable vehicles with unlimited mileage and free cancellation. Choose based on your preference for car size and features!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
