rt Worth International Airport on November 20, 2024, and return at George Bush Intercontinental Airport in Houston on November 29, 2024:\n\n### 1. Volkswagen Jetta (Standard Car)\n- **Supplier:** Dollar\n- **Rating:** 6.7/10 (OK, based on 1,688 reviews)\n- **Pickup Location:** Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n  - **Address:** 2424, East 38th Street, Dallas, TX, USA, 75261\n- **Drop-off Location:** George Bush Intercontinental Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n  - **Address:** 17330 PALMETTO PINES, Houston, TX, USA, 77032\n- **Price:** \n  - **Display Price:** $413\n  - **Drive Away Price:** $512.59 (approx.)\n- **Specifications:**\n  - **Seats:** 5\n  - **Doors:** 2\n  - **Transmission:** Automatic\n  - **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n  - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n  - **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n  - **Suitcases:** 1 big, 1 small\n- **Included:**\n  - Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information:**\n  - **Payment Card at Pick-up:** Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n  - **Security Deposit:** $684.96 (approx.)\n\n### 2. Chevrolet Spark (Economy Car)\n- **Supplier:** Dollar\n- **Rating:** 6.7/10 (OK, based on 1,688 reviews)\n- **Pickup Location:** Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n  - **Address:** 2424, East 38th Street, Dallas, TX, USA, 75261\n- **Drop-off Location:** George Bush Intercontinental Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n  - **Address:** 17330 PALMETTO PINES, Houston, TX, USA, 77032\n- **Price:** \n  - **Display Price:** $408.32\n  - **Drive Away Price:** $507.91 (approx.)\n- **Specifications:**\n  - **Seats:** 4\n  - **Doors:** 2\n  - **Transmission:** Automatic\n  - **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n  - **Mileage:** Unlimited\n  - **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n  - **Suitcases:** 1 big, 1 small\n- **Included:**\n  - Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- **Important Information:**\n  - **Payment Card at Pick-up:** Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n  - **Security Deposit:** $684.96 (approx.)\n\n### Additional Notes:\n- **Extras Available:**\n  - **Additional Driver:** $135 (max 3 drivers)\n  - **Baby Seat:** $98 (for babies up to 9 kg / 20 lbs)\n  - **Booster Seat:** $98 (for children 18-45 kg / 40-100 lbs)\n  - **Child Seat:** $98 (for children 9-18 kg / 20-40 lbs)\n\n### Insurance Options:\n- **Extra Cover:** $82.47 (provides additional peace of mind beyond standard coverage).\n\nIf you need further assistance or wish to proceed with a booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
