e": "4.6", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "4.6", "rawValue": 4.6}, "title": "Pick-up speed"}, {"title": "Drop-off speed", "score": "6.8", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.8, "displayValue": "6.8"}}, {"title": "Car cleanliness", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.4, "displayValue": "7.4"}, "score": "7.4"}], "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 6.3, "displayValue": "6.3"}}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Details\n- **Make and Model:** Renault Kadjar\n- **Car Class:** Intermediate\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Number of Seats:** 5\n- **Number of Doors:** 4\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like\n- **Suitcases:** \n  - Big: 3\n  - Small: 0\n- **Price:** \n  - **Base Price:** $105.33 (USD)\n  - **Drive Away Price:** $310.06 (USD) (approx.)\n  - **Deposit:** $1508.50 (USD) (approx.)\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name:** Centauro\n- **Pickup Location:** Eleftherios Venizelos Airport, Athens\n- **Dropoff Location:** Thessaloniki Airport\n- **Supplier Rating:** 6.3 out of 10 (OK)\n- **Number of Reviews:** 3,999\n\n### Supplier Ratings Breakdown\n- **Overall Value for Money:** 6.6\n- **Helpfulness:** 6.0\n- **Pick-up Speed:** 4.6\n- **Drop-off Speed:** 6.8\n- **Car Cleanliness:** 7.4\n- **Car Condition:** 7.4\n\n### Customer Reviews\n1. **Rating:** 9.4\n   - **Type:** Couple\n   - **Positive:** \"Option to use LPG was a huge money saver and doubled our range in the hinterlands.\"\n   - **Negative:** \"The Citroen Clio has a suboptimal turning radius.\"\n   - **Date:** Tue, Oct 22 2024\n\n2. **Rating:** 3.4\n   - **Type:** Couple\n   - **Positive:** \"Nothing. Don't rent with this company.\"\n   - **Negative:** \"The shuttle from the airport was driven by a young man who blasted music and used his cellphone the whole time. The lineup was huge, and the staff was rude.\"\n   - **Date:** Tue, Oct 22 2024\n\n3. **Rating:** 9.1\n   - **Type:** Group\n   - **Positive:** \"No hassle, friendly staff.\"\n   - **Date:** Tue, Oct 22 2024\n\n4. **Rating:** 8.3\n   - **Type:** Couple\n   - **Positive:** \"Fast and easy.\"\n   - **Negative:** \"Half tank of fuel.\"\n   - **Date:** Mon, Oct 21 2024\n\n5. **Rating:** 6.9\n   - **Type:** Solo Traveller\n   - **Positive:** \"The car was exactly what I wanted.\"\n   - **Negative:** \"No staff available, long wait, and the car had half a tank of fuel.\"\n   - **Date:** Sun, Oct 20 2024\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pick-up:** Credit card required in the main driver's name.\n- **Security Deposit:** $1508.50 (approx.)\n- **One-Way Fee:** $204.73 (approx.)\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver:** $116.37\n2. **Snow Chains:** $96.97\n3. **Baby Seat:** $129.28\n4. **Booster Seat:** $129.28\n5. **Child Seat:** $129.28\n\n### Summary\nThe Renault Kadjar from Centauro is a suitable choice for your self-driving trip in Greece. While the supplier has mixed reviews, the vehicle offers good value with unlimited mileage and essential features. Be prepared for the deposit and ensure you have a credit card for pickup. If you need any additional services like child seats or snow chains, they are available at extra cost."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
