rawValue": 7.4, "displayValue": "7.4"}}, {"title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.3, "displayValue": "8.3"}, "score": "8.3"}, {"score": "7.1", "title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.1", "rawValue": 7.1}}, {"score": "8.7", "title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.7", "rawValue": 8.7}}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8.9", "rawValue": 8.9}, "title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "8.9"}], "average": "8.1", "title": "Very good", "subtitle": "1,726 reviews"}, "name": "Europcar"}, "customerReviews": {"reviews": [{"epochDay": 19985, "negative": "Unprofessional company and poor services, nobody to speak to solve your problems, they take advantage of each term in the contract just to steal money from their clients", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "2", "rawValue": 2}, "positive": "Nothing", "rating": "2.0", "date": "Thu, Sept 19 2024", "type": "Solo traveller"}, {"negative": "I booked a manual AUDI A3 car. On arrival I was told I had been upgraded. I asked to confirm it was a manual car. They not only said no but they did not have any manual cars at all. I advised that I had never driven an automatic and insisted they find me a manual car. After much discussion they said they could find me a VW Golf which was much smaller and in a lower price group. Reluctantly I accepted as I was going to travel long distances and that is why I had booked a larger car for comfort. Europcar confirmed that it was a lower category car which is much cheaper and they would contact you to give me some money back.", "epochDay": 19983, "date": "Tue, Sept 17 2024", "type": "Couple", "rating": "7.7", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "7.7", "rawValue": 7.7}}, {"date": "Sun, Sept 15 2024", "type": "Couple", "rating": "9.1", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.1", "rawValue": 9.1}, "negative": "Car was scanned and two minor scratches were recorded that were not visible to the naked eye and certainly not obvious in dark car park when picking up. Had to go to office to debate this and it turned out that these existed from previous rental. Attitude of drop off staff caused needless anxiety.", "epochDay": 19981}, {"epochDay": 19980, "negative": "Antifreeze was missing and I would expect it will be checked before I pick up the car ", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "positive": "Great car , great fit for a family . A lot of space . ", "rating": "9.4", "type": "Family", "date": "Sat, Sept 14 2024"}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "3.4", "rawValue": 3.4}, "rating": "3.4", "date": "Thu, Sept 5 2024", "type": "Group", "epochDay": 19971, "negative": "The shop closed before we arrived so we got our cars 24hours after we arrived and we had to spend 300 euros on taxi without reimbursement. no support from europcar or rental cars. \nwe arrived 23.10 at the shop and they closed 23.00 despite having our flight number...."}], "sort": {"pageTitle": "Sort by", "ctaTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"label": "Newest first", "id": "date.descending"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}}, "title": "Customer reviews"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Details\n- **Vehicle Model:** Skoda Scala\n- **Car Class:** Compact\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Doors:** 4\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Suitcases:** \n  - Small: 2\n  - Big: 0\n- **Fuel Policy:** Like for like (return with the same amount of fuel as at pick-up)\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n- **Pick-up Location:** \n  - **Address:** Flughafen Wien-Schwechat, Parkhaus 4, Wien, Austria, 1300\n  - **Type:** Car Rental Centre\n- **Drop-off Location:**\n  - **Address:** 51, Flughafenstraße, Feldkirchen bei Graz, Austria, 8073\n  - **Type:** In Terminal\n- **Price:**\n  - **Drive Away Price:** Approximately $451.49 USD\n  - **Base Price:** $422.55 USD\n  - **Deposit:** $422.55 USD\n- **Important Information:**\n  - **Payment Card:** The main driver must have a credit card in their own name at pick-up.\n  - **Included:**\n    - Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n    - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW).\n    - Theft Cover.\n    - Third-Party Liability (TPL).\n\n### Supplier Ratings (Europcar)\n- **Overall Rating:** 8.2/10 (Very Good)\n- **Number of Reviews:** 1,723\n- **Breakdown:**\n  - **Overall Value for Money:** 7.5\n  - **Helpfulness:** 8.4\n  - **Pick-up Speed:** 7.2\n  - **Drop-off Speed:** 8.8\n  - **Car Cleanliness:** 8.9\n  - **Car Condition:** 8.8\n\n### User Comments\n1. **Rating:** 2.0 (Solo Traveller)\n   - **Comment:** \"Unprofessional company and poor services. They take advantage of contract terms to charge extra money.\"\n   - **Date:** September 19, 2024\n\n2. **Rating:** 7.7 (Couple)\n   - **Comment:** \"Booked a manual AUDI A3 but received a VW Golf instead. They promised a refund for the downgrade.\"\n   - **Date:** September 17, 2024\n\n3. **Rating:** 9.1 (Couple)\n   - **Comment:** \"Minor scratches recorded at pick-up caused unnecessary anxiety. Drop-off staff were unhelpful.\"\n   - **Date:** September 15, 2024\n\n4. **Rating:** 9.4 (Family)\n   - **Comment:** \"Great car with ample space. Missing antifreeze was a minor issue.\"\n   - **Date:** September 14, 2024\n\n5. **Rating:** 3.4 (Group)\n   - **Comment:** \"Shop closed early, forcing us to spend €300 on taxis without reimbursement.\"\n   - **Date:** September 5, 2024\n\n### Summary\nYour friends can rent a **Skoda Scala** from **Europcar** at **Vienna International Airport** for approximately **$451.49 USD**. The car is compact, manual transmission, and includes unlimited mileage. Europcar has a good overall rating (8.2/10), but some users have reported issues with service quality and vehicle condition. Ensure they inspect the car thoroughly at pick-up and drop-off to avoid disputes."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
