alue": "9.4"}, "title": "Drop-off speed"}, {"score": "9.4", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}, "title": "Car cleanliness"}]}}}, {"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"supplier": {"name": "Sixt", "rating": {"subtitle": "996 reviews", "average": "8.6", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.6, "displayValue": "8.6"}, "breakdown": [{"score": "7.8", "title": "Overall value for money of your vehicle hire", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.8, "displayValue": "7.8"}}, {"title": "Helpfulness", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.5, "displayValue": "8.5"}, "score": "8.5"}, {"title": "Pick-up speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 7.5, "displayValue": "7.5"}, "score": "7.5"}, {"score": "9.4", "title": "Drop-off speed", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.4, "displayValue": "9.4"}}, {"localisedRating": {"displayValue": "9.4", "rawValue": 9.4}, "title": "Car cleanliness", "score": "9.4"}], "title": "Fabulous"}, "title": "Rental company"}, "customerReviews": {"reviews": [{"positive": "Mohammed the best guy... ", "rating": "10", "epochDay": 20000, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "10", "rawValue": 10}, "type": "Family", "date": "Fri, Oct 4 2024"}, {"negative": "The verbal FREE upgrade offered by agent Sybille, (due to a last-minute cancellation) was subsequently amended to a \"choice upgrade' at an extra cost of CHF 74.28/day (x12 days), i.e. CHF 891.36 more than agreed through you. (that's C$1,488.57, i.e. 367% more than the basic rental prepaid through rentalcars.com!!! (that excessive rental cost noted above is exclusive of the 8.10% VAT, and the \"Premium Location Fee\" of 20%, which was not noted on the rentalcars.com agreement.  - not holding it against you....but SixT certainly lives up to its worldwide reputation as untrust-worthy rental company.\nWhen they emailed me a request to rate their service, I told them loud and clear that unless they amend the final charge upon return of the vehicle, I'll see them in court.\nThe credit-card pre-authorization (Security Deposit) of CHF 1,463.56 was cancelled/withdrawn two days before end of rental, but to this day, I don't know what they debited to my credit-card, as there is still no Sixt debit showing on my Visa account.\nThat said, I had also purchased a CDW through rentalcoverage.com, the confirmation of which I showed to the SixT agent upon pickup (she did not take the details), but upon return of the vehicle they claimed that I damaged the rear-left wheel rim (5-10 cms down to primer); when I told the receiving agent that I a) have CDW coverage and b) had taken photos at time of pickup, which clearly shows the pre-existing damage, she noted it on the Return-Receipt, but I am now being hounded by the SixT-Damage dept. (As I'm still travelling, I have had no time to respond, and frankly see no reason why I should respond to that department.\nLast, but not least, Sixt's Diamond member should not be permitted to push through a line of 12 people waiting to be served, when there is no dedicated Diamond-Member counter.\nDecency toward the common-mortals is sorely lacking at Sixt!\nPS: I've rented cars through rentalcars.com previously and everything went without a hitch....s", "rating": "8.0", "positive": "Originally, I appreciated the offer of a FREE upgrade to a BMW x2, however that pleasure was short-lived (see 'what you didn't like').\nThis slightly larger vehicle was good to drive, but had useless gadgets which made driving in darkness outright dangerous. I did like the automatic transmission and the heads-up display, though. The fuel-mileage was great too.", "type": "Solo traveller", "date": "Fri, Sept 27 2024", "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "8", "rawValue": 8}, "epochDay": 19993}, {"epochDay": 19992, "localisedRating": {"displayValue": "5.4", "rawValue": 5.4}, "type": "Family", "date": "Thu, Sept 26 2024", "positive": "The SIXT rental desk is easily located and car condition is good", "rating": "5.4", "negative": "The SIXT representative keen to push me to upgrade my car (which required CHF 50 per day) and insurance.  After my rejection, I was  told to wait 30min as my booked needed more time to do cleaning.  I booked the car at 2pm; I finally got the car (same size/group; but not my ) "}, {"negative": "The gas tank was not completely full.  Not quite what I expected from Sixt.", "type": "Couple", "date": "Wed, Sept 25 2024", "epochDay": 19991, "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 8.3, "displayValue": "8.3"}, "rating": "8.3"}, {"date": "Wed, Sept 25 2024", "type": "Couple", "localisedRating": {"rawValue": 9.1, "displayValue": "9.1"}, "epochDay": 19991, "negative": "The cost of additional full protection of insurance is quite high", "rating": "9.1", "positive": "Sixt is my rental car choice "}], "title": "Customer reviews", "sort": {"ctaTitle": "Sort by", "options": {"default": "score.descending", "items": [{"label": "Highest scores", "id": "score.descending"}, {"id": "score.ascending", "label": "Lowest scores"}, {"label": "Newest first", "id": "date.descending"}, {"id": "date.ascending", "label": "Oldest first"}]}, "pageTitle": "Sort by"}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Details\n- **Make and Model**: Peugeot Rifter\n- **Car Class**: Compact\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Number of Seats**: 5\n- **Number of Doors**: 5\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n- **Suitcases**: \n  - Small: 0\n  - Big: 0\n\n### Pricing Information\n- **Drive Away Price**: $571.76 (approximate)\n- **Deposit**: $403.67 (CHF 350)\n- **Damage Excess**: $2,883.35 (CHF 2,500)\n- **Theft Excess**: $2,883.35 (CHF 2,500)\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name**: Sixt\n- **Location**: Zurich Airport, Parking 3, Zürich, Switzerland, 8060\n- **Rating**: \n  - **Overall**: 8.6 (Fabulous)\n  - **Breakdown**:\n    - Location: 9.1\n    - Efficiency: 8.5\n    - Drop-off Time: 9.4\n    - Cleanliness: 9.4\n    - Pick-up Time: 7.5\n    - Value for Money: 7.8\n    - Condition: 9.1\n\n### Customer Reviews\n1. **Rating**: 10/10\n   - **Type**: Family\n   - **Date**: October 4, 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"Mohammed the best guy...\"\n\n2. **Rating**: 8.0/10\n   - **Type**: Solo traveller\n   - **Date**: September 27, 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"Originally, I appreciated the offer of a FREE upgrade to a BMW x2...\"\n   - **Negative**: \"The verbal FREE upgrade offered by agent Sybille...\"\n\n3. **Rating**: 5.4/10\n   - **Type**: Family\n   - **Date**: September 26, 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"The SIXT rental desk is easily located and car condition is good\"\n   - **Negative**: \"The SIXT representative keen to push me to upgrade my car...\"\n\n4. **Rating**: 8.3/10\n   - **Type**: Couple\n   - **Date**: September 25, 2024\n   - **Negative**: \"The gas tank was not completely full.\"\n\n5. **Rating**: 9.1/10\n   - **Type**: Couple\n   - **Date**: September 25, 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"Sixt is my rental car choice\"\n   - **Negative**: \"The cost of additional full protection of insurance is quite high\"\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Pick-up Instructions**: Follow signs 'Mietwagen/Rental Car'. The Sixt desk is located in the rental car centre, parking garage 3 (P3), 1st level. The walk from the arrival hall to the car rental area takes approximately 15 minutes.\n\n### What's Included\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW).\n- Theft Cover.\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL).\n\nIf you need further assistance or wish to book the vehicle, please let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including vehicle details, supplier's ratings, and user comments."}, "correct": {"score": 1, "reason": "Most information is correct, but the response incorrectly states the number of small and big suitcases as 0, whereas the API response indicates 1 small and 1 big suitcase."}}}
