est first"}], "default": "score.descending"}, "ctaTitle": "Sort by"}}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the details for the car rental from **Goldcar** for your friends' trip from **Fiumicino Airport (Rome)** to **Milan Malpensa Airport**:\n\n### Vehicle Details\n- **Make & Model**: Smart Forfour\n- **Car Class**: Mini\n- **Transmission**: Manual\n- **Seats**: 4\n- **Doors**: 2/4\n- **Suitcases**: \n  - Small: 0\n  - Big: 0\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n- **Special Offer**: Price includes free rental of Snow Chains\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n- **Price**: $52.89 USD (base price) | Total drive-away price: $182.19 USD\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name**: Goldcar\n- **Pick-up Location**: In Terminal, Fiumicino Airport\n- **Pick-up Instructions**: \n  - From T1: Exit Arrivals, turn right and follow the 'Rent a Car' signs. At the information desk, take the lift on the right to floor 2 and follow the signs to Parking B.\n  - From T3: Exit Arrivals, turn left and take the lift near the 'Semplicemente Roma' café to floor 2. Then, follow the signs to parking B.\n\n### Supplier Ratings\n- **Overall Rating**: 7.5/10 (Good)\n- **Number of Reviews**: 8,388\n- **Breakdown**:\n  - **Value for Money**: 7.3\n  - **Helpfulness**: 7.4\n  - **Pick-up Speed**: 7.3\n  - **Drop-off Speed**: 8.7\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 7.3\n\n### Customer Reviews\n1. **Couple** (Rating: 7.1)\n   - **Date**: Mon, Oct 21 2024\n   - **Negative**: \"The car was old and felt as if it was under strain.\"\n\n2. **Solo Traveller** (Rating: 9.7)\n   - **Date**: Wed, Oct 16 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"Good car in good conditions.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"Each time I switched on the engine I had to disable all those stupid new 'security' features that create a lot of distractions for the driver.\"\n\n3. **Group** (Rating: 5.4)\n   - **Date**: Wed, Oct 16 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"The price.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"The car was broken into with ease. The car was dirty.\"\n\n4. **Group** (Rating: 7.7)\n   - **Date**: Wed, Oct 16 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"Quick pickup.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"The condition of the car. Lots of dents and scratches.\"\n\n5. **Couple** (Rating: 8.0)\n   - **Date**: Wed, Oct 16 2024\n   - **Positive**: \"Cheap.\"\n   - **Negative**: \"They push you to buy more insurance, saying you are not covered, although it looks like you do when you book it. I also had to add 70 euros for road recovery since they are not covering it.\"\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pick-up**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name.\n- **Security Deposit**: $1023.63 USD (refundable upon return).\n- **Damage Excess**: $1185.25 USD.\n\n### What's Included\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW).\n- Theft Cover.\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL).\n- Free rental of Snow Chains.\n\nIf your friends need any additional services like GPS, child seats, or an extra driver, they can be added at an extra cost. Would you like more details on any specific aspect?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
