ne Way Fee**: $172.40 (USD)\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name**: Goldcar\n- **Supplier Rating**: 7.3 out of 10 (Good)\n- **Number of Reviews**: 3,983\n\n### Ratings Breakdown\n1. **Overall Value for Money**: 6.5\n2. **Helpfulness**: 7.2\n3. **Pick-up Speed**: 7.1\n4. **Drop-off Speed**: 8.9\n5. **Car Cleanliness**: 8.0\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card Requirement**: The main driver must have a credit or debit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n- **Pick-up Location**: \n  - **Address**: Avenida de la Hispanidad, Madrid, Spain, 28042\n  - **Instructions**: \n    - T1: Go to the Arrivals level, between halls 1 and 2, opposite the car rental area.\n    - T4: Go to level -1 (car rental area).\n- **Drop-off Location**: \n  - **Address**: Aeropuerto de Barcelona-El Prat, T1 & T2, Barcelona, Spain, 08840\n\n### Included in Rental\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: $86.20 (max 3)\n2. **Baby Seat**: $103.44 (max 2)\n3. **Booster Seat**: $103.44 (max 2)\n4. **Child Seat**: $103.44 (max 2)\n5. **GPS**: $68.56 (max 1)\n\n### Notes\n- The drive-away price is approximate and may vary.\n- The supplier may require a credit card guarantee at pick-up.\n\nIf you need any further assistance, feel free to ask!"}], "message": [{"error_type": "value_error", "content": "Parameter search_key value is not correct in prediction."}], "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides detailed information about the vehicle and the supplier's ratings, but it does not include user comments."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
