 USD (covers theft-related incidents)\n\n### Supplier Information\n- **Supplier Name**: Alamo\n- **Supplier Rating**: 9.0/10 (Superb)\n- **Location Type**: Shuttle Bus\n- **Pick-Up Address**: 5 Lufthavnsboulevarden, Car Rental Centre, København, Denmark, 2770\n- **Drop-Off Address**: 24, Ny Lufthavnsvej, Aarhus, Denmark, 8560\n\n### Supplier Ratings Breakdown\n1. **Overall Value for Money**: 8.6/10\n2. **Helpfulness**: 9.3/10\n3. **Pick-Up Speed**: 8.1/10\n4. **Drop-Off Speed**: 9.7/10\n5. **Car Cleanliness**: 9.2/10\n\n### Customer Reviews\n1. **Rating**: 9.1/10  \n   **Review**: \"Super service. Very friendly staff.\"  \n   **Date**: October 16, 2024  \n   **Traveller Type**: Solo Traveller\n\n2. **Rating**: 8.0/10  \n   **Review**: \"Still waiting credit card deposit.\"  \n   **Date**: October 13, 2024  \n   **Traveller Type**: Solo Traveller\n\n3. **Rating**: 10/10  \n   **Review**: \"Everything went really smoothly at the desk, the car was new and in great shape, returning it was also very easy.\"  \n   **Date**: October 9, 2024  \n   **Traveller Type**: Group\n\n4. **Rating**: 5.4/10  \n   **Review**: \"I didn't get the car I ordered.\"  \n   **Date**: September 24, 2024  \n   **Traveller Type**: Couple\n\n5. **Rating**: 8.9/10  \n   **Review**: \"Lovely staff, who saw that my husband had mobility issues and ensured that he had a car that was easy for him to get in and out of.\"  \n   **Date**: September 20, 2024  \n   **Traveller Type**: Couple\n\n### Important Information\n- **Free Cancellation**: Up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n- **Payment**: A credit card in the main driver's name is required at pick-up.\n- **Extras Available**:\n  - Additional Driver: $57.76 USD\n  - Winter Tyres: $86.64 USD\n  - Baby Seat: $57.76 USD\n  - Booster Seat: $40.48 USD\n  - Child Seat: $57.76 USD\n\nIf you need more details or assistance with booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, 