01.38 USD (included in total price)\n- **Security Deposit:** $272.22 USD (payable at pick-up)\n- **Damage Excess:** $907.40 USD (maximum amount payable in case of damage)\n- **Theft Excess:** $907.40 USD (maximum amount payable in case of theft)\n\n### What's Included\n- Free cancellation\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n- Winterisation fee\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pick-up:** The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n\n### Customer Reviews\nHere are some recent customer reviews for Alamo:\n1. **Rating:** 9.7/10  \n   - **Date:** October 18, 2024  \n   - **Feedback:** \"Everything was great, thanks!\"  \n   - **Type:** Solo traveller\n\n2. **Rating:** 10/10  \n   - **Date:** October 17, 2024  \n   - **Feedback:** \"Very friendly and detailed explanation of the rental.\"  \n   - **Type:** Couple\n\n3. **Rating:** 9.1/10  \n   - **Date:** October 15, 2024  \n   - **Feedback:** \"Good communication.\"  \n   - **Type:** Solo traveller\n\n4. **Rating:** 10/10  \n   - **Date:** October 13, 2024  \n   - **Feedback:** \"Everything was beautiful and the car was wonderful.\"  \n   - **Type:** Family\n\n5. **Rating:** 6.3/10  \n   - **Date:** September 19, 2024  \n   - **Feedback:** \"Staff was good, but the condition of the car was not satisfactory.\"  \n   - **Type:** Couple\n\n### Supplier Ratings Breakdown\n- **Overall Value for Money:** 8.8/10\n- **Helpfulness:** 9.3/10\n- **Pick-up Speed:** 7.9/10\n- **Drop-off Speed:** 9.5/10\n- **Car Cleanliness:** 9.2/10\n\nIf your friends have any further questions or need assistance with bookings, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
