lier (Autonom)\nHere is the detailed information for the vehicle from **Autonom**, which has the highest rating:\n\n#### Vehicle Information\n- **Make and Model**: Renault Clio\n- **Car Class**: Economy\n- **Transmission**: Manual\n- **Number of Seats**: 5\n- **Number of Doors**: 4\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n- **Mileage**: 1500 kilometers per rental\n- **Suitcases**: \n  - Small: 1\n  - Big: 1\n\n#### Pricing Information\n- **Drive Away Price**: $141.25 USD (approx.)\n- **Base Price**: $66.01 USD\n- **Deposit**: $66.01 USD\n- **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n\n#### Fees\n- **One Way Fee**: $75.24 USD\n- **Damage Excess**: $1182.39 USD\n- **Deposit**: $1182.39 USD\n- **Fuel Policy**: $32.25 USD\n- **Mileage Fee**: $0.27 USD per kilometer (after 1500 km)\n- **Theft Excess**: $1182.39 USD\n\n#### Pick-up and Drop-off Locations\n- **Pick-up**: \n  - **Location**: Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport\n  - **Address**: 2220, Vecsés, Vigyázó Ferenc utca 4, Budapest, Hungary, 2220\n  - **Type**: Shuttle Bus\n\n- **Drop-off**: \n  - **Location**: Debrecen International Airport\n  - **Address**: 0493/64, Mikepercsi ut, Debrecen, Hungary, 4030\n  - **Type**: In Terminal\n\n#### Extras Available\n- **Additional Driver**: $16.12 USD\n- **Snow Chains**: $32.22 USD\n- **Child Seat**: $32.22 USD\n- **GPS**: $45.12 USD\n\n#### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pick-up**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name.\n- **Full Protection Insurance**: Included for peace of mind.\n\n### Summary\nThe highest-rated supplier, **Autonom**, offers a **Renault Clio** with excellent reviews and comprehensive features. If you have any further questions or need assistance with the booking, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is a