: 8.1 out of 10 (Very Good)\n- **Number of Reviews**: 168\n- **Breakdown of Ratings**:\n  - **Overall Value for Money**: 7.5\n  - **Helpfulness**: 8.1\n  - **Pick-up Speed**: 7.1\n  - **Drop-off Speed**: 9.7\n  - **Car Cleanliness**: 8.1\n\n#### Vehicle Details\n- **Make and Model**: GMC Terrain\n- **Car Class**: Standard\n- **Specifications**:\n  - **Transmission**: Automatic\n  - **Seats**: 5\n  - **Doors**: 4\n  - **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n  - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n  - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n  - **Suitcase Capacity**: \n    - Small: 1\n    - Big: 2\n- **Price Information**:\n  - **Base Price**: $487.59 USD\n  - **Drive Away Price**: $583.42 USD (includes taxes and fees)\n  - **Deposit**: $684.96 USD\n- **Pick-up Location**:\n  - **Name**: Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport\n  - **Address**: 3200, East Airfield Drive, Dallas, TX, USA, 75261\n  - **Type**: Car Rental Centre\n- **Drop-off Location**:\n  - **Name**: Dallas Love Field Airport\n  - **Address**: 7212, Cedar Springs Road, Dallas, TX, USA, 75235\n  - **Type**: In Terminal\n- **Important Information**:\n  - **Payment**: The main driver must have a credit card in their own name when picking up the car.\n  - **Cancellation**: Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up.\n\n#### Extras Available\n1. **Additional Driver**: $54 USD\n2. **Baby Seat**: $55.96 USD\n3. **Booster Seat**: $55.96 USD\n4. **Child Seat**: $55.96 USD\n\n#### What's Included\n- Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up\n- Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n- Theft Cover\n- Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Summary\nThe **Hertz** supplier offers a **GMC Terrain** at **Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport** with a high rating of **8.1**. The vehicle provides unlimited mileage, automatic transmission, and accommodates up to 5 passengers. The total drive-away price is **$583.42 USD** for the rental period."}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "t