portant information", "items": [{"text": "<b>Payment card at pick-up:</b> Credit or debit card<br/>The main driver <b>must</b> have a credit or debit card in their own name when picking the car up.", "icon": "CREDIT_CARD"}]}, "packages": [{"id": "RC_FULL_PROTECTION", "content": {"included": "Full Protection included", "title": "Add insurance...", "subtitle": "for peace of mind", "description": "You could lose your whole deposit if the car is damaged or stolen, but as long as you have Full Protection, Booking.com will refund you!", "cta": {"attach": "Read more", "remove": "Remove Full Protection"}, "price": {"priceAnnotation": {"text": "Free cancellation"}, "displayPrice": "US$116.38", "label": "Total protection price"}}}], "depots": {"dropoff": {"location_id": "4673073", "name": "Perth Airport", "longitude": "115.973554", "country_code": "AU", "location_type": "IN_TERMINAL", "iataCode": "PER", "latitude": "-31.941529", "id": "4673073", "address": "Sugarbird Lady Road, Perth, Australia, WA 6105"}, "pickup": {"longitude": "153.109388", "name": "Brisbane Airport", "location_id": "4672993", "location_type": "IN_TERMINAL", "country_code": "AU", "city": "Brisbane", "latitude": "-27.403928", "iataCode": "BNE", "country": "Australia", "id": "4672993", "address": "Airport Drive, Brisbane, Australia, QLD 4008"}}, "meta": {"response_code": 200}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "### Vehicle Supplier Ratings\n\n1. **Hertz**\n   - **Overall Rating**: 8.9 (Fabulous)\n   - **Value for Money**: 8.2\n   - **Helpfulness**: 8.8\n   - **Pick-up Speed**: 8.3\n   - **Drop-off Speed**: 9.6\n   - **Car Cleanliness**: 9.3\n   - **Number of Reviews**: 2,038\n\n2. **Ace Rental Cars**\n   - **Overall Rating**: 8.3 (Very Good)\n   - **Value for Money**: 8.2\n   - **Helpfulness**: 8.6\n   - **Pick-up Speed**: 6.8\n   - **Drop-off Speed**: 8.4\n   - **Car Cleanliness**: 8.9\n   - **Number of Reviews**: 1,849\n\n### Vehicle Details from the Highest-Rated Supplier (Hertz)\n\n#### Vehicle Information\n- **Make and Model**: Mitsubishi ASX\n- **Car Class**: Compact\n- **Transmission**: Automatic\n- **Number of Doors**: 4\n- **Number of Seats**: 5\n- **Air Conditioning**: Yes\n- **Mileage**: Unlimited\n- **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n- **Suitcases**: \n  - Big Suitcases: 1\n  - Small Suitcases: 1\n\n#### Pricing Information\n- **Total Price**: $841.86 USD (Pay Now)\n- **Drive Away Price**: Approximately $2,057.34 USD\n- **Base Deposit**: $132.81 USD (Payable at pick-up)\n\n#### Included Features\n- **Free Cancellation**: Up to 48 hours before pick-up\n- **Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)**\n- **Theft Cover**\n- **Third-Party Liability (TPL)**\n\n#### Fees\n- **One Way Fee**: $1,215.48 USD (included in the price)\n- **Damage Excess**: $3,917.90 USD (if applicable)\n- **Deposit**: $132.81 USD (refundable)\n\n#### Pick-up and Drop-off Locations\n- **Pick-up**: Brisbane Airport (Airport Drive, Brisbane, QLD 4008)\n- **Drop-off**: Perth Airport (Sugarbird Lady Road, Perth, WA 6105)\n\n#### Important Information\n- **Payment Card at Pick-up**: The main driver must have a credit or debit card in their own name.\n- **Additional Driver**: Available for $14.60 USD per rental.\n- **Child Seats**: \n  - Baby Seat: $58.44 USD\n  - Booster Seat: $58.44 USD\n  - Child Seat: $58.44 USD\n\n#### Supplier Rating at Location\n- Customers have rated Hertz as **8.9 out of 10** (Fabulous) at this location.\n\n### Summary\nYou can rent a **Mitsubishi ASX** from **Hertz** at Brisbane Airport on **November 1, 2024, at 3:00 PM** and return it at Perth Airport on **November 5, 2024, at 1:00 PM**. The total cost is **$841.86 USD**, with free cancellation up to 48 hours before pick-up. Hertz has the highest rating among the available suppliers."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including the rating information of vehicle suppliers and detailed information on the vehicle from the highest-rated supplier."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
