re pick-up\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n#### Important Information\n- **Payment at Pick-up:** Credit or debit card in the main driver's name is required.\n- **Additional Fees:**\n  - **Damage Excess:** $3,611.94 USD\n  - **Theft Excess:** $3,611.94 USD\n\n#### Extras (Optional)\n- **Additional Driver:** $30.12 USD\n- **Baby Seat:** $65.80 USD\n- **Booster Seat:** $120.54 USD\n\n### Summary\nThe **Kia Rio** from **Avis** is available for rent at Adelaide Airport on December 1, 2024, at 15:00, and can be returned at Canberra Airport on December 7, 2024, at 13:00. The total cost is **$762.94 USD**, including unlimited mileage and essential insurance coverages. Avis has the highest rating among the suppliers, with an overall score of **9.3** based on **1,001 reviews**.\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking or need any further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
