 on 586 reviews)\n- **Important Info:** Credit card required at pick-up.\n\n### 2. **Citroen C4**\n- **Supplier:** Sixt\n- **Pick-up Location:** Paris - Gambetta (Downtown)\n- **Drop-off Location:** Geneva Airport - French Sector\n- **Pick-up Time:** November 25, 2024, at 13:00\n- **Drop-off Time:** November 27, 2024, at 13:00\n- **Price:** $352.26 (approx.)\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Baby Seat Available:** Yes (extra cost: $31.96 per rental)\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n- **Rating:** 8.9/10 (Fabulous, based on 50 reviews)\n- **Important Info:** Credit or debit card required at pick-up.\n\n### 3. **Fiat 500X**\n- **Supplier:** Sixt\n- **Pick-up Location:** Paris - Gambetta (Downtown)\n- **Drop-off Location:** Geneva Airport - French Sector\n- **Pick-up Time:** November 25, 2024, at 13:00\n- **Drop-off Time:** November 27, 2024, at 13:00\n- **Price:** $358.98 (approx.)\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Seats:** 5\n- **Air Conditioning:** Yes\n- **Baby Seat Available:** Yes (extra cost: $31.96 per rental)\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes (up to 48 hours before pick-up)\n- **Rating:** 8.9/10 (Fabulous, based on 50 reviews)\n- **Important Info:** Credit or debit card required at pick-up.\n\n### Summary\n- **Baby Seat Availability:** All vehicles offer baby seats as an optional extra for $31.96 per rental.\n- **Total Price:** Prices range from $335.82 to $358.98 for the rental period.\n- **Pick-up/Drop-off:** Flexible locations in Paris and Geneva.\n\nWould you like to proceed with a booking for any of these vehicles, or do you need further details?"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 7, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "co