 the same fuel level)\n- **Price:**\n  - **Total:** $291.91 USD\n  - **Deposit:** $222.49 USD (refundable)\n  - **Insurance:** Full Protection available for $104.04 USD (optional)\n\n### Important Information\n- **Payment at Pick-up:** A credit or debit card in the main driver's name is required.\n- **Security Deposit:** $2558.64 USD (refundable after return).\n- **Included:**\n  - Free cancellation\n  - Collision Damage Waiver (CDW)\n  - Theft Cover\n  - Third-Party Liability (TPL)\n\n### Rental Terms\n- **Pick-up Time:** October 1, 2024, at 3:00 PM\n- **Drop-off Time:** October 5, 2024, at 1:00 PM\n\n### Additional Fees\n- **Administration Fee:** $72.31 USD\n- **Damage Excess:** $2558.64 USD\n- **Valet Fee:** $14.46 USD\n\nIf you need further assistance or wish to proceed with the booking, please let me know!"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 4, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides detailed information on the vehicle from a supplier but does not provide the rating information of all vehicle suppliers that meet the conditions."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
