ood, 2323 reviews)\n   - **Distance**: 550 m from the city center\n   - **Price**: $1519 USD (originally $1788 USD)\n   - **Check-in**: From 15:00\n   - **Check-out**: Until 12:00\n   - **Rooms**: 2 hotel rooms with 2 beds\n\n2. **Homewood Suites By Hilton Ottawa Downtown**\n   - **Rating**: 3 stars (8.5/10 Very Good, 1792 reviews)\n   - **Distance**: 450 m from the city center\n   - **Price**: $1087 USD\n   - **Check-in**: From 16:00\n   - **Check-out**: Until 12:00\n   - **Rooms**: 2 private suites with 2 beds\n\n3. **Arc The Hotel**\n   - **Rating**: 4 stars (7.7/10 Good, 1350 reviews)\n   - **Distance**: 300 m from the city center\n   - **Price**: $948 USD\n   - **Check-in**: From 15:00\n   - **Check-out**: Until 11:00\n   - **Rooms**: 2 hotel rooms with 2 beds\n\nThese options provide a great mix of activities and accommodations for your trip! Let me know if you need further assistance."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 4, "total_call_num": 4, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
