 **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation available.\n\n3. **Royal Ontario Museum Admission**\n   - **Description:** A ticket to visit one of Toronto's most famous art and natural history museums.\n   - **Price:** $18.79 USD\n   - **Rating:** 4.7 (27 reviews)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** No free cancellation.\n\n### Highly-Reviewed Hotels in Toronto:\n1. **One King West Hotel and Residence**\n   - **Rating:** 8.5 (Very Good, 11,724 reviews)\n   - **Location:** Financial District, 450 m from the centre\n   - **Price:** $2,513 USD for 3 studios (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation, no prepayment needed.\n\n2. **Holiday Inn Toronto Downtown Centre, an IHG Hotel**\n   - **Rating:** 7.7 (Good, 11,608 reviews)\n   - **Location:** The Village, 1.1 km from the centre\n   - **Price:** $1,105 USD for 3 hotel rooms (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation, no prepayment needed.\n\n3. **Chelsea Hotel Toronto**\n   - **Rating:** 7.3 (Good, 8,078 reviews)\n   - **Location:** In city centre\n   - **Price:** $1,467 USD for 3 hotel rooms (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation available.\n\n### Summary:\n- **Activities:** Cruise, Niagara Falls trip, Museum visit.\n- **Hotels:** One King West, Holiday Inn, Chelsea Hotel.\n\nFeel free to ask if you need more details or assistance with bookings!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 4, "total_call_num": 4, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including three top-rated activities and three highly-reviewed hotels with details about room availability."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
