ruby-lissi-vienna.html)**\n\n3. **DORMERO HoHo Wien**\n   - **Rating:** 8.6 (Fabulous) - 5442 reviews\n   - **Location:** 22. Donaustadt, 10 km from the city center\n   - **Accommodation:** 2 hotel rooms with 4 beds\n   - **Price:**\n     - Original: $303 USD\n     - Current: $258 USD (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **[View Details](https://www.booking.com/hotel/at/dormero-hoho-wien.html)**\n\n### Car Rental Services for Your Tour\n\nHere are some car rental options available in Vienna for your tour:\n\n1. **Dryyve - Vienna International Airport**\n   - **Vehicle:** Opel Corsa (Economy)\n   - **Transmission:** Manual\n   - **Price:** $34.40 USD\n   - **Drive Away Price:** $45.11 USD (approx.)\n   - **Mileage:** 200 kilometers per rental\n   - **Pick-up Location:** In Terminal, Vienna Airport\n   - **Rating:** 7.6 (Good) - 1653 reviews\n   - **[Book Now](https://www.rentalcars.com/car-rental/dryyve-vienna-international-airport/)**\n\n2. **Dryyve - Vienna International Airport**\n   - **Vehicle:** Fiat Panda (Mini)\n   - **Transmission:** Manual\n   - **Price:** $33.98 USD\n   - **Drive Away Price:** $44.69 USD (approx.)\n   - **Mileage:** 200 kilometers per rental\n   - **Pick-up Location:** In Terminal, Vienna Airport\n   - **Rating:** 7.6 (Good) - 1653 reviews\n   - **[Book Now](https://www.rentalcars.com/car-rental/dryyve-vienna-international-airport/)**\n\n3. **Fox Autorent - Vienna Downtown**\n   - **Vehicle:** Suzuki S-Cross 4x4 (Intermediate)\n   - **Transmission:** Manual\n   - **Price:** $92.74 USD\n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited kilometers\n   - **Pick-up Location:** Downtown, 4 Fred-Zinnemann-Platz\n   - **Rating:** 8.5 (Very Good) - 600 reviews\n   - **[Book Now](https://www.rentalcars.com/car-rental/fox-autorent-vienna-downtown/)**\n\n### Summary\n- **Hotels:** Choose from popular options like URBAN ISLAND I Riverside Apartments or Ruby Lissi Hotel Vienna for a comfortable stay.\n- **Car Rentals:** Options are available at Vienna International Airport and downtown locations for your convenience.\n\nLet me know if you need further assistance or bookings!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
{"id": "Cross-21", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "My family and I are planning to go to Rome, Italy, from November 5th to 10th, 2024, and visit the world-famous Colosseum. To make our journey more comfortable and convenient, we hope to find a hotel that's nearest to the Colosseum. Besides that, arrange a taxi for us at 2 p.m. on the 5th to take us from Roma Termini to the Colosseum."}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Hotel_Destination", "arguments": {"query": "Colosseum, Rome, Italy"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": [{"dest_id": "1506", "search_type": "landmark", "label": "The Colosseum, Rome, Lazio, Italy", "name": "The Colosseum", "latitude": 41.89022, "lc": "xu", "region": "Lazio", "country": "Italy", "dest_type": "landmark", "roundtrip": "GgEwIAAoATICeHU6CUNvbG9zc2V1bUAASgBQAA==", "longitude": 12.492268, "city_name": "Rome", "type": "la", "nr_hotels": 310, "cc1": "it", "hotels": 310, "city_ufi": -126693, "landmark_type": 4}]}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Hotels", "arguments": {"dest_id": 1506, "search_type": "landmark", "arrival_date": "2024-11-05", "departure_date": "2024-11-10", "sort_by": "distance"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"hotels": [{"hotel_id": 12368795, "accessibilityLabel": "Luxurylifestyle.\n4 out of 5 for property rating.\n10 Exceptional 1 review.\n‎Rione Monti, Rome‬ • ‎150 m from Coliseum‬.\n Entire holiday home – 105 m² : 3 beds • 3 bedrooms • 3 bathrooms.\nOriginal price 4907 USD. Current price 4419 USD..\nIncludes taxes and charges.", "property": {"ufi": -126693, "reviewScoreWord": "Exceptional", "latitude": 41.8914634, "mainPhotoId": 575313484, "id": 12368795, "checkout": {"fromTime": "09:00", "untilTime": "11:00"}, "checkoutDate": "2024-11-10", "checkinDate": "2024-11-05", "propertyClass": 0, "qualityClass": 4, "reviewCount": 1, "wishlistName": "Rome", "position