throoms.\n   - **Check-in:** From 14:00 to 18:00\n   - **Check-out:** From 08:00 to 11:00\n\n---\n\n### Taxi Arrangement from Roma Termini to Colosseum\nI have arranged a taxi for you on **November 5th at 2:00 PM**. Here are the available options:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Your Personal Driver - Decus\n   - **Price:** $58.55 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 12 minutes\n   - **Description:** Perfect for solo travelers, couples, and small families.\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Your Personal Driver - Decus\n   - **Price:** $70.85 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 2 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 12 minutes\n   - **Description:** Plenty of space to travel in comfort.\n\n3. **People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** Your Personal Driver - Decus\n   - **Price:** $77.29 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 6 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 12 minutes\n   - **Description:** Great choice for families.\n\n4. **Large People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** GEA TRASPORTI SRL\n   - **Price:** $78.88 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 7 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 12 minutes\n   - **Description:** Ideal for small groups.\n\n5. **Executive People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** GEA TRASPORTI SRL\n   - **Price:** $78.88 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 7 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 12 minutes\n   - **Description:** Perfect for groups that want a touch of luxury.\n\n### Next Steps\nPlease let me know which hotel you would like to book and which taxi option suits your family best!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
