- **Price:** $12,228 (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Room Type:** 155 m²: 3 beds • 3 bedrooms • 3 bathrooms\n   - **Check-in:** January 20, 2025 (from 15:00)\n   - **Check-out:** January 25, 2025 (until 11:00)\n\n---\n\n### Taxi Options from Gare de Lyon to Eiffel Tower\nHere are taxi options for your journey on January 20th, 2025, at 3:00 PM:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Allocab\n   - **Duration:** 33 minutes\n   - **Distance:** 17.15 km\n   - **Price:** $47.92 (USD)\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Baggage Capacity:** 3 bags\n\n2. **Electric Luxury Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Transferz\n   - **Duration:** 33 minutes\n   - **Distance:** 17.15 km\n   - **Price:** $74.49 (USD)\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 3\n   - **Baggage Capacity:** 3 bags\n\n3. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Transferz\n   - **Duration:** 33 minutes\n   - **Distance:** 17.15 km\n   - **Price:** $76.94 (USD)\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 3\n   - **Baggage Capacity:** 3 bags\n\n4. **Electric Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Transferz\n   - **Duration:** 33 minutes\n   - **Distance:** 17.15 km\n   - **Price:** $76.94 (USD)\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 3\n   - **Baggage Capacity:** 3 bags\n\n5. **People Carrier Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Transferz\n   - **Duration:** 33 minutes\n   - **Distance:** 17.15 km\n   - **Price:** $106.83 (USD)\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 7\n   - **Baggage Capacity:** 7 bags\n\n---\n\n### Next Steps\nPlease let me know which hotel and taxi option you would like to book, or if you need more details!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
