r 15th to 20th, 2024:\n\n1. **Hidden Gem-1Bedroom with Plenty Free Street Parking**\n   - **Location:** Communipaw (2.9 km from Statue of Liberty)\n   - **Price:** $738 (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Rating:** 3 out of 5\n   - **Description:** Entire apartment – 49 m²: 1 bed • 1 bedroom • 1 bathroom.\n   - **Check-in:** November 15, 2024 | **Check-out:** November 20, 2024\n\n2. **Cozy Sanctuary**\n   - **Location:** Jersey City (2.9 km from Statue of Liberty)\n   - **Price:** $619 (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Rating:** 3 out of 5\n   - **Description:** Entire apartment – 44 m²: 1 bed • 1 bedroom • 1 bathroom.\n   - **Check-in:** November 15, 2024 | **Check-out:** November 20, 2024\n\n3. **Sweet Home - 20 minutes to NYC**\n   - **Location:** Jersey City (3 km from Statue of Liberty)\n   - **Price:** $1,372 (originally $1,503, includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Rating:** 7.2 (Good, 12 reviews)\n   - **Description:** Entire apartment – 111 m²: 4 beds • 2 bedrooms • 1 living room • 2 bathrooms.\n   - **Check-in:** November 15, 2024 | **Check-out:** November 20, 2024\n\n4. **Casa Cipriani New York**\n   - **Location:** Manhattan, New York (3 km from Statue of Liberty)\n   - **Price:** $9,198 (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Rating:** 9.3 (Superb, 73 reviews)\n   - **Description:** Hotel room: 1 bed.\n   - **Check-in:** November 15, 2024 | **Check-out:** November 20, 2024\n\n5. **Sonder Battery Park**\n   - **Location:** Manhattan, New York (3.1 km from Statue of Liberty)\n   - **Price:** $1,656 (originally $1,838, includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Rating:** 8.6 (Fabulous, 2314 reviews)\n   - **Description:** Entire studio – 43 m²: 1 bed • 1 bedroom • 1 bathroom.\n   - **Check-in:** November 15, 2024 | **Check-out:** November 20, 2024\n\n---\n\n### Taxi Arrangement\nYour taxi from **Grand Central Terminal** to **Statue of Liberty** on **November 15th at 4:00 PM** has been arranged. Here are the options:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Sixt Ride\n   - **Price:** $89.42\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 31 minutes\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Sixt Ride\n   - **Price:** $102.94\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 31 minutes\n\n3. **People Carrier Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Talixo\n   - **Price:** $106.30\n   - **Capacity:** 4 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 31 minutes\n\n4. **Large People Carrier Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Talixo\n   - **Price:** $114.70\n   - **Capacity:** 5 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 31 minutes\n\n5. **Luxury Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** American Luxury Service New York\n   - **Price:** $140.22\n   - **Capacity:** 4 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 31 minutes\n\n### Next Steps\nPlease let me know which hotel and taxi option you would like to book, and I can assist further!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
