0\n   - **Check-out:** From 00:00 until 11:00\n\n5. **Chic 1-BR Condo; Parking included; Downtown Core**\n   - **Rating:** 8.6 (Fabulous) | 7 reviews\n   - **Distance:** 250 m from CN Tower\n   - **Price:** Original $1676 USD, **Current $1433 USD** (includes taxes and charges)\n   - **Room Type:** Entire apartment – 58 m² (2 beds, 1 bedroom, 1 living room, 1 bathroom)\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00 until 00:00\n   - **Check-out:** From 00:00 until 11:00\n\n### Taxi Arrangement\nYour taxi from **Union Station** to **CN Tower** on **December 5th at 11:00 AM** has been arranged. Here are the options:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Toronto Pearson Airport Taxi\n   - **Price:** $57.50 USD\n   - **Duration:** 6 minutes\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 3\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 120 minutes before pickup\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** GTA Elite Limos Toronto\n   - **Price:** $61.93 USD\n   - **Duration:** 6 minutes\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 3\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 1440 minutes before pickup\n\n3. **Electric Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Toronto Pearson Airport Taxi\n   - **Price:** $70.77 USD\n   - **Duration:** 6 minutes\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 120 minutes before pickup\n\n4. **People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** GTA Airport Taxi\n   - **Price:** $75.20 USD\n   - **Duration:** 6 minutes\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 1440 minutes before pickup\n\n### Next Steps\nPlease let me know which hotel you'd like to book or if you prefer a specific taxi option!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correc