ay\n   - **Check-in:** From 14:00 | **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Description:** Entire apartment – 75 m² with 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom.\n\n2. **Park Hyatt Sydney**\n   - **Rating:** 8.9 Fabulous (405 reviews)\n   - **Distance:** 550 m from Sydney Opera House\n   - **Price:** Approximately $4393 USD for the stay\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00 | **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Description:** Hotel room with 1 bed.\n\n3. **Sydney Harbour Hotel**\n   - **Rating:** 7.8 Good (4910 reviews)\n   - **Distance:** 600 m from Sydney Opera House\n   - **Price:** Approximately $1216 USD for the stay\n   - **Check-in:** From 14:00 | **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Description:** Hotel room with 2 beds.\n\n4. **Sir Stamford Circular Quay**\n   - **Rating:** 8.3 Very Good (5474 reviews)\n   - **Distance:** 600 m from Sydney Opera House\n   - **Price:** Approximately $1690 USD for the stay\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00 | **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Description:** Hotel room with 2 beds.\n\n5. **Pier One Sydney Harbour, Autograph Collection**\n   - **Rating:** 8.9 Fabulous (1516 reviews)\n   - **Distance:** 700 m from Sydney Opera House\n   - **Price:** Approximately $2088 USD for the stay\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00 | **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Description:** Hotel room with 1 bed.\n\n### Taxi Arrangement\nYour taxi from **Sydney Central Station** to **Sydney Opera House** on **November 10th at 3:00 PM** has been arranged. Here are the options:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $52.63 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 4 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 13 minutes\n   - **Description:** Perfect for solo travelers, couples, and small families.\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $53.19 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 4 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 13 minutes\n   - **Description:** Plenty of space to travel in comfort.\n\n3. **People Carrier**\n   - **Price:** $61.29 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 6 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 13 minutes\n   - **Description:** Great choice for families.\n\n4. **Luxury Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $63.12 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 13 minutes\n   - **Description:** Offers more room to arrive in style.\n\n5. **Executive People Carrier**\n   - **Price:** $78.41 USD\n   - **Capacity:** 6 passengers\n   - **Duration:** 13 minutes\n   - **Description:** Perfect for groups that want a touch of luxury.\n\n### Next Steps\nPlease let me know which hotel and taxi option you would like to book, or if you need any further assistance!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
