   - **Supplier:** Welcome PickUps\n   - **Duration:** 15 minutes\n   - **Price:** $41.54 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Bags Capacity:** 3\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 24 hours before pickup\n\n2. **Large People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** Janerica Ltd\n   - **Duration:** 15 minutes\n   - **Price:** $56.98 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 7\n   - **Bags Capacity:** 7\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 24 hours before pickup\n\n3. **People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** Janerica Ltd\n   - **Duration:** 15 minutes\n   - **Price:** $57.58 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Bags Capacity:** 4\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 24 hours before pickup\n\n### Next Steps\n- **Hotel Booking:** You can proceed with your preferred hotel by clicking the provided links.\n- **Taxi Booking:** Please confirm which taxi option suits your family size and luggage requirements.\n\nIf you need any further assistance or modifications, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
