as been arranged. Here are your options:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Welcome PickUps\n   - **Price:** $45.82\n   - **Duration:** 23 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 4 passengers, 3 bags\n   - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation up to 24 hours before\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Golden Wheels\n   - **Price:** $52.06\n   - **Duration:** 23 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers, 3 bags\n   - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation up to 24 hours before\n\n3. **People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** ElTaxi033 Barcelona\n   - **Price:** $62.21\n   - **Duration:** 23 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 5 passengers, 6 bags\n   - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation up to 24 hours before\n\n### Next Steps\nPlease let me know which hotel and taxi option you prefer, and I can proceed with the bookings!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 2, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
