 at LAX\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Downtown Los Angeles - West 8th Street\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n### Available Hotel Rooms (December 7 - December 8)\nHere are some available hotel rooms within 50 kilometers of Downtown Los Angeles:\n\n#### 1. Laguna Hills Lodge-Irvine Spectrum\n   - **Location:** Laguna Hills, CA\n   - **Rating:** 8.4 (Very Good)\n   - **Available Rooms:**\n     - **Standard Single Room, 2 Queen Beds, Non-Smoking**\n       - **Price:** $127.58\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 5\n     - **Standard Single Room, 1 King Bed, Non-smoking**\n       - **Price:** $127.58\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 5\n     - **Deluxe Single Room, 2 Queen Beds, Non-smoking Garden View**\n       - **Price:** $134.33\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 5\n     - **Deluxe Single Room, 1 King Bed, Non-smoking Garden View**\n       - **Price:** $134.33\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 5\n\n#### 2. Crowne Plaza Hotel Los Angeles Harbor, an IHG Hotel\n   - **Location:** San Pedro, CA\n   - **Rating:** 7.7 (Good)\n   - **Available Rooms:**\n     - **Standard King Room with Accessible Tub - Mobility Access**\n       - **Price:** $176.10\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 3\n     - **Standard King Room with Accessible Tub - Mobility Access**\n       - **Price:** $179.00\n       - **Breakfast Included:** No (Breakfast available for $21)\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 6\n     - **Standard King Room with Harbour View**\n       - **Price:** $176.10\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 3\n     - **King Room - Hearing Accessible/Non-Smoking**\n       - **Price:** $176.10\n       - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n       - **Cancellation:** Free cancellation until December 3\n\n### Next Steps\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options, or do you need more information?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 7, "total_call_num": 7, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
