 **Price**: Approximately $658.94 USD (including taxes and fees)\n   - **Rating**: 8.1 (Very Good, based on 2,308 reviews)\n   - **Features**: Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation\n   - **Pick-up Location**: Melbourne Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Drop-off Location**: Sydney Downtown\n   - [View Details](https://www.booking.com/cars)\n\n2. **Suzuki Swift**\n   - **Supplier**: Europcar\n   - **Price**: Approximately $639.41 USD (including taxes and fees)\n   - **Rating**: 8.1 (Very Good)\n   - **Features**: Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation\n   - **Pick-up Location**: Melbourne Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Drop-off Location**: Sydney Downtown\n   - [View Details](https://www.booking.com/cars)\n\n3. **Kia Stonic**\n   - **Supplier**: Europcar\n   - **Price**: Approximately $643.27 USD (including taxes and fees)\n   - **Rating**: 8.1 (Very Good)\n   - **Features**: Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, free cancellation\n   - **Pick-up Location**: Melbourne Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Drop-off Location**: Sydney Downtown\n   - [View Details](https://www.booking.com/cars)\n\n---\n\n### Hotel Options in Sydney City Centre (within 50 km)\nHere are the available hotels for the night of **November 12, 2024**:\n\n#### 1. **Atura Blacktown**\n   - **Location**: Blacktown, Sydney\n   - **Rating**: 8.2 (Very Good)\n   - **Available Rooms**:\n     - **Atura King Room**\n       - **Price**: $198.90 AUD (approx. $131 USD)\n       - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation until November 11, 2024\n       - **Breakfast**: Not included (additional cost: $20 AUD)\n     - **Atura King Room (Single Occupancy)**\n       - **Price**: $252 AUD (approx. $167 USD)\n       - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation until November 11, 2024\n       - **Breakfast**: Included\n   - [Book Now](https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/atura-blacktown.html)\n\n#### 2. **Maclin Lodge Motel**\n   - **Location**: Campbelltown, Sydney\n   - **Rating**: 8.2 (Very Good)\n   - **Available Rooms**:\n     - **Standard Family Room**\n       - **Price**: $175 AUD (approx. $116 USD)\n       - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation until November 11, 2024\n     - **Executive Triple Room with Balcony**\n       - **Price**: $180 AUD (approx. $120 USD)\n       - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation until November 11, 2024\n   - [Book Now](https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/maclin-lodge-motel.html)\n\n#### 3. **Rydges World Square**\n   - **Location**: Sydney\n   - **Rating**: 8.1 (Very Good)\n   - **Available Rooms**:\n     - **Executive Queen Room**\n       - **Price**: $170 AUD (approx. $113 USD)\n       - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation until November 11, 2024\n     - **Deluxe Double or Twin Room**\n       - **Price**: $150 AUD (approx. $100 USD)\n       - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation until November 11, 2024\n   - [Book Now](https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/rydges-world-square.html)\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Car Rental**: Options from Europcar at Melbourne Airport starting from $639.41 USD.\n- **Hotels**: Three great options in Sydney with free cancellation until November 11, 2024.\n\nWould you like to proceed with any bookings or need further assistance?"}], "message": [{"error_type": "func_error", "content": "Do not call the correct function."}], "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 0, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 7, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
