ria - Gardeners Road\n   - **Drop-off Location**: Sydney - Pyrmont\n   - **Rating**: 9.0 (Superb) based on 139 reviews\n   - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n   - **Transmission**: Automatic\n   - **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n   - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n\n2. **Budget**\n   - **Vehicle Type**: Kia Cerato (Intermediate)\n   - **Price**: $299.91 USD\n   - **Pickup Location**: Alexandria - Gardeners Road\n   - **Drop-off Location**: Sydney - Pyrmont\n   - **Rating**: 9.0 (Superb) based on 139 reviews\n   - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n   - **Transmission**: Automatic\n   - **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n   - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n\n3. **Europcar**\n   - **Vehicle Type**: Ford Puma (Compact)\n   - **Price**: $308.39 USD\n   - **Pickup Location**: Alexandria Downtown\n   - **Drop-off Location**: Sydney Downtown\n   - **Rating**: 8.2 (Very good) based on 13 reviews\n   - **Free Cancellation**: Yes\n   - **Transmission**: Automatic\n   - **Mileage**: Unlimited km\n   - **Fuel Policy**: Like for like\n\n### Hotel Accommodation\nFor the night of **November 10, 2024**, you can stay at one of these hotels within **50 km of Sydney City Centre**:\n\n1. **Atura Blacktown**\n   - **Location**: Blacktown, Australia\n   - **Rating**: 8.2 (Very good) based on 1177 reviews\n   - **Price**: Starting at $191.70 AUD per night\n   - **Check-in**: From 14:00\n   - **Check-out**: Until 11:00\n   - **Available Rooms**:\n     - **Atura King Room**\n       - **Price**: $125.71 USD per night\n       - **Capacity**: 2 adults\n       - **Breakfast**: Available at $20 USD\n       - **Cancellation**: Free cancellation until 1 day before arrival\n     - **Atura Twin Room**\n       - **Price**: $160.00 USD per night\n       - **Capacity**: 2 adults\n       - **Breakfast**: Included\n       - **Cancellation**: Free cancellation until 1 day before arrival\n\n2. **Maclin Lodge Motel**\n   - **Location**: Campbelltown, Australia\n   - **Rating**: 8.2 (Very good) based on 2129 reviews\n   - **Price*