ission, unlimited mileage, air conditioning\n\n3. **Nissan X-Trail (Intermediate)**\n   - **Supplier:** Budget\n   - **Pickup Location:** Brisbane International Airport\n   - **Pickup Date & Time:** November 10, 2024, at 8:00 AM\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Gold Coast - Ashmore\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 17, 2024, at 2:00 PM\n   - **Price:** $532.87 USD (approx. AUD $448.16)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Features:** Automatic transmission, unlimited mileage, air conditioning\n\n### Hotel Availability in Gold Coast\nI found two hotels within 50 kilometers of Gold Coast for your stay on November 17, 2024:\n\n1. **Pethers Rainforest Retreat**\n   - **Location:** Mount Tamborine\n   - **Room Type:** Superior Studio Villa\n   - **Price:** $269 USD (approx. AUD $410) per night\n   - **Breakfast Included:** Yes\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation until November 9, 2024\n   - **Room Size:** 100 m²\n   - **Amenities:** Entire villa, 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom, kitchenette, balcony\n\n2. **The Imperial Hotel**\n   - **Location:** Murwillumbah\n   - **Room Types Available:**\n     - **Deluxe Single Room:** $77 USD (approx. AUD $118) per night\n     - **Queen Room:** $90 USD (approx. AUD $138) per night\n     - **Deluxe Queen Room:** $97 USD (approx. AUD $148) per night\n     - **Queen Room with Balcony:** $103 USD (approx. AUD $157) per night\n     - **Queen Room - Disability Access:** $103 USD (approx. AUD $157) per night\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation until November 15, 2024\n   - **Amenities:** High-speed internet included\n\n### Summary\n- **Car Rentals:** Options available from Budget at Brisbane Airport starting from $467.39 USD.\n- **Hotels:** Options available in Mount Tamborine and Murwillumbah with prices ranging from $77 to $269 USD per night.\n\nWould you like to proceed with any bookings or need more details?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 