stant", "content": "### Car Rental Information at San Francisco International Airport\n1. **Hertz - Nissan Versa (Compact)**\n   - **Pick-up Location:** Burlingame - California Drive\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Oakland - Broadway Street\n   - **Pick-up Date & Time:** November 13, 2024, at 08:00 AM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 20, 2024, at 02:00 PM\n   - **Price:** $295.76 (including taxes and fees)\n   - **Rating:** 9.3/10 (Superb)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n     - Like-for-like fuel policy\n\n2. **Hertz - Volkswagen Jetta (Standard)**\n   - **Pick-up Location:** Burlingame - California Drive\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Oakland - Broadway Street\n   - **Pick-up Date & Time:** November 13, 2024, at 08:00 AM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 20, 2024, at 02:00 PM\n   - **Price:** $305.70\n   - **Rating:** 9.3/10 (Superb)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n     - Like-for-like fuel policy\n\n3. **Hertz - Toyota Corolla (Intermediate)**\n   - **Pick-up Location:** Burlingame - California Drive\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Oakland - Broadway Street\n   - **Pick-up Date & Time:** November 13, 2024, at 08:00 AM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 20, 2024, at 02:00 PM\n   - **Price:** $308.71\n   - **Rating:** 9.3/10 (Superb)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n     - Like-for-like fuel policy\n\n---\n\n### Available Hotels Near Oakland City Centre (Night of November 20, 2024)\n\n#### 1. **Hotel 1550 - SFO Airport West (San Bruno)**\n   - **Rating:** 8.2/10 (Very Good)\n   - **Price:** $155.10 per night (excluding taxes and fees)\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Available Rooms:**\n     - **King Room - Non-Smoking**\n       - Price: $155.10\n       - Free cancellation until November 19, 2024\n       - Breakfast included\n     - **King Room - Mobility Access/Non-Smoking**\n       - Price: $155.10\n       - Free cancellation until November 19, 2024\n       - Breakfast included\n     - **Business King Room - Non-Smoking**\n       - Price: $166.80\n       - Free cancellation until November 19, 2024\n       - Breakfast included\n\n#### 2. **Aristocrat Hotel, BW Signature Collection (Half Moon Bay)**\n   - **Rating:** 8.7/10 (Fabulous)\n   - **Price:** $229 per night (excluding taxes and fees)\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Available Rooms:**\n     - **King Room - Non-Smoking**\n       - Price: $229\n       - Free cancellation until November 19, 2024, at 16:00\n       - Breakfast included\n     - **Queen Room with Two Queen Beds and Roll-In Shower - Disability Access**\n       - Price: $234\n       - Free cancellation until November 19, 2024, at 16:00\n       - Breakfast included\n     - **King Room with Roll-In Shower - Disability Access**\n       - Price: $234\n       - Free cancellation until November 19, 2024, at 16:00\n       - Breakfast included\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Car Rental:** Options starting at $295.76 with Hertz.\n- **Hotels:** Options available in San Bruno and Half Moon Bay, with prices starting at $155.10 per night. All hotels offer free cancellation and breakfast included.\n\nLet me know if you need further assistance or if you'd like to proceed with a booking!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 7, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides detailed car rental information and hotel options, but the hotels listed are not within 50 kilometers of Oakland City Centre as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
