lation\n\n2. **Buick Verano**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Type:** Standard\n   - **Transmission:** Automatic\n   - **Seats:** 5\n   - **Price:** $356.63 (approx. $386.79 total)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Inwood - Burnside Avenue\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Manhattan West - 83rd Street\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation\n\n3. **Nissan Rogue**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Type:** Intermediate\n   - **Transmission:** Automatic\n   - **Seats:** 5\n   - **Price:** $435.22 (approx. $525.69 total)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Inwood - Burnside Avenue\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Manhattan West - 83rd Street\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation\n\n4. **Toyota Corolla**\n   - **Supplier:** Hertz\n   - **Type:** Intermediate\n   - **Transmission:** Automatic\n   - **Seats:** 5\n   - **Price:** $372.65 (approx. $402.81 total)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Inwood - Burnside Avenue\n   - **Drop-off Location:** Manhattan West - 83rd Street\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation\n\n---\n\n### Hotel Availability for November 15, 2024\nHere are available hotels within **50 kilometers of Manhattan** for your stay on November 15, 2024:\n\n#### 1. **Ly New York Hotel**  \n   - **Location:** College Point, Queens\n   - **Rating:** 8/10 (Very Good)\n   - **Price:** $214.45 per night\n   - **Available Rooms:**\n     - **Double Room:** $214.45 (Free cancellation until November 14, 2024)\n     - **Deluxe Double Room:** $231.01 (Free cancellation until November 14, 2024)\n     - **Deluxe Single Room:** $231.01 (Free cancellation until November 14, 2024)\n\n#### 2. **The Box House Hotel**  \n   - **Location:** Brooklyn, New York\n   - **Rating:** 8.5/10 (Very Good)\n   - **Price:** $355.21 per night\n   - **Available Rooms:**\n     - **Superior Queen:** $355.21 (Free cancellation until November 13, 2024)\n     - **Superior Queen with Balcony:** $371.77 (Free cancellation until November 13, 2024)\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Car Rental:** Options availa