 taxes and fees)\n  - **Base Fare:** $416.37 USD\n  - **Fees:** $9.95 USD\n  - **Taxes:** $110.78 USD\n\n### Car Rental Details\nYou can book a sedan for local transportation in Rome. Here are the options available for pickup at Fiumicino Airport and drop-off at the same location:\n\n#### Option 1: Jeep Renegade (Compact)\n- **Supplier:** Record Go\n- **Pickup Location:** Fiumicino Airport\n- **Pickup Date:** December 1, 2024\n- **Pickup Time:** 10:10 AM (1 hour after arrival)\n- **Drop-off Date:** December 8, 2024\n- **Drop-off Time:** 07:00 AM (3 hours before return flight)\n- **Daily Rate:** $57.71 USD\n- **Total Price:** $403.97 USD (for 7 days)\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n#### Option 2: Opel Corsa (Economy)\n- **Supplier:** Centauro\n- **Pickup Location:** Fiumicino Airport\n- **Pickup Date:** December 1, 2024\n- **Pickup Time:** 10:10 AM\n- **Drop-off Date:** December 8, 2024\n- **Drop-off Time:** 07:00 AM\n- **Daily Rate:** $50.17 USD\n- **Total Price:** $351.19 USD (for 7 days)\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n#### Option 3: Fiat 500 (Mini)\n- **Supplier:** Record Go\n- **Pickup Location:** Fiumicino Airport\n- **Pickup Date:** December 1, 2024\n- **Pickup Time:** 10:10 AM\n- **Drop-off Date:** December 8, 2024\n- **Drop-off Time:** 07:00 AM\n- **Daily Rate:** $45.41 USD\n- **Total Price:** $317.87 USD (for 7 days)\n- **Mileage:** Unlimited km\n- **Transmission:** Manual\n- **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight Total:** $538 USD\n- **Car Rental Options:**\n  - Jeep Renegade: $403.97 USD\n  - Opel Corsa: $351.19 USD\n  - Fiat 500: $317.87 USD\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options, or do you need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, 