 to Barcelona for your vacation dates (October 5th to 12th, 2024):\n\n1. **Outbound Flight: Berlin (BER) to Barcelona (BCN)**\n   - **Departure:** October 5, 2024, at 10:50 AM\n   - **Arrival:** October 5, 2024, at 2:50 PM\n   - **Flight Number:** LH 1935 (Berlin to Munich) & LH 1814 (Munich to Barcelona)\n   - **Total Duration:** 4 hours\n   - **Cabin Class:** Business\n\n2. **Return Flight: Barcelona (BCN) to Berlin (BER)**\n   - **Departure:** October 12, 2024, at 7:50 AM\n   - **Arrival:** October 12, 2024, at 12:05 PM\n   - **Flight Number:** LH 1819 (Barcelona to Munich) & LH 1926 (Munich to Berlin)\n   - **Total Duration:** 4 hours 15 minutes\n   - **Cabin Class:** Business\n\n**Total Price:** $510 USD (approx.)\n\n---\n\n### Car Rental Details\nI found SUV options for your local transportation in Barcelona. Here are the top choices:\n\n1. **Ford Kuga**\n   - **Supplier:** Record Go\n   - **Pickup Location:** Barcelona El Prat Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Pickup Date & Time:** October 5, 2024, at 3:50 PM (1 hour after arrival)\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** October 12, 2024, at 4:50 AM (3 hours before departure)\n   - **Price:** $208.24 USD\n   - **Rating:** 7.3/10 (Good)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Manual transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage: 1750 km per rental\n     - Free cancellation\n\n2. **Fiat 500e (Electric)**\n   - **Supplier:** Europcar\n   - **Pickup Location:** Barcelona El Prat Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Pickup Date & Time:** October 5, 2024, at 3:50 PM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** October 12, 2024, at 4:50 AM\n   - **Price:** $135.83 USD\n   - **Rating:** 7.9/10 (Good)\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n\n3. **Mitsubishi ASX**\n   - **Supplier:** Goldcar\n   - **Pickup Location:** Barcelona El Prat Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Pickup Date & Time:** October 5, 2024, at 3:50 PM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** October 12, 2024, at 4:50 AM\n   - **Price:** $184.50 USD\n 