: 13:45 (1:45 PM)\n    - Arrival: 15:05 (3:05 PM)\n    - Duration: 1 hour 20 minutes\n    - Airline: Air Dolomiti (operated by Lufthansa)\n  - **Leg 2:** Frankfurt Airport (FRA) to Edinburgh Airport (EDI)\n    - Departure: 16:05 (4:05 PM)\n    - Arrival: 17:10 (5:10 PM)\n    - Duration: 1 hour 5 minutes\n    - Airline: Lufthansa\n\n### Edinburgh Castle Tour Information\n#### Tour on November 20, 2024\n- **Tour Name:** Edinburgh Castle Guided Walking Tour in English\n- **Available Start Times:**\n  - **10:30 AM**\n  - **1:30 PM**\n- **Tour Duration:** Approximately 2 hours\n- **Price:**\n  - **Adult:** $43.37 USD\n  - **Senior (65+):** $38.20 USD\n  - **Child (5-15):** $33.02 USD\n  - **Infant (0-4):** Free\n\n#### Tour on November 21, 2024\n- **Tour Name:** Edinburgh Castle Guided Walking Tour in English\n- **Available Start Times:**\n  - **10:30 AM**\n  - **1:30 PM**\n- **Tour Duration:** Approximately 2 hours\n- **Price:** Same as above\n\n### Conclusion\n- Your flight arrives in Edinburgh at **5:10 PM** on November 20, 2024.\n- The last available tour on November 20 starts at **1:30 PM**, which you will not be able to make due to the flight arrival time.\n- Therefore, you can take the tour on **November 21, 2024**, with start times at **10:30 AM** or **1:30 PM**.\n\n### Recommendation\n- Plan to take the tour on **November 21, 2024**, at either **10:30 AM** or **1:30 PM**.\n- This allows you ample time to rest and explore Edinburgh after your flight arrives.\n\nWould you like assistance with booking the flight or the tour?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 2}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including the fastest flight details and the start times for the Edinburgh Castle tour on both the day of arrival and the following day."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
