 USD  \n*(Note: Premium Economy was not available; the best alternative in Business Class is provided.)*\n\n---\n\n### Car Rental Details\nHere are some SUV options for local transportation in Prague:\n\n1. **Volkswagen Polo**:\n   - **Pickup Location**: Vaclav Havel Airport Prague\n   - **Pickup Date**: November 25, 2024, at 1:10 PM\n   - **Drop-off Date**: December 2, 2024, at 3:00 PM\n   - **Supplier**: Rent Plus\n   - **Price**: $75.77 USD\n   - **Features**: Manual transmission, air conditioning, 5 seats.\n   - **Rating**: 8.3/10 (Very Good)\n\n2. **Kia Stonic**:\n   - **Pickup Location**: Vaclav Havel Airport Prague\n   - **Pickup Date**: November 25, 2024, at 1:10 PM\n   - **Drop-off Date**: December 2, 2024, at 3:00 PM\n   - **Supplier**: Rent Plus\n   - **Price**: $91.07 USD\n   - **Features**: Manual transmission, air conditioning, 5 seats.\n   - **Rating**: 8.3/10 (Very Good)\n\n3. **Skoda Karoq**:\n   - **Pickup Location**: Vaclav Havel Airport Prague\n   - **Pickup Date**: November 25, 2024, at 1:10 PM\n   - **Drop-off Date**: December 2, 2024, at 3:00 PM\n   - **Supplier**: Rent Plus\n   - **Price**: $110.99 USD\n   - **Features**: Manual transmission, air conditioning, 5 seats.\n   - **Rating**: 8.3/10 (Very Good)\n\n### Summary\n- **Flights**: Total cost is **$623.30 USD** for round-trip business class tickets.\n- **Car Rental**: Options range from **$75.77 to $110.99 USD** for SUV rentals.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response correctly identifies that Premium Economy is not available and provides Business Class as the best alternative. However, the car rental options listed are not SUVs, which the user specifically requested."}}}
