fastest round-trip business class air tickets from Berlin to Budapest for your vacation from December 15th to 22nd, 2024:\n\n1. **Outbound Flight**\n   - **Departure:** Berlin Brandenburg Airport (BER)\n   - **Arrival:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (BUD)\n   - **Departure Time:** December 15, 2024, at 19:40\n   - **Arrival Time:** December 15, 2024, at 22:25\n   - **Flight Duration:** Approximately 2 hours 45 minutes (with a layover in Vienna)\n   - **Flight Number:** OS 236 (operated by Austrian Airlines)\n   - **Cabin Class:** Business\n   - **Price:** $657 USD (including taxes)\n\n2. **Return Flight**\n   - **Departure:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (BUD)\n   - **Arrival:** Berlin Brandenburg Airport (BER)\n   - **Departure Time:** December 22, 2024, at 17:00\n   - **Arrival Time:** December 22, 2024, at 20:10\n   - **Flight Duration:** Approximately 3 hours 10 minutes (with a layover in Munich)\n   - **Flight Number:** LH 1679 (operated by Lufthansa)\n   - **Cabin Class:** Business\n   - **Price:** Included in the round-trip fare\n\n### Car Rental Details\nI found several sedan options for local transportation in Budapest. You can pick up the car at Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport one hour after your arrival (around 23:25 on December 15) and return it three hours before your return flight (around 14:00 on December 22).\n\n1. **Toyota Aygo (Manual)**\n   - **Price:** $145.40 USD\n   - **Pickup Location:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n   - **Supplier:** Dryyve (Rating: 8.4/10)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Special Offer:** Includes one additional driver and winter tyres.\n\n2. **Opel Corsa (Manual)**\n   - **Price:** $167.40 USD\n   - **Pickup Location:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n   - **Supplier:** Dryyve (Rating: 8.4/10)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Special Offer:** Includes one additional driver and winter tyres.\n\n3. **Suzuki Swift Hybrid (Manual)**\n   - **Price:** $167.50 USD\n   - **Pickup Location:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n   - **Supplier:** Dryyve (Rating: 8.4/10)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Special Offer:** Includes one additional driver and winter tyres.\n\n4. **Citroen C3 (Manual)**\n   - **Price:** $187.79 USD\n   - **Pickup Location:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n   - **Supplier:** Dryyve (Rating: 8.4/10)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Special Offer:** Includes one additional driver and winter tyres.\n\n5. **Opel Corsa (Automatic)**\n   - **Price:** $170.83 USD\n   - **Pickup Location:** Budapest Ferenc Liszt International Airport (Shuttle Bus)\n   - **Supplier:** Dryyve (Rating: 8.4/10)\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Special Offer:** Includes one additional driver and winter tyres.\n\n### Next Steps\n- **Flights:** Would you like to proceed with booking the flights?\n- **Car Rental:** Which sedan would you prefer for your local transportation in Budapest?\n\nLet me know if you need any further assistance!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 5, "total_call_num": 5, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
