83\n- **Price:** $62 USD per adult\n\n### Basilica San Marco Tour Availability\n#### November 20, 2024\n- **Tour Start Time:** 14:00 (2:00 PM)\n- **Availability:** Tickets are available\n- **Price:** €55 per adult (approximately $59.26 USD)\n- **Languages:** Russian, Romanian, Italian\n- **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 1 day before the tour\n\n#### November 21, 2024\n- **Tour Start Time:** 14:00 (2:00 PM)\n- **Availability:** Tickets are available\n- **Price:** €55 per adult (approximately $59.57 USD)\n- **Languages:** Russian, Romanian, Italian\n- **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation up to 1 day before the tour\n\n### Conclusion\nSince your flight arrives in Venice at **23:55** on November 20, 2024, you won't be able to attend the tour on the same day. However, you can easily book the tour for the following day (**November 21, 2024**) at **14:00**.\n\nWould you like assistance with booking the flight or the tour?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
