 USD for a group of up to 6 people)\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation up to 1 day before the start.\n\n### Recommendation\nSince your flight arrives in Lisbon at **21:45 PM** on November 20, you won't be able to make the Sintra tour that day (which starts at 09:00 AM). Therefore, I recommend booking the tour for **November 21, 2024**, at **09:00 AM**. This gives you ample time to rest after your flight and enjoy the tour the next day.\n\nWould you like assistance with booking the flight or the tour?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
