varnabhumi Airport (In Terminal)\n- **Pickup Date:** December 20, 2024, at 23:00\n- **Drop-off Date:** December 25, 2024, at 23:00\n- **Rating:** 7.5/10 (Good)\n- **Features:**\n  - Automatic transmission\n  - Air conditioning\n  - Unlimited mileage\n  - Free cancellation\n\n#### Option 2: Compact Car (Honda City)\n- **Supplier:** Drive Car Rental\n- **Price:** $160.33 USD\n- **Pickup Location:** Suvarnabhumi Airport (In Terminal)\n- **Pickup Date:** December 20, 2024, at 23:00\n- **Drop-off Date:** December 25, 2024, at 23:00\n- **Rating:** 9.2/10 (Superb)\n- **Features:**\n  - Automatic transmission\n  - Air conditioning\n  - Unlimited mileage\n  - Free cancellation\n\n#### Option 3: Economy Car (Honda City)\n- **Supplier:** Hertz\n- **Price:** $150.86 USD\n- **Pickup Location:** Suvarnabhumi Airport (In Terminal)\n- **Pickup Date:** December 20, 2024, at 23:00\n- **Drop-off Date:** December 25, 2024, at 23:00\n- **Rating:** 8.3/10 (Very Good)\n- **Features:**\n  - Automatic transmission\n  - Air conditioning\n  - Unlimited mileage\n  - Free cancellation\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** China Eastern Airlines from Chengdu to Bangkok on December 20, 2024, for $110.22 USD.\n- **Car Rental:** Multiple options available at Suvarnabhumi Airport starting from $138.68 USD for 5 days.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
