G)  \n- **Arrival:** Kuala Lumpur International Airport (KUL)  \n- **Departure Time:** November 25, 2024, at 17:30  \n- **Arrival Time:** November 26, 2024, at 03:30  \n- **Flight Segments:**  \n  1. **Flight Number:** CA 4345 (Operated by Air China)  \n     - **Departure:** 17:30 from CKG  \n     - **Arrival:** 19:35 at Shenzhen Bao'an International Airport (SZX)  \n  2. **Flight Number:** ZH 333 (Operated by Shenzhen Airlines)  \n     - **Departure:** 23:05 from SZX  \n     - **Arrival:** 03:30 at KUL  \n- **Total Duration:** 10 hours  \n- **Price:** $111.90 USD  \n  - **Base Fare:** $28.29 USD  \n  - **Taxes:** $82.80 USD  \n- **Baggage Allowance:**  \n  - **Checked Luggage:** 1 piece (max 50.7 lbs)  \n  - **Cabin Luggage:** 1 piece (max 11 lbs, size restrictions: 21.7 x 15.8 x 7.9 inches)  \n- **Amenities:**  \n  - Free meal on the first segment  \n  - Free entertainment on both segments  \n\n### Car Rental Information at Kuala Lumpur International Airport\n**Rental Period:**  \n- **Pick-up:** November 26, 2024, at 19:00  \n- **Drop-off:** November 30, 2024, at 19:00  \n\n**Available Options:**  \n1. **Honda City (Luxury)**  \n   - **Supplier:** Paradise Rent-A-Car  \n   - **Price:** $210.70 USD  \n   - **Rating:** 6.0/10 (OK)  \n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes  \n   - **Features:**  \n     - Automatic transmission  \n     - Unlimited mileage  \n     - Free amendments  \n\n2. **Ford Ranger (Full-size)**  \n   - **Supplier:** Hertz  \n   - **Price:** $364.94 USD  \n   - **Rating:** 8.1/10 (Very Good)  \n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes  \n   - **Features:**  \n     - Automatic transmission  \n     - Unlimited mileage  \n     - Free amendments  \n\n3. **Proton Saga (Economy)**  \n   - **Supplier:** Sixt  \n   - **Price:** $183.41 USD  \n   - **Rating:** 6.4/10 (OK)  \n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes  \n   - **Features:**  \n     - Automatic transmission  \n     - Unlimited mileage  \n     - Free amendments  \n\n4. **Honda City (Intermediate)**  \n   - **Supplier:**