25 minutes\n  2. **Flight 2:**\n     - **Departure:** SZX at 08:10\n     - **Arrival:** NRT at 13:45\n     - **Flight Number:** ZH 655 (Operated by Shenzhen Airlines)\n     - **Duration:** 4 hours 35 minutes\n- **Total Duration:** Approximately 16 hours 30 minutes\n- **Price:** $136 USD (including taxes)\n\n### Car Rental Information near Narita International Airport\nHere are some car rental options available at Narita International Airport:\n\n1. **Nissan Roox GPS**\n   - **Supplier:** Nissan\n   - **Type:** Mini Car\n   - **Price:** $238.27 USD (total for 5 days)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Shuttle Bus at Narita International Airport\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Rating:** 8.8 (Fabulous, 582 reviews)\n\n2. **Mazda 2 Demio GPS**\n   - **Supplier:** Europcar\n   - **Type:** Economy Car\n   - **Price:** $239.79 USD (total for 5 days)\n   - **Pickup Location:** In Terminal at Narita International Airport\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Rating:** 8.2 (Very Good, 142 reviews)\n\n3. **Nissan Note E-Power**\n   - **Supplier:** Nissan\n   - **Type:** Economy Car (Hybrid)\n   - **Price:** $275.83 USD (total for 5 days)\n   - **Pickup Location:** Downtown Narita\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Rating:** 8.3 (Very Good, 16 reviews)\n\n4. **Toyota Yaris**\n   - **Supplier:** Europcar\n   - **Type:** Compact Car\n   - **Price:** $288.53 USD (total for 5 days)\n   - **Pickup Location:** In Terminal at Narita International Airport\n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes\n   - **Rating:** 8.2 (Very Good, 142 reviews)\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** The cheapest flight from Beijing to Tokyo arrives at Narita International Airport on October 6, 2024, at 13:45.\n- **Car Rental:** You can rent a car at the airport starting at $238.27 for 5 days, with options ranging from mini to compact cars. \n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "