.47 USD\n    - Taxes: $67.30 USD\n- **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation available\n\n### Car Rental Information near Singapore Airport\n\n#### Options Available\n1. **Intermediate Car (Mazda CX-5)**\n   - **Supplier:** Avis\n   - **Pickup Location:** Changi Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Pickup Date & Time:** November 16, 2024, at 15:00\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time:** November 24, 2024, at 15:00\n   - **Price:** $785.60 USD\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n\n2. **Standard Car (Mazda 5)**\n   - **Supplier:** Avis\n   - **Pickup Location:** Changi Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Price:** $1,125.30 USD\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n\n3. **Compact Car (Mazda 3)**\n   - **Supplier:** Avis\n   - **Pickup Location:** Changi Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Price:** $691.22 USD\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n\n4. **Standard Car (Nissan Teana)**\n   - **Supplier:** Avis\n   - **Pickup Location:** Changi Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Price:** $835.92 USD\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n\n5. **Luxury Car (Mercedes E-Class)**\n   - **Supplier:** Avis\n   - **Pickup Location:** Changi Airport (In Terminal)\n   - **Price:** $1,251.12 USD\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** Cheapest option is $99.77 USD with Xiamen Airlines.\n- **Car Rental:** Multiple options available starting from $691.22 USD for a compact car.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking the flight or car rental?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested informat