ited km  \n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes  \n   - **Rating:** 8.5/10 (Very Good)  \n\n4. **Premium Car (Audi A4)**  \n   - **Supplier:** Avis  \n   - **Transmission:** Automatic  \n   - **Seats:** 5  \n   - **Price:** $777.73 USD  \n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited km  \n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes  \n   - **Rating:** 8.5/10 (Very Good)  \n\n5. **Compact Car (Mazda 3)**  \n   - **Supplier:** Avis  \n   - **Transmission:** Automatic  \n   - **Seats:** 5  \n   - **Price:** $518.22 USD  \n   - **Mileage:** Unlimited km  \n   - **Free Cancellation:** Yes  \n   - **Rating:** 8.5/10 (Very Good)  \n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Cheapest Flight:** $113 USD  \n- **Car Rental Options:** Starting from $518.22 USD  \n- **Pick-Up Location:** Changi Airport Terminal 3  \n- **Free Cancellation:** Available for all car rentals  \n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options, or do you need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
