ar for easy travel during your stay. Here are some options:\n\n#### 🚗 **1. Full-size Car (Chrysler Pacifica)**\n- **Supplier:** Sixt\n- **Pick-up & Drop-off Location:** 100 Chopin Plaza, InterContinental Hotel, Miami, USA, 33131\n- **Pick-up Time:** November 14, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Time:** November 15, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n- **Price:** $113.52 USD (includes taxes and charges)\n- **Features:** \n  - 7 seats\n  - Automatic transmission\n  - Unlimited mileage\n  - Free cancellation\n\n#### 🚗 **2. Compact Car (Chevrolet Trailblazer)**\n- **Supplier:** Sixt\n- **Pick-up & Drop-off Location:** Same as above\n- **Pick-up Time:** November 14, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Time:** November 15, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n- **Price:** $85.93 USD (includes taxes and charges)\n- **Features:** \n  - 5 seats\n  - Automatic transmission\n  - Unlimited mileage\n  - Free cancellation\n\n#### 🚗 **3. Standard Car (Volkswagen Jetta)**\n- **Supplier:** Sixt\n- **Pick-up & Drop-off Location:** Same as above\n- **Pick-up Time:** November 14, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n- **Drop-off Time:** November 15, 2024, at 11:00 AM\n- **Price:** $83.13 USD (includes taxes and charges)\n- **Features:** \n  - 5 seats\n  - Automatic transmission\n  - Unlimited mileage\n  - Free cancellation\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Hotel:** InterContinental Miami, an IHG Hotel\n- **Car Rental:** Options from Sixt near the hotel\n- **Total Cost:** \n  - Hotel: $755 USD\n  - Car Rental: Starting from $83.13 USD\n\nWould you like to proceed with the hotel booking or car rental?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
