n   - **Drop-off Time:** November 5, 2024, at 10:00 AM\n   - **Features:**\n     - Automatic transmission\n     - Unlimited mileage\n     - Free cancellation\n   - **Supplier Rating:** 7.0 (Good) based on 210 reviews\n\n### Summary\n- **Hotel:** Hilton Boston Park Plaza (Popular and well-rated)\n- **Car Rental:** Options available from Dollar Car Rental near the hotel, with flexible pickup and drop-off times.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking the hotel or car rental?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
