ation Policy**: Free cancellation available\n   - **Distance from Airport**: Approximately 30 kilometers\n   - **Facilities**: Swimming pool available\n\n### Car Rental Options\n1. **Volkswagen Jetta (Standard)**\n   - **Supplier**: Sixt\n   - **Pick-up Location**: Miami International Airport\n   - **Drop-off Location**: InterContinental Miami Hotel\n   - **Pick-up Date & Time**: November 14, 2024, at 09:00 AM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time**: November 16, 2024, at 04:00 PM\n   - **Price**: $373.22 (approx.)\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available\n   - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n   - **Transmission**: Automatic\n\n2. **Toyota RAV4 (Intermediate)**\n   - **Supplier**: Sixt\n   - **Pick-up Location**: Miami International Airport\n   - **Drop-off Location**: InterContinental Miami Hotel\n   - **Pick-up Date & Time**: November 14, 2024, at 09:00 AM\n   - **Drop-off Date & Time**: November 16, 2024, at 04:00 PM\n   - **Price**: $413.47 (approx.)\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available\n   - **Mileage**: Unlimited\n   - **Transmission**: Automatic\n\n### Summary of Your Trip\n- **Hotel**: InterContinental Miami, an IHG Hotel for one night on November 14, 2024.\n- **Car Rental**: Options available starting from $373.22 for a Volkswagen Jetta.\n\nWould you like to proceed with the booking for the hotel or car rental, or do you need more options?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including hotel booking options within 30 kilometers of Miami International Airport and car rental details for the specified dates and times."}, "correct": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response correctly lists the hotel and car rental options with accurate details such as location, check-in/check-out times, and prices. However, the distance from the airport to the