parture:** Montreal-Trudeau International Airport (YUL) at **18:35**\n- **Arrival:** Miami International Airport (MIA) at **22:37**\n- **Duration:** 4 hours 2 minutes\n- **Cabin Class:** Economy\n- **Price:** $183.62 (including taxes)\n  - **Base Fare:** $104.28\n  - **Taxes:** $79.34\n- **Baggage Allowance:**\n  - **Cabin Baggage:** 1 piece (max dimensions: 21.7 x 15.8 x 9.1 inches)\n  - **Personal Item:** Allowed\n- **Amenities:**\n  - **Entertainment:** Free\n  - **Food:** Paid (light meal)\n  - **Wi-Fi:** Paid\n\n#### Miami to Orlando (November 22, 2024)\n- **Flight Number:** AA 1712 (American Airlines)\n- **Departure:** Miami International Airport (MIA) at **08:51**\n- **Arrival:** Orlando International Airport (MCO) at **10:01**\n- **Duration:** 1 hour 10 minutes\n- **Cabin Class:** Economy\n- **Price:** $358.48 (including taxes)\n  - **Base Fare:** $319.42\n  - **Taxes:** $39.06\n- **Baggage Allowance:**\n  - **Cabin Baggage:** 1 piece (max dimensions: 21.7 x 15.8 x 9.1 inches)\n  - **Personal Item:** Allowed\n- **Amenities:**\n  - **Entertainment:** Free\n  - **Power Outlets:** Free\n  - **Wi-Fi:** Paid\n\n### Hotel Options Near Airports\n\n#### Near Miami International Airport (MIA)\n1. **Tiana Beach Inn**\n   - **Location:** Hollywood Beach (18 km from MIA)\n   - **Price:** $213.05 for 2 nights\n   - **Rating:** 8.8 (Fabulous)\n   - **Check-in:** 15:00 | **Check-out:** 11:00\n   - **Amenities:** Free Wi-Fi, Free Parking\n\n2. **The Palms Inn & Suites**\n   - **Location:** Kendall (15 km from MIA)\n   - **Price:** $191.60 for 2 nights\n   - **Rating:** 8.2 (Very Good)\n   - **Check-in:** 15:00 | **Check-out:** 12:00\n   - **Amenities:** Free Breakfast, Swimming Pool, Free Parking\n\n3. **Wyndham Garden Ft Lauderdale Airport & Cruise Port**\n   - **Location:** Dania Beach (8 km from MIA)\n   - **Price:** $278.80 for 2 nights\n   - **Rating:** 8.3 (Very Good)\n   - **Check-in:** 15:00 | **Check-out:** 11:00\n   - **Amenities:** Swimming Pool, Free Parking\n\n