: 3158)\n- **Cabin Class:** Economy\n- **Total Price:** $228.48 USD (including taxes)\n- **Baggage Allowance:**\n  - 1 cabin bag (max dimensions: 22.1 x 14.2 x 9.1 inches)\n  - 1 personal item\n\n#### Orlando to Miami (December 17, 2024)\n- **Departure:** Orlando International Airport (MCO)\n- **Arrival:** Miami International Airport (MIA)\n- **Departure Time:** December 17, 2024, at 07:00 AM\n- **Arrival Time:** December 17, 2024, at 08:17 AM\n- **Flight Duration:** Approximately 1 hour 17 minutes\n- **Airline:** American Airlines (Flight Number: 2371)\n- **Cabin Class:** Economy\n- **Total Price:** $132.48 USD (including taxes)\n- **Baggage Allowance:**\n  - 1 cabin bag (max dimensions: 22.1 x 14.2 x 9.1 inches)\n  - 1 personal item\n\n### Hotel Recommendations\n\n#### Orlando (Near MCO Airport)\n1. **SOLANA 7 Bed Rooms FAMILY VACATION VILLA**\n   - **Rating:** 9.4 (Superb)\n   - **Price:** $353.97 for 2 nights\n   - **Features:** Private pool, spa, 7 bedrooms, 5 bathrooms\n   - **Check-in:** December 15, 2024\n   - **Check-out:** December 17, 2024\n   - **Distance from MCO:** Within 40 km\n\n2. **Casita mi Encanto**\n   - **Rating:** 9.0 (Superb)\n   - **Price:** $466.99 for 2 nights\n   - **Features:** Cozy and spacious house, private pool, 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms\n   - **Check-in:** December 15, 2024\n   - **Check-out:** December 17, 2024\n   - **Distance from MCO:** Within 40 km\n\n3. **EXCELLENT 7 Bedroom EIR Vacation Villa**\n   - **Rating:** 8.6 (Fabulous)\n   - **Price:** $380.88 for 2 nights\n   - **Features:** Private pool, 7 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms\n   - **Check-in:** December 15, 2024\n   - **Check-out:** December 17, 2024\n   - **Distance from MCO:** Within 40 km\n\n#### Miami (Near MIA Airport)\n1. **Fairway Inn Florida City Homestead Everglades**\n   - **Rating:** 7.9 (Good)\n   - **Price:** $115.92 for 2 nights\n   - **Features:** Swimming pool, free parking\n   - **Check-in:** December 17, 2024\n   - **Check-out:** December 19, 2024\n   - **Distance from MIA:** Within 40 km\n\n2. **Travelodge by Wyndham Florida City/Homestead/Everglades**\n   - **Rating:** 8.4 (Very Good)\n   - **Price:** $136.00 for 2 nights\n   - **Features:** Swimming pool, free parking, breakfast included\n   - **Check-in:** December 17, 2024\n   - **Check-out:** December 19, 2024\n   - **Distance from MIA:** Within 40 km\n\n3. **Tiana Beach Inn**\n   - **Rating:** 8.8 (Fabulous)\n   - **Price:** $248.42 for 2 nights\n   - **Features:** Beachfront location, swimming pool\n   - **Check-in:** December 17, 2024\n   - **Check-out:** December 19, 2024\n   - **Distance from MIA:** Within 40 km\n\n### Summary\n- **Flights:**\n  - LAX to MCO: $228.48 USD\n  - MCO to MIA: $132.48 USD\n- **Hotels:**\n  - Orlando (2 nights): Options ranging from $353.97 to $466.99\n  - Miami (2 nights): Options ranging from $115.92 to $248.42\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these flights or hotels?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 11, "total_call_num": 11, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
