tel Options in Chicago (Near O'Hare Airport)\n1. **SureStay Plus Hotel by Best Western Chicago Lombard**\n   - **Location:** Lombard, IL\n   - **Distance from Airport:** ~15 km\n   - **Price:** $85.49 per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.3/10 (Very Good)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation\n   - **Amenities:** Breakfast included, free parking\n\n2. **Hyatt Place Chicago - Lombard/Oak Brook**\n   - **Location:** Lombard, IL\n   - **Distance from Airport:** ~16 km\n   - **Price:** $114.30 per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.1/10 (Very Good)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Non-refundable\n   - **Amenities:** Breakfast included, swimming pool\n\n3. **Hyatt Place Chicago Hoffman Estates**\n   - **Location:** Hoffman Estates, IL\n   - **Distance from Airport:** ~30 km\n   - **Price:** $102.60 per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.2/10 (Very Good)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Non-refundable\n   - **Amenities:** Breakfast included, swimming pool\n\n### Next Steps:\n- Would you like detailed baggage allowances or insurance prices for your flights?\n- Do you need help booking any of these hotels?"}], "message": {"error_type": "stop_early", "content": "Stop early."}, "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 2, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 9, "total_call_num": 11, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response contains some correct information, such as the flight details for the Boston to Chicago flight and some hotel options. However, there are inaccuracies in the flight details for the San Francisco to Boston flight, such as the flight number and token, which do not match the API response."}}}
