* Toronto (YYZ) at 19:25\n     - **Duration:** 13 hours 20 minutes\n     - **Aircraft Type:** Boeing 787-9 Dreamliner\n     - **Cabin Class:** Premium Economy\n     - **Terminals:** Departure from Terminal 1, Arrival at Terminal 1\n\n- **Total Travel Time:** Approximately 17 hours 45 minutes\n- **Price:** $3,637 USD (including taxes)\n  - **Base Fare:** $3,374.78 USD\n  - **Taxes:** $262.20 USD\n\n---\n\n### Hotel Availability Near Toronto Pearson International Airport\nHere are some hotels within a 10-kilometer radius of Toronto Pearson International Airport (YYZ) for September 20, 2024:\n\n1. **Holiday Inn Express & Suites Toronto Airport West**\n   - **Location:** Mississauga, ON\n   - **Distance:** Approximately 5 km from YYZ\n   - **Rating:** 7.1 (Good, based on 3,111 reviews)\n   - **Price:** $202 USD (including taxes)\n   - **Amenities:** Swimming pool, breakfast included, free parking\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n\n2. **Four Points by Sheraton Toronto Airport**\n   - **Location:** Mississauga, ON\n   - **Distance:** Approximately 4 km from YYZ\n   - **Rating:** 7.6 (Good, based on 1,760 reviews)\n   - **Price:** $202 USD (including taxes)\n   - **Amenities:** Swimming pool, free parking\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00 until 23:30\n   - **Check-out:** Until 12:00\n\n3. **Canadas Best Value Inn Toronto**\n   - **Location:** Toronto, ON\n   - **Distance:** Approximately 8 km from YYZ\n   - **Rating:** 7.6 (Good, based on 2,112 reviews)\n   - **Price:** $146 CAD (approximately $107 USD)\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n\n4. **Sandman Signature Mississauga Hotel**\n   - **Location:** Mississauga, ON\n   - **Distance:** Approximately 6 km from YYZ\n   - **Rating:** 7.9 (Good, based on 2,083 reviews)\n   - **Price:** $211 CAD (approximately $155 USD)\n   - **Amenities:** Swimming pool\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 12:00\n\n5. **Hilton Gar