i-Fi.\n   - **Second Leg:**\n     - **Departure:** Charlotte Douglas International Airport (CLT) at **16:42**\n     - **Arrival:** Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport (DFW) at **18:45**\n     - **Flight Number:** AA 2838\n     - **Duration:** Approximately 3 hours 3 minutes\n     - **Aircraft Type:** 32Q\n     - **Amenities:** Free snacks, free power outlets, paid Wi-Fi.\n\n2. **Total Travel Time:** Approximately 5 hours 51 minutes.\n\n3. **Baggage Allowance:**\n   - **Hand Luggage:** 1 piece (max dimensions: 22.1 x 14.2 x 9.1 inches)\n   - **Personal Item:** Allowed.\n\n4. **Price Breakdown:**\n   - **Total Price:** $471.45 USD\n     - **Base Fare:** $404.70 USD\n     - **Taxes & Fees:** $66.75 USD\n\n5. **Carbon Emissions:** Higher than average (241.36 kg).\n\n### Hotels Near Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport\nHere are some hotels available within a 50-kilometer radius of the airport for November 10, 2024:\n\n1. **La Quinta by Wyndham Dallas Duncanville**\n   - **Location:** Duncanville, TX\n   - **Price:** $99 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.7 (Fabulous)\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool, breakfast included.\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation.\n\n2. **La Quinta Inn & Suites by Wyndham Lewisville**\n   - **Location:** Lewisville, TX\n   - **Price:** $96.90 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.8 (Fabulous)\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool, breakfast included.\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation.\n\n3. **Sonesta Select Dallas Central Expressway**\n   - **Location:** Dallas, TX\n   - **Price:** $68.64 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.0 (Very Good)\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool.\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Non-refundable.\n\n4. **La Quinta by Wyndham Dallas Grand Prairie North**\n   - **Location:** Grand Prairie, TX\n   - **Price:** $211.65 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.4 (Very Good)\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool, breakfast included.\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Non-refundable.\n\n5. **Radisson Hotel Dallas North-Addison**\n   - **Location:** Addison, TX\n   - **Price:** $93.06 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 7.4 (Good)\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool, breakfast included.\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation.\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** Fastest option is a 5-hour 51-minute journey with American Airlines, costing approximately **$471.45 USD**.\n- **Hotels:** Multiple options available near the airport starting from **$68.64 USD** per night. Most hotels offer free parking and swimming pools.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking the flight or any hotel?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
