ami International Airport:\n\n1. **The Palms Inn & Suites Miami, Kendall, FL**\n   - **Price:** $130 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.2 (Very Good)\n   - **Distance from Airport:** Approximately 15 km\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool, breakfast included\n   - **Check-in:** 3:00 PM | **Check-out:** 12:00 PM\n\n2. **Best Western Plus Miami Executive Airport Hotel and Suites**\n   - **Price:** $122 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.2 (Very Good)\n   - **Distance from Airport:** Approximately 18 km\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool, breakfast included\n   - **Check-in:** 3:00 PM | **Check-out:** 12:00 PM\n\n3. **Sonesta Select Miami Lakes**\n   - **Price:** $127 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.0 (Very Good)\n   - **Distance from Airport:** Approximately 10 km\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool\n   - **Check-in:** 4:00 PM | **Check-out:** 11:00 AM\n\n4. **AC Hotel by Marriott Miami Aventura**\n   - **Price:** $229 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.4 (Very Good)\n   - **Distance from Airport:** Approximately 25 km\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool\n   - **Check-in:** 3:00 PM | **Check-out:** 12:00 PM\n\n5. **Aloft Miami Aventura**\n   - **Price:** $220 USD per night\n   - **Rating:** 8.0 (Very Good)\n   - **Distance from Airport:** Approximately 25 km\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool\n   - **Check-in:** 3:00 PM | **Check-out:** 12:00 PM\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** Fastest option arrives in Miami at **05:04 PM** on December 5, 2024.\n- **Hotels:** Multiple options available within 20 km of the airport, ranging from **$122 to $229 USD** per night.\n\nWould you like to book any of these hotels or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 1, "reas