ional Airport (LAX)\nHere are some hotel options within 30 kilometers of LAX for your stay on December 10, 2024:\n\n1. **Crowne Plaza Hotel Los Angeles Harbor**\n   - **Location:** San Pedro, CA\n   - **Rating:** 7.7/10 (Good)\n   - **Price:** $154.40 USD per night\n   - **Check-in:** From 16:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, swimming pool\n\n2. **LA Crystal Hotel**\n   - **Location:** Carson, CA\n   - **Rating:** 7.9/10 (Good)\n   - **Price:** $120.28 USD per night\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 12:00\n   - **Amenities:** Breakfast included, swimming pool\n\n3. **citizenM Los Angeles Downtown**\n   - **Location:** Downtown Los Angeles\n   - **Rating:** 8.8/10 (Fabulous)\n   - **Price:** $179.00 USD per night\n   - **Check-in:** From 14:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Amenities:** Modern facilities\n\n4. **Double Suite Santa Monica**\n   - **Location:** Santa Monica\n   - **Rating:** 9.3/10 (Superb)\n   - **Price:** $350.48 USD per night\n   - **Check-in:** From 16:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 10:00\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking, apartment-style accommodation\n\n5. **Wave Hotel Manhattan Beach**\n   - **Location:** Manhattan Beach\n   - **Rating:** 7.4/10 (Good)\n   - **Price:** $149.00 USD per night\n   - **Check-in:** From 15:00\n   - **Check-out:** Until 11:00\n   - **Amenities:** Free parking\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** Fastest option with Cathay Pacific, departing on December 10, 2024.\n- **Hotels:** Several options available near LAX, ranging from budget-friendly to premium accommodations.\n\nWould you like to proceed with any bookings or need more details?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
