{"id": "Cross-170", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "Aden is going to stay at Pudong Shangri-La in Shanghai (hotel_id is 181422). Could you recommend some attractions near the hotel and provide detailed descriptions of the attractions?"}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Popular_Attraction_Near_By", "arguments": {"hotel_id": "181422"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"closest_landmarks": [{"latitude": 31.239688, "tag": "Oriental Pearl Tower", "total_votes": 326, "longitude": 121.499754, "distance": 0.300347662687368, "average_out_of_10": 8.8}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Attraction_Location", "arguments": {"query": "Oriental Pearl Tower"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"products": [{"id": "eyJwaW5uZWRQcm9kdWN0IjoiUFJ6MXhwTXl6Sm9xIiwidWZpIjotMTkyNDQ2NX0=", "__typename": "AttractionsSearchProductSuggestion", "title": "Oriental Pearl Tower Tickets Booking", "productId": "PRz1xpMyzJoq", "productSlug": "prz1xpmyzjoq-oriental-pearl-tower-tickets-booking", "taxonomySlug": "activities", "cityUfi": -1924465, "cityName": "Shanghai", "countryCode": "cn"}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Attraction_Details", "arguments": {"slug": "prz1xpmyzjoq-oriental-pearl-tower-tickets-booking"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"__typename": "AttractionsProduct", "additionalInfo": "Public transportation options are available nearby\n\nSuitable for all physical fitness levels\n\nBook & pay online, get confirmation with QR code later, show QR code at the entrance.\n\nOpening Hours: The Tower: 08:00-22:00 (stop admission at 21:30)\n\nEntrance Location: The Tower: 4.2M Entrance\n\nFree of charge for children under 100cm. Children between 100cm and 140cm enjoy discounted price.\n\nFor the buffet dinner, please be on time. Reservation would be cancelled 30 mins after the starting time if you don’t show up, and no cancelation, refund, or change can be made.\n\nNot wheelchair accessible\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Viator"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "Oriental Pearl Tower is the most-visited attraction in Shanghai, which has the functions of urban tourism, fashion catering, shopping, entertainment and historical exhibitions.\n\nThere is the magical space capsule makes you feel like in space and the Sky Galleria to have a visual enjoyment in high place of the tower. There is also the completely transparent observatory. \n\nThe indoor VR roller coaster, with the theme of flying over Shanghai, breaks through the limitations on vision and senses of traditional roller coaster, and is more exciting, more shocking and more interesting.\n\nRevolving Restaurant in the tower is the Asia's largest aerial revolving restaurant, offering buffets with Southeast Asian, Japanese, Chinese, European and American cuisines. Overlooking from a high altitude while enjoy dishes, you can have a clear sweeping view of Huangpu River.\n\nYou can also have a chance to learn the 700-year history of the city at the Shanghai History Museum at the 0M Hall.", "id": "PRz1xpMyzJoq", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "Oriental Pearl Tower Tickets Booking", "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFTdj56RqcBa"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFQagMOtVabX"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFLD1LKC73Sx"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFJp3CXL3qZC"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "Travel China Guide", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 43, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 43}, "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 0}, "slug": "prz1xpmyzjoq-oriental-pearl-tower-tickets-booking", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": false, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": -1924465, "bCityName": "Shanghai"}, "whatsIncluded": ["0M - Shanghai History Museum", "259M - Transparent Observatory", "351M - Space Capsule, for Three Balls Ticket only", "263M - Sightseeing Galleria", "78M - Updating City Dynamic Ring Multimedia Show"]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some attractions near Pudong Shangri-La in Shanghai:\n\n### 1. Oriental Pearl Tower\n- **Description**: The Oriental Pearl Tower is the most-visited attraction in Shanghai, offering a mix of urban tourism, fashion dining, shopping, entertainment, and historical exhibitions. Key highlights include:\n  - **Space Capsule**: Experience the sensation of being in space.\n  - **Sky Galleria**: Enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of Shanghai from a high vantage point.\n  - **Transparent Observatory**: Step onto a completely transparent floor for a thrilling view of the city below.\n  - **Indoor VR Roller Coaster**: Experience an exhilarating VR roller coaster themed around flying over Shanghai.\n  - **Revolving Restaurant**: Asia's largest aerial revolving restaurant, offering buffets with Southeast Asian, Japanese, Chinese, European, and American cuisines.\n  - **Shanghai History Museum**: Learn about the 700-year history of Shanghai at the 0M Hall.\n\n- **Included in the Ticket**:\n  - Shanghai History Museum (0M)\n  - Transparent Observatory (259M)\n  - Space Capsule (351M, for Three Balls Ticket only)\n  - Sightseeing Galleria (263M)\n  - Updating City Dynamic Ring Multimedia Show (78M)\n\n- **Price**: Approximately $43 USD per person.\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n- **Opening Hours**: 08:00-22:00 (last admission at 21:30).\n- **Additional Info**:\n  - Children under 100cm enter free; children between 100cm and 140cm enjoy discounted prices.\n  - Public transportation is available nearby.\n  - Suitable for all physical fitness levels.\n\nThis attraction is highly recommended for its unique experiences and stunning views of Shanghai!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides a detailed description of one attraction near the hotel but does not recommend multiple attractions as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
