{"id": "Cross-174", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "Aden is going to stay at Chisun Hotel Hiroshima in Hiroshima (hotel_id is 313854). Could you recommend some attractions near the hotel and provide detailed descriptions of the attractions?"}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Popular_Attraction_Near_By", "arguments": {"hotel_id": "313854"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"closest_landmarks": [{"average_out_of_10": 9.1, "longitude": 132.467227578163, "distance": 0.135800339389846, "tag": "Memorial Cathedral for World Peace", "total_votes": 37, "latitude": 34.3953742590765}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Attraction_Location", "arguments": {"query": "Memorial Cathedral for World Peace"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"products": [{"id": "eyJwaW5uZWRQcm9kdWN0IjoiUFJxVFkxcEtuSU9FIiwidWZpIjotMjI5NDM2fQ==", "__typename": "AttractionsSearchProductSuggestion", "title": "The Peace Memorial to Miyajima : Icons of Peace and Beauty", "productId": "PRqTY1pKnIOE", "productSlug": "prqty1pknioe-the-peace-memorial-to-miyajima-icons-of-peace-and-beauty", "taxonomySlug": "tours", "cityUfi": -229436, "cityName": "Hiroshima", "countryCode": "jp"}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Attraction_Details", "arguments": {"slug": "prqty1pknioe-the-peace-memorial-to-miyajima-icons-of-peace-and-beauty"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"__typename": "AttractionsProduct", "additionalInfo": "Wheelchair accessible\n\nInfants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller\n\nPublic transportation options are available nearby\n\nTransportation options are wheelchair accessible\n\nTravelers should have at least a moderate level of physical fitness\n\nTravel time included on Tour Duration\n\nBe of moderate physical fitness level as there is a good deal of walking\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book.", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Viator"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "Welcome to Hiroshima, a city where the echoes of history resonate with messages of peace, and the landscapes captivate the soul. Our expert-guided tour will begin at the Peace Memorial (including the Atomic Bomb dome and Peace Memorial Museum) and end at Hiroshima station, taking you on an immersive journey via public transit to explore iconic landmarks and the serene Miyajima Island - known for its free wandering deer and Itsukushima (the floating gate). \n\nProfessional photo option\n\nJoin us on a memorable journey with our expert guide-photographers, as we delve into the poignant history of Hiroshima at the Peace Memorial Park. Amidst the solemn atmosphere, our guides skillfully capture moments of reflection and reverence. Then, journey to Miyajima Island, where our guide-photographers transform your experience into timeless memories, expertly framing each moment. Join us for a tour that ensures every step is captured in stunning professional photos.", "id": "PRqTY1pKnIOE", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "The Peace Memorial to Miyajima : Icons of Peace and Beauty", "notIncluded": ["Lunch"], "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFudQjrxgaHu"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFpHtzcU8jnu"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFhwJV3lPVhA"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFF8IkzKEEQ1"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OF4iekTkjOOp"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "Pinpoint Traveler, Inc", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 272, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 272}, "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 0}, "reviewsStats": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductReviewStats", "allReviewsCount": 0, "percentage": "0", "combinedNumericStats": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductCombinedReviewStats", "average": 3.7, "total": 3}}, "slug": "prqty1pknioe-the-peace-memorial-to-miyajima-icons-of-peace-and-beauty", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": true, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": -229436, "bCityName": "Hiroshima"}, "whatsIncluded": ["Public transportation fares (tram, bus and ferry)."]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some popular attractions near **Chisun Hotel Hiroshima**:\n\n### 1. **Memorial Cathedral for World Peace**\n- **Distance from Hotel**: Approximately 0.14 km\n- **Rating**: 9.1/10 (based on 37 reviews)\n- **Location**: \n  - **Latitude**: 34.3954\n  - **Longitude**: 132.4672\n\n### Detailed Description\n#### **Tour: The Peace Memorial to Miyajima: Icons of Peace and Beauty**\n- **Overview**: This guided tour offers an immersive journey through Hiroshima's historical landmarks and the serene Miyajima Island. The tour begins at the Peace Memorial (including the Atomic Bomb Dome and Peace Memorial Museum) and ends at Hiroshima Station. You'll explore iconic sites via public transit and enjoy the natural beauty of Miyajima, known for its free-roaming deer and the famous Itsukushima Shrine (the floating gate).\n  \n- **Highlights**:\n  - **Professional Photography**: Expert guide-photographers capture moments of reflection at the Peace Memorial Park and frame your experiences on Miyajima Island.\n  - **Cultural Insights**: Learn about Hiroshima's poignant history and its message of peace.\n  - **Natural Beauty**: Experience Miyajima's tranquil landscapes and wildlife.\n\n- **Inclusions**:\n  - Public transportation fares (tram, bus, and ferry).\n\n- **Exclusions**:\n  - Lunch.\n\n- **Accessibility**:\n  - Wheelchair accessible.\n  - Public transportation options are available nearby.\n  - Transportation options are wheelchair accessible.\n\n- **Physical Requirements**:\n  - Travelers should have a moderate level of physical fitness.\n  - Be prepared for a good deal of walking.\n\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n- **Price**: $272 USD per person.\n\n### Additional Information\n- **Operator**: Pinpoint Traveler, Inc.\n- **Booking Requirements**: Travelers must be 18 years or older to book.\n- **Duration**: Travel time is included in the tour duration.\n\nWould you like more details about this tour or assistance with booking?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides detailed descriptions of a tour that includes attractions near the hotel, but it does not specifically list or describe multiple attractions near the hotel as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
