be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Klook"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": false}, "description": "During this cruise, you'll spend 2.5–3 hours gliding along the Delaware River, taking in the Philadelphia skyline from the water. Your route will take you past sights like the Ben Franklin Bridge, Flagship Olympia and more. \r\n\r\nYou'll be treated to a buffet dinner on board with a broad selection of delicious dishes, while a DJ and interactive party games will keep you and your fellow passengers entertained.", "id": "PRyX24fJQqaO", "isBookable": true, "name": "Delaware River Dinner Cruise", "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFANCFHdA3aH"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFZgvl7kqgAO"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "Klook", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 134.86, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 134.86}, "restrictions": ["Please arrive at least 45 minutes before the activity starts."], "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 0}, "shortDescription": "A sightseeing voyage along the Delaware with a buffet dinner, DJ and games", "slug": "pryx24fjqqao-delaware-river-dinner-cruise", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": false, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": 20111994, "bCityName": "Philadelphia"}}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some attractions near Pocono Mountain Villas by Exploria Resorts in Philadelphia, along with detailed descriptions:\n\n### 1. Delaware River Dinner Cruise\n- **Description**: Enjoy a 2.5–3-hour cruise along the Delaware River, offering stunning views of the Philadelphia skyline. The route passes iconic sights such as the Ben Franklin Bridge and Flagship Olympia. \n- **Activities**: \n  - Buffet dinner with a variety of delicious dishes.\n  - Entertainment by a DJ and interactive party games.\n- **Accessibility**: Wheelchair accessible.\n- **Restrictions**: \n  - Arrive at least 45 minutes before departure.\n  - Participants must be 18 years or older or accompanied by an adult.\n- **Cancellation Policy**: No free cancellation available.\n- **Price**: $134.86 per person.\n- **Additional Info**: \n  - Children aged 0 to 2 years can participate for free.\n  - Bring your ticket to the attraction.\n\nThis attraction provides a relaxing and scenic experience combined with dining and entertainment, making it a perfect evening activity near your hotel."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides a detailed description of one attraction near the hotel but does not recommend multiple attractions as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
