 name sign.\nPlease inform about your pick up details in advance.\n\nNot wheelchair accessible\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Viator"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "This tour will take you around the attractive Takamatsu areas.\nYou can experience of making Sanuki Udon noodles which is the specialty of this area.\nAfter enjoying the Udon cooking experience, you can stroll through the famous scenery at Ritsurin Park.\nIf the weather is clear, you will be able to spend a peaceful time overlooking the Seto Inland Sea.\nIn this tour, you will enjoy immersive cultural experiences, insider knowledge, and memorable encounters with local traditions.", "id": "PR9c0biSZq7f", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "Private Guided Shore Excursion from Takamatsu port", "notIncluded": ["Personal Expenses", "Souvenirs"], "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFGtO5KlO6cZ"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "MY Travel Consulting", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 1100, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 1100}, "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 0}, "slug": "pr9c0biszq7f-private-guided-shore-excursion-from-takamatsu-port", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": false, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": -244956, "bCityName": "Takamatsu"}, "whatsIncluded": ["Private vehicle", "National Licensed Guide", "Udon making experience and lunch", "Admission fee"]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some popular attractions near **Hotel Route-Inn Sakaide-Kita Inter** in Takamatsu:\n\n### 1. Private Guided Shore Excursion from Takamatsu Port\n- **Description**: This tour offers an immersive cultural experience in Takamatsu. Highlights include:\n  - **Sanuki Udon Noodle Making**: Learn to make Sanuki Udon, a local specialty, and enjoy it for lunch.\n  - **Ritsurin Park**: Stroll through this famous park, known for its stunning scenery and views of the Seto Inland Sea.\n  - **Cultural Insights**: Gain insider knowledge about local traditions and history from a national licensed guide.\n\n- **Price**: $1100 USD per person.\n- **Inclusions**:\n  - Private vehicle transportation.\n  - National Licensed Guide.\n  - Udon making experience and lunch.\n  - Admission fees.\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n- **Physical Requirements**: Moderate level of physical fitness required.\n- **Additional Info**: \n  - Dietary restrictions (vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, etc.) can be accommodated if requested in advance.\n  - Infants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller; specialized infant seats are available.\n\nThis excursion is perfect for travelers looking to explore Takamatsu's cultural highlights while enjoying hands-on experiences and picturesque views."}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides a detailed description of one attraction near the hotel but does not recommend multiple attractions as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
