 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Viator"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "With the help of your native host, you will get hands-on training from a professional chef. You'll learn how to cut and make food into animal shapes. Also, you'll learn the correct colors needed to make an eye appealing obento. When the obento is finished you can take pictures for your SNS. You can eat the obento in the restaurant or take it with you to eat later.", "id": "PRbFuWoy3XfV", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "Character Obento Workshop in Kagoshima", "notIncluded": ["Bottled water", "Coffee and/or Tea", "Alcoholic Beverages"], "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFdSIxAIgw0l"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "Melinda Kawahara Chief Tour Coordinator for Kagoshima Adventure Tours @thejapandiscovery", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 61.71, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 61.71}, "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 0}, "slug": "prbfuwoy3xfv-character-obento-workshop-in-kagoshima", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": true, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": -231554, "bCityName": "Kagoshima"}, "whatsIncluded": ["Lunch"]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some attractions near **HOTEL NOIR Kagoshima Chuo Station** in Kagoshima:\n\n### 1. Kagoshima City Museum of Art\n- **Distance from Hotel:** Approximately 1.2 km\n- **Rating:** 8.1/10 (based on 84 reviews)\n- **Description:** The Kagoshima City Museum of Art is a prominent cultural venue showcasing a diverse collection of artworks. It features both local and international exhibitions, making it a must-visit for art enthusiasts. The museum is well-regarded for its serene ambiance and thoughtfully curated displays.\n\n### 2. Character Obento Workshop in Kagoshima\n- **Description:** \n  - This unique workshop offers hands-on training from a professional chef where you’ll learn to create adorable animal-shaped bento boxes. You’ll master techniques for cutting and shaping food, as well as using vibrant colors to make your bento visually appealing.\n  - After crafting your bento, you can capture photos for social media and choose to enjoy it at the restaurant or take it with you.\n  \n- **Accessibility:**\n  - Wheelchair accessible\n  - Stroller/pram friendly\n  - Public transportation options nearby\n  - Suitable for all ages (children must be accompanied by an adult)\n\n- **Inclusions:**\n  - Lunch\n  - Professional guidance\n\n- **Exclusions:**\n  - Bottled water\n  - Coffee and/or Tea\n  - Alcoholic beverages\n\n- **Cancellation Policy:**\n  - Free cancellation available\n\n- **Price:** $61.71 USD\n\nThese attractions offer a blend of cultural enrichment and interactive experiences, perfect for enhancing your stay in Kagoshima!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including recommendations and detailed descriptions of attractions near the hotel."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
{"id": "Cross-178", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "Aden is going to stay at Resivation Hotel in Dubai (hotel_id is 7181225). Could you recommend some attractions near the hotel and provide detailed descriptions of the attractions?"}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Popular_Attraction_Near_By", "arguments": {"hotel_id": "7181225"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"closest_landmarks": [{"tag": "Dubai Sports City", "average_out_of_10": 7.3, "total_votes": 11, "latitude": 25.041350760456, "longitude": 55.2196522211792, "distance": 4.16778457962496}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Attraction_Location", "arguments": {"query": "Dubai Sports City"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"products": [{"id": "eyJwaW5uZWRQcm9kdWN0IjoiUFJwS2ZRcUFiZGd4IiwidWZpIjotNzgyODMxfQ==", "__typename": "AttractionsSearchProductSuggestion", "title": "Private Water Sports Activity in Dubai Adventure Zone", "productId": "PRpKfQqAbdgx", "productSlug": "prpkfqqabdgx-private-water-sports-activity-in-dubai-adventure-zone", "taxonomySlug": "activities", "cityUfi": -782831, "cityName": "Dubai", "countryCode": "ae"}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Attraction_Details", "arguments": {"slug": "prpkfqqabdgx-private-water-sports-activity-in-dubai-adventure-zone"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"__typename": "AttractionsProduct", "additionalInfo": "Not recommended for travelers with spinal injuries\n\nNot recommended for pregnant travelers\n\nNot recommended for travelers with poor cardiovascular health\n\nSuitable for all physical fitness levels\n\nYou will be notified by our team for the confirmation which needs to be carried with the voucher.\n\nPlease contact our customer support if you do not receive any update from our team within 24 hours.\n\nPlease bring your original passport or Emirates ID with you to be presented at the counter.\n\nNO previous experience is required.\n\nChildren under 6 years will not be allowed for this activity due to safety reasons.\n\nDriver must be at least 16 years old.\n\nGuests are requested to wear comfortable clothes that you are okay with getting a bit wet, just in-case. Best to wear water-proof clothes or swimwear (some tours include swimming time).\n\nThere will be no refund for partly utilized services and in case the guest doesn’t show up at the start time mentioned in the tour itinerary, the service provider reserves the right to charge 100% no-show fee.\n\nDate/Time subject to availability.\n\nNot wheelchair accessible\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book.", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Viator"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "Seakart at Dubai Beach is an exhilarating and unique water activity that you won't find just anywhere. Imagine cruising along the stunning Dubai coastline in a powerful yet compact watercraft that combines the thrill of jet skiing with the comfort of a boat.\n\nWhat sets Seakart apart is the perfect blend of adventure and luxury. You get to be in control as you ride the waves, feeling the adrenaline rush through your veins while taking in breathtaking views of Dubai's iconic landmarks like the Burj Al Arab and the Palm Jumeirah.\n\nOne of the most fascinating aspects of this activity is that it's suitable for both thrill-seekers and those looking for a more leisurely experience. You can rev up the speed for an adrenaline-packed adventure or slow down to enjoy a gentle cruise, making it perfect for families, friends, or couples.", "id": "PRpKfQqAbdgx", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "Private Water Sports Activity in Dubai Adventure Zone", "notIncluded": ["All personal expenses spend for shopping, drinks and dining etc on-site during the tour.", "Pickup and drop-off"], "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFdNGi3Vstag"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFLU9BulPlvL"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "Trip Ventura", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 307.68, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 307.68}, "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 0}, "slug": "prpkfqqabdgx-private-water-sports-activity-in-dubai-adventure-zone", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": false, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": -782831, "bCityName": "Dubai"}, "whatsIncluded": ["Safety briefing from a professional crew", "Pictures & Videos (with your device or with Guide device)", "swimming session (20-30 Minutes)", "Complimentary Fruit Juice & Light Snack (120mins tour)", "Bottled water", "Tour Guide (On his own boat)", "Life Jacket", "1 Self-Drive Seakart Boat per Ticket (1 SeaKart can take 3 Adults & 2 Child)"]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some attractions near Resivation Hotel in Dubai:\n\n### 1. Private Water Sports Activity in Dubai Adventure Zone\n- **Description**: Experience an exhilarating and unique water activity along Dubai's stunning coastline. Cruise in a powerful yet compact watercraft that combines the thrill of jet skiing with the comfort of a boat. Enjoy breathtaking views of iconic landmarks like the Burj Al Arab and the Palm Jumeirah while riding the waves. This activity is perfect for thrill-seekers and those looking for a leisurely cruise, making it ideal for families, friends, or couples.\n  \n- **Price**: $307.68 USD\n- **Inclusions**:\n  - Safety briefing from a professional crew\n  - Pictures & Videos (with your device or with Guide device)\n  - Swimming session (20-30 minutes)\n  - Complimentary Fruit Juice & Light Snack (for 120-minute tour)\n  - Bottled water\n  - Tour Guide (on his own boat)\n  - Life Jacket\n  - 1 Self-Drive Seakart Boat per Ticket (1 SeaKart can accommodate 3 adults & 2 children)\n\n- **Exclusions**:\n  - Personal expenses for shopping, drinks, and dining\n  - Pickup and drop-off services\n\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n- **Requirements**:\n  - Not suitable for travelers with spinal injuries, pregnant travelers, or those with poor cardiovascular health.\n  - Children under 6 years are not allowed.\n  - Drivers must be at least 16 years old.\n  - Guests should wear comfortable clothes that can get wet (water-proof clothes or swimwear recommended).\n\n- **Operated By**: Trip Ventura\n\nThis attraction offers a perfect blend of adventure and luxury, allowing you to control your experience—whether you prefer an adrenaline-packed ride or a gentle cruise. Enjoy the beauty of Dubai's coastline while creating unforgettable memories!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides a detailed description of one attraction near the hotel but does not recommend multiple attractions as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
{"id": "Cross-173", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "Aden is going to stay at Nantasket Beach Hotel in Nantasket (hotel_id is 390545). Could you recommend some attractions near the hotel and provide detailed descriptions of the attractions?"}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Popular_Attraction_Near_By", "arguments": {"hotel_id": "390545"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"closest_landmarks": [{"distance": 12.2074418601903, "total_votes": 31, "average_out_of_10": 9.2, "tag": "Boston Harbor Islands National Park", "longitude": -71.0524619999999, "latitude": 42.36008}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Attraction_Location", "arguments": {"query": "Boston Harbor Islands National Park"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"products": [{"id": "eyJwaW5uZWRQcm9kdWN0IjoiUFJSZGFtdnJkeThpIiwidWZpIjoyMDA2MTcxN30=", "__typename": "AttractionsSearchProductSuggestion", "title": "Boston Harbor Sightseeing Cruise", "productId": "PRRdamvrdy8i", "productSlug": "prrdamvrdy8i-15-hour-boston-harbour-cruise", "taxonomySlug": "tours", "cityUfi": 20061717, "cityName": "Boston", "countryCode": "us"}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Attraction_Details", "arguments": {"slug": "prrdamvrdy8i-15-hour-boston-harbour-cruise"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"__typename": "AttractionsProduct", "additionalInfo": "Infants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller\n\nService animals allowed\n\nPublic transportation options are available nearby\n\nSuitable for all physical fitness levels\n\nPlan to arrive 15-30 minutes prior to the departure time to check-in at the ticket booth and obtain boarding passes\n\nBring a photo ID that matches the name listed on the reservation\n\nChildren must be accompanied by an adult\n\nMinimum drinking age is 21 years\n\nOperates in all weather conditions, please dress appropriately\n\nThere is a climate controlled main cabin with seating, a covered upper deck and an open bow\n\nInfant seats are available if given advance notice\n\nOnly animals that perform a manual task to assist a person are permitted aboard. Emotional support animals and pets are not permitted.\n\nPlease let us know in advance if assistance is required for boarding\n\nThis cruise is moderately narrated by the Captain. Enjoy commentary on the main sights as we cruise. Please note this is not a fully narrated tour.\n\nNot wheelchair accessible\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Viator"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "Enjoy this 1.5 hour cruise around Boston Harbor on classic 1920s-style Yacht Northern Lights. Relax in the indoor grand salon area or venture to the top, outdoor deck for more sweeping views of the Harbor. Some notable sites include great views of Boston's skyline, Old North Church, Bunker Hill Monument, USS Cassin Young, and the USS Constitution along with Boston's Harbor Islands. Bring your camera! Grab a beverage or light snacks from the bar (available for purchase by credit card).", "guideSupportedLanguages": ["English (US)"], "id": "PRRdamvrdy8i", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "Boston Harbor Sightseeing Cruise", "notIncluded": ["Food and drinks are not included, but are available for purchase by credit card", "Gratuities are not included, but recommended for the Captain and crew"], "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFLVkka9DILi"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFPsrT0zmZ3o"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements"}, "operatedBy": "Classic Harbor Line - Boston", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 44.8, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 44.8}, "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 2, "reviews": [{"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RSPmV3caXqp8", "epochMs": 1722873027000, "numericRating": 5, "user": {"__typename": "AttractionsReviewUser", "name": "Florian", "cc1": "de"}}, {"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RSkonHg64oVY", "rating": true, "epochMs": 1651493533000}]}, "reviewsStats": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductReviewStats", "allReviewsCount": 1, "percentage": "100%", "combinedNumericStats": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductCombinedReviewStats", "average": 4.3, "total": 36}}, "slug": "prrdamvrdy8i-15-hour-boston-harbour-cruise", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": true, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": 20061717, "bCityName": "Boston"}, "whatsIncluded": ["Cruise aboard Northern Lights", "Enjoy moderate commentary on the main sights by the captain. This is not a fully narrated tour"]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are some recommended attractions near **Nantasket Beach Hotel** along with their detailed descriptions:\n\n### 1. **Boston Harbor Sightseeing Cruise**\n- **Description**: Enjoy a 1.5-hour cruise around Boston Harbor aboard the classic 1920s-style Yacht Northern Lights. Relax in the indoor grand salon or venture to the top deck for sweeping views of the harbor. Notable sights include Boston’s skyline, the Old North Church, Bunker Hill Monument, USS Cassin Young, and the USS Constitution, as well as the scenic Boston Harbor Islands. Bring your camera! Beverages and light snacks are available for purchase by credit card.\n  \n- **Highlights**:\n  - **Duration**: 1.5 hours.\n  - **Price**: $44.80 per person.\n  - **Accessibility**: \n    - Infants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller.\n    - Service animals allowed.\n    - Climate-controlled main cabin with seating, covered upper deck, and open bow.\n  - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n  - **Reviews**: Highly rated with an average score of 9.2 out of 10 based on 31 votes.\n\n- **Notable Features**:\n  - Moderate narration by the captain highlighting key sights.\n  - Operates in all weather conditions; dress appropriately.\n  - Minimum drinking age is 21 years.\n\n- **What’s Included**:\n  - Cruise aboard the Northern Lights.\n  - Commentary on main sights by the captain.\n\n- **What’s Not Included**:\n  - Food and drinks (available for purchase).\n  - Gratuities (recommended for the captain and crew).\n\n---\n\nThis attraction offers a relaxing and picturesque way to explore Boston Harbor while staying close to your hotel at **Nantasket Beach**. If you'd like more options or specific details about other attractions, let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response provides a detailed description of one attraction near the Nantasket Beach Hotel but does not offer multiple attractions as requested."}, "correct": {"score": 1, "reason": "The response correctly describes the Boston Harbor Sightseeing Cruise, including its description, highlights, price, accessibility, cancellation policy, and what's included and not included. However, the average score of 9.2 out of 10 based on 31 votes is incorrect; this rating is for the Boston Harbor Islands National Park, not the cruise."}}}
{"id": "Cross-172", "gen_convs": [{"role": "user", "content": "Aden is going to stay at Lestel Maru in Sapporo (hotel_id is 6374805). Could you recommend some attractions near the hotel and provide detailed descriptions of the attractions?"}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Popular_Attraction_Near_By", "arguments": {"hotel_id": "6374805"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"closest_landmarks": [{"tag": "Hokkaido Shrine", "latitude": 43.054257, "distance": 0.783290665978395, "longitude": 141.307664, "average_out_of_10": 9.1, "total_votes": 76}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Search_Attraction_Location", "arguments": {"query": "Hokkaido Shrine"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"products": [{"id": "eyJwaW5uZWRQcm9kdWN0IjoiUFJOMkM5SkJHQTJNIiwidWZpIjotMjQyMzk1fQ==", "__typename": "AttractionsSearchProductSuggestion", "title": "Hokkaido Day Trip", "productId": "PRN2C9JBGA2M", "productSlug": "prn2c9jbga2m-hokkaido-day-trip", "taxonomySlug": "tours", "cityUfi": -242395, "cityName": "Sapporo", "countryCode": "jp"}]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "function_call": [{"name": "Get_Attraction_Details", "arguments": {"slug": "prn2c9jbga2m-hokkaido-day-trip"}}]}, {"role": "observation", "content": [{"status": true, "message": "Success", "data": {"__typename": "AttractionsProduct", "additionalInfo": "Please check your email a day before the tour for important information and updates from the tour provider.\r\n\r\nPlease make sure that your email and mobile phone can be reached.\r\n\r\nLatecomers or no-shows will not be refunded.\r\n\r\nPlease refer to the official Yukiakarinomichi website for the specific schedule of the Otaru Snow Light Path Festival.\r\n\r\nThe itinerary or schedule may be adjusted according to weather, road conditions or for other reasons. It is advisable that you do not have other activities planned for the end of the tour.\n\nPlease bring your ticket with you to the attraction.\n\nBe aware that operators may cancel for unforeseen reasons.\n\nYou need to be 18 years or older to book or be accompanied by an adult. ", "applicableTerms": [{"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Booking.com"}, {"__typename": "TermsConditions", "policyProvider": "Musement"}], "cancellationPolicy": {"__typename": "AttractionsCancellationPolicy", "hasFreeCancellation": true}, "description": "On this full-day tour from Sapporo, you'll get to explore Hokkaido. The first stop will be Noboribetsu, where you will see Jigokudani, a volcanic crater with boiling sulfuric hot springs and volcanic steam plumes. Next, you'll head to Lake Toyako, a volcanic caldera lake in Shikotsu-Toya National Park. Here you will have two hours of free time for lunch and shopping. You'll then make your way to Showa Shinzan, an active volcano. Here, you'll have the chance to visit a bear farm that is home to 100 purebred Hokkaido brown bears, and you'll get to feed them. The tour then stops at Lake Touyako Observatory, followed by the port town of Otaru, where you will visit Kitaichi Glass and Otaru Music Box Museum.", "guideSupportedLanguages": ["Simplified Chinese", "English (UK)", "Japanese"], "id": "PRN2C9JBGA2M", "isBookable": true, "labels": [{"__typename": "AttractionsLabel", "text": "Free cancellation", "type": "free_cancellation"}], "name": "Hokkaido Day Trip", "notIncluded": ["Food and drinks"], "offers": [{"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFaSRQdzXyX0"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFFjqVGAzsTl"}, {"__typename": "Offer", "availabilityType": "date_time", "id": "OFOI0vXIgxWq"}], "onSiteRequirements": {"__typename": "OnSiteRequirements", "voucherPrintingRequired": {"__typename": "Value", "value": "false"}}, "operatedBy": "Tuyi Group Japan Co.，Ltd.", "representativePrice": {"__typename": "AttractionsPrice", "chargeAmount": 92.08, "currency": "USD", "publicAmount": 92.08}, "restrictions": ["Please arrive at least 10 minutes before the activity starts.", "A minimum of 4 participants is required for the tour to go ahead. In case the number is not reached, you will be suggested with a new date or full refund option."], "reviews": {"__typename": "AttractionsGetReviewsResponse", "total": 8, "reviews": [{"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RScrWluCJJO8", "epochMs": 1729591792000, "numericRating": 4}, {"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RSOIV3TxYXps", "epochMs": 1728908343000, "numericRating": 5, "user": {"__typename": "AttractionsReviewUser", "name": "Harald", "cc1": "no"}}, {"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RSHJTq5tKl6b", "epochMs": 1727011878000, "language": "ja", "numericRating": 3}, {"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RSV9CIjZaylC", "epochMs": 1724543472000, "numericRating": 5, "user": {"__typename": "AttractionsReviewUser", "name": "YOKO", "cc1": "jp"}}, {"__typename": "AttractionsReview", "id": "RSspxigtTD0h", "content": "It is a 10 hour journey packed with several sightseeing spots all of which were interesting. Tour guide Mr. Jay and bus driver Mr. Kansai were excellent. Mini bus was sufficient for the group and air conditioned. We wish that brief 20min visit to Lake Toya two scenic spots was a bit longer - it’s such a beautiful spot. We highly recommend this company and tour guide and driver as they were polite and friendly.", "epochMs": 1724037026000, "language": "en-gb", "numericRating": 5, "user": {"__typename": "AttractionsReviewUser", "name": "Vladimir", "cc1": "hk"}}]}, "reviewsStats": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductReviewStats", "allReviewsCount": 0, "percentage": "0", "combinedNumericStats": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductCombinedReviewStats", "average": 4.1, "total": 8}}, "shortDescription": "A full-day tour from Sapporo including Lake Toyako and Otaru", "slug": "prn2c9jbga2m-hokkaido-day-trip", "supportedFeatures": {"__typename": "AttractionsProductSupportedFeatures", "nativeApp": true, "nativeAppBookProcess": true, "liveAvailabilityCheckSupported": true}, "uniqueSellingPoints": ["Two hours of free time to explore Shikotsu-Toya National Park", "Chance to see and feed Hokkaido brown bears at bear farm", "Opportunity to see the active volcanic activity at Jigokudani", "Visit to Kitaichi Glass to see the famous glass arts and crafts"], "ufiDetails": {"__typename": "AttractionLocationResponse", "ufi": -242395, "bCityName": "Sapporo"}, "whatsIncluded": ["Transportation in air-conditioned vehicle", "Pickup and drop-off", "Driver-guide", "Service fee"]}}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Based on the information available, here are some recommended attractions near **Lestel Maru** in Sapporo:\n\n### 1. **Hokkaido Shrine**\n- **Distance**: Approximately 0.78 km from your hotel.\n- **Rating**: 9.1/10 (based on 76 votes).\n- **Description**: The Hokkaido Shrine is a significant Shinto shrine in Sapporo, known for its serene atmosphere and beautiful natural surroundings. It is a popular spot for both locals and tourists, especially during festivals and ceremonies. The shrine is nestled in Maruyama Park, offering a peaceful retreat with lush greenery and walking paths.\n\n### 2. **Hokkaido Day Trip**\n- **Description**: This full-day tour from Sapporo takes you to several iconic locations in Hokkaido:\n  - **Noboribetsu**: Visit Jigokudani (Hell Valley), a volcanic crater with boiling sulfuric hot springs and volcanic steam plumes.\n  - **Lake Toyako**: A volcanic caldera lake in Shikotsu-Toya National Park. You'll have two hours of free time here for lunch and shopping.\n  - **Showa Shinzan**: An active volcano where you can visit a bear farm home to 100 purebred Hokkaido brown bears. You'll have the opportunity to feed them.\n  - **Lake Touyako Observatory**: Offers stunning views of the volcanic landscape.\n  - **Otaru**: A charming port town where you'll visit Kitaichi Glass and the Otaru Music Box Museum.\n\n#### Tour Details:\n- **Duration**: Full day.\n- **Inclusions**:\n  - Transportation in an air-conditioned vehicle.\n  - Pickup and drop-off.\n  - Driver-guide.\n  - Service fee.\n- **Exclusions**: Food and drinks.\n- **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n- **Price**: Approximately $92.08 USD.\n- **Rating**: 4.1/5 (based on 8 reviews).\n- **Restrictions**:\n  - Arrive at least 10 minutes before the activity starts.\n  - A minimum of 4 participants is required for the tour to proceed.\n\n#### Reviews:\n- **Vladimir**: *\"It is a 10-hour journey packed with several sightseeing spots, all of which were interesting. Tour guide Mr. Jay and bus driver Mr. Kansai were excellent. Mini bus was sufficient for the group and air-conditioned. We wish that the brief 20-minute visit to Lake Toya was a bit longer—it’s such a beautiful spot. We highly recommend this company.\"*\n\n### How to Book:\nYou can book the **Hokkaido Day Trip** tour directly using the provided details. If you have any specific preferences or need further assistance, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 3, "total_turn_num": 3, "correct_call_num": 3, "total_call_num": 3, "real_turn_num": 3}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including recommendations and detailed descriptions of attractions near the hotel."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
