648 USD (including taxes and fees)\n\n### Taxi Bookings\n#### 1. To the Airport (Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport)\n- **Pick-up Location:** 13350 Dallas Pkwy, Dallas, TX 75240\n- **Pick-up Time:** December 20, 2024, at 12:42 PM (3 hours before flight)\n- **Drop-off Location:** Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport (DFW)\n- **Taxi Options:**\n  - **Standard:** $70.70 (3 passengers, 3 bags)\n  - **People Carrier:** $79.06 (4 passengers, 4 bags)\n  - **Executive:** $87.66 (3 passengers, 3 bags)\n  - **Large People Carrier:** $97.24 (5 passengers, 5 bags)\n  - **Executive People Carrier:** $120.72 (5 passengers, 5 bags)\n\n#### 2. From the Airport (Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport)\n- **Pick-up Location:** Dallas-Fort Worth International Airport (DFW)\n- **Pick-up Time:** December 30, 2024, at 10:14 AM (1 hour after flight arrival)\n- **Drop-off Location:** 13350 Dallas Pkwy, Dallas, TX 75240\n- **Taxi Options:**\n  - **Standard:** $70.33 (3 passengers, 3 bags)\n  - **People Carrier:** $78.70 (4 passengers, 4 bags)\n  - **Executive:** $87.22 (3 passengers, 3 bags)\n  - **Large People Carrier:** $94.41 (5 passengers, 5 bags)\n  - **Executive People Carrier:** $120.17 (5 passengers, 5 bags)\n\n### Next Steps\nWould you like to proceed with booking the flight and taxis? If so, please confirm your preferred taxi options for both trips!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 8, "total_call_num": 8, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
