ckup Location:** 400 Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60605, USA\n- **Drop-off Location:** Chicago O'Hare International Airport (ORD)\n- **Pickup Time:** 15:56 (3 hours before flight departure)\n- **Vehicle Type:** Standard\n- **Price:** $68.49 USD\n- **Duration:** Approximately 32 minutes\n- **Supplier:** E-Life Limo\n\n#### From the Airport (December 22, 2024)\n- **Pickup Location:** Chicago O'Hare International Airport (ORD)\n- **Drop-off Location:** 400 Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60605, USA\n- **Pickup Time:** 09:10 (1 hour after flight arrival)\n- **Vehicle Type:** Standard\n- **Price:** $68.56 USD\n- **Duration:** Approximately 37 minutes\n- **Supplier:** E-Life Limo\n\n### Summary\n- **Total Flight Cost:** $191.93 USD\n- **Total Taxi Cost:** $137.05 USD\n- **Grand Total:** $328.98 USD\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking the flights and taxis?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 8, "total_call_num": 8, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
