re:** November 15, 2024, at 13:30 (Beijing Capital International Airport - PEK)\n   - **Arrival:** November 15, 2024, at 17:45 (Paris - Charles de Gaulle Airport - CDG)\n   - **Flight Number:** CA 933\n   - **Cabin Class:** Economy\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 11 hours 15 minutes\n   - **Price:** $899 USD\n\n2. **Flight 2: Paris to London**\n   - **Departure:** November 17, 2024, at 18:00 (Paris - Charles de Gaulle Airport - CDG)\n   - **Arrival:** November 17, 2024, at 18:20 (London Heathrow Airport - LHR)\n   - **Flight Number:** AF 1180\n   - **Cabin Class:** Economy\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 1 hour 20 minutes\n   - **Price:** Included in the total flight cost\n\n**Total Flight Price:** $899 USD\n\n---\n\n### Hotel Availability\n**ibis Styles Paris Bercy** is available for your stay from November 15 to November 17, 2024. Here are the room options:\n\n1. **Standard Double Room (Single Occupancy)**\n   - **Price:** $282 USD (including taxes and charges)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation until November 13, 2024\n   - **Meal Plan:** Breakfast included\n\n2. **Standard Double Room**\n   - **Price:** $308 USD (including taxes and charges)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation until November 13, 2024\n   - **Meal Plan:** Breakfast included\n\n---\n\n### Taxi Arrangement\nA taxi has been arranged to pick you up from **ibis Styles Paris Bercy** on **November 17, 2024, at 15:00** (three hours before your flight). The taxi will take you to **Paris - Charles de Gaulle Airport (CDG)**.\n\n**Taxi Options:**\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $65.81 USD\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 32 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $85.01 USD\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 32 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n\n3. **Electric Standard Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $94.28 USD\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 32 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n- **Flights:** $899 USD (fastest option)\n- **Hotel:** Starting at $282 USD (Standard Double Room)\n- **Taxi:** Starting at $65.81 USD (Standard Taxi)\n\nWould you like to proceed with any bookings or need further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 10, "total_call_num": 10, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
