ration:** 1 hour 45 minutes\n\n### Hotel Availability\n**Campanile Shanghai Bund Hotel** is available for your stay from **November 1 to November 3, 2024**. Here are the room options:\n\n1. **Deluxe Double Room**\n   - **Price:** $204 per night (includes taxes)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation until 18:00 on November 1\n   - **Breakfast:** Not included (available for $10)\n\n2. **Standard Double Room**\n   - **Price:** $178 per night (includes taxes)\n   - **Cancellation Policy:** Free cancellation until 18:00 on November 1\n   - **Breakfast:** Not included (available for $10)\n\n### Taxi Arrangement\nA taxi has been arranged to pick you up from the **Campanile Shanghai Bund Hotel** at **15:00 on November 3, 2024** to take you to **Shanghai Pudong International Airport (PVG)**. \n\n- **Pickup Location:** Campanile Shanghai Bund Hotel\n- **Drop-off Location:** Shanghai Pudong International Airport\n- **Duration:** Approximately 42 minutes\n- **Price:** $22.50 USD\n\n### Summary\n- **Flights:** Booked with the fastest options available.\n- **Hotel:** Campanile Shanghai Bund Hotel is available for your stay.\n- **Taxi:** Arranged for pickup three hours before your flight.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking the hotel room or need any further assistance?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 10, "total_call_num": 10, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
