cember 10, 2024, at 09:30 AM\n- **Arrival:** December 10, 2024, at 06:10 PM\n- **Total Duration:** Approximately 17 hours 40 minutes\n- **Price:** $441 USD (including taxes)\n\n#### Meal Options\n- **Vegetarian Meal Available:** Yes, you can request a vegetarian meal at no extra cost. Simply select this option during booking.\n\n### Car Rental Details\nYou can rent a **Chrysler Pacifica** from **Sixt** near **John F. Kennedy International Airport (JFK)**. Here are the details:\n\n- **Pickup Date & Time:** December 10, 2024, at 07:00 PM\n- **Drop-off Date & Time:** December 13, 2024, at 07:00 PM\n- **Price:** $320.92 USD (including taxes and fees)\n- **Child Seat Availability:** Yes, child seats are available for an additional fee of $42 USD per rental.\n\n#### Important Information\n- **Free Cancellation:** Available up to 48 hours before pickup.\n- **Payment Requirement:** A credit card in the main driver's name is required at pickup.\n- **Fuel Policy:** \"Like for like\" (return the car with the same fuel level as at pickup).\n\n### Summary\n- **Best Flight:** Turkish Airlines TK 759 & TK 1, with vegetarian meal option available.\n- **Car Rental:** Chrysler Pacifica from Sixt, with child seat availability.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking either the flight or the car rental?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 7, "total_call_num": 7, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
