 (XMN)** to **Schiphol Airport (AMS)**\n     - **Flight Number:** MF 811\n     - **Departure:** November 23, 2024, at 12:20\n     - **Arrival:** November 23, 2024, at 17:30\n\n### Taxi Arrangement\nYour taxi will pick you up from **Schiphol Airport (AMS)** at **19:30 on November 23, 2024**, and take you to the **Van Gogh Museum** in Amsterdam. Here are the available taxi options:\n\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** Deluxe Taxi Amsterdam\n   - **Price:** $52.96 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 3\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 20 minutes\n   - **Description:** Perfect for solo travelers, couples, and small families.\n\n2. **People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** Deluxe Taxi Amsterdam\n   - **Price:** $54.29 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 20 minutes\n   - **Description:** Great choice for families.\n\n3. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** I.A.S. Taxi\n   - **Price:** $57.90 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 20 minutes\n   - **Description:** Plenty of space to travel in comfort.\n\n4. **Electric Standard Taxi**\n   - **Supplier:** I.A.S. Taxi\n   - **Price:** $60.80 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 4\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 20 minutes\n   - **Description:** 100% Electric.\n\n5. **Large People Carrier**\n   - **Supplier:** Deluxe Taxi Amsterdam\n   - **Price:** $64.34 USD\n   - **Passenger Capacity:** 8\n   - **Duration:** Approximately 20 minutes\n   - **Description:** Ideal for small groups.\n\n### Next Steps\nIf you would like to proceed with booking the flight or selecting a taxi option, please let me know!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
