 Capacity:** 3\n   - **Bags:** 2\n   - **Supplier:** Carzen+\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** Bangkok to Tokyo on November 25, 2024, with Xiamen Airlines.\n- **Taxi:** Pick-up at Narita Airport on November 26, 2024, at 15:40 PM to Tokyo Tower.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking the flight or taxi?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "all requested information is addressed"}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
