s **2 hours after your flight lands**. The taxi will take you to **The Colosseum** in Rome.\n\n#### Taxi Options:\n1. **Standard Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $68.26 USD\n   - **Supplier:** NCC Roma Service\n   - **Duration:** 38 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers, 3 bags\n   - **Features:** Meet & greet service included\n\n2. **Executive Taxi**\n   - **Price:** $83.73 USD\n   - **Supplier:** GEA TRASPORTI SRL\n   - **Duration:** 38 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 3 passengers, 2 bags\n\n3. **People Carrier**\n   - **Price:** $98.68 USD\n   - **Supplier:** Heycars\n   - **Duration:** 38 minutes\n   - **Capacity:** 6 passengers, 6 bags\n   - **Features:** Meet & greet service included\n\n### Summary\n- **Flight:** Seoul (ICN) to Rome (FCO) on **November 30, 2024**, at **13:45 PM**.\n- **Taxi:** Pickup from Fiumicino Airport on **December 1, 2024**, at **09:30 AM** to The Colosseum.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking any of these options?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 6, "total_call_num": 6, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete": {"score": 2, "reason": "All requested information is addressed, including finding the cheapest flight from Seoul to Rome and arranging a taxi to pick up from the airport and take to the Colosseum."}, "correct": {"score": 2, "reason": "All mentioned information is correct."}}}
