n**: A memorial and museum dedicated to the 9/11 tragedy.\n   - **Price**: $33 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n   - **Reviews**: \n     - Average Rating: 4.8 (based on 430 reviews)\n     - 97% positive reviews.\n   - [More Info](https://www.example.com/prgstbyhf5aj-911-memorial-museum-admission)\n\n### 3. **One World Observatory Standard Admission**\n   - **Description**: Visit the One World Observatory at New York's Freedom Tower.\n   - **Price**: $35.93 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n   - **Reviews**: \n     - Average Rating: 4.7 (based on 83 reviews)\n     - 98% positive reviews.\n   - [More Info](https://www.example.com/prbwn2pberlh-one-world-observatory-standard-admission)\n\n### 4. **New York CityPASS**\n   - **Description**: A sightseeing pass to explore Big Apple attractions at your own pace across nine days.\n   - **Price**: $146 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: No free cancellation.\n   - **Reviews**: \n     - Average Rating: 4.4 (based on 216 reviews)\n     - 83% positive reviews.\n   - [More Info](https://www.example.com/prj7dhkaezyz-new-york-city-pass)\n\n### 5. **Edge Sky Deck**\n   - **Description**: Admission to an immersive multimedia experience 1100 ft above New York.\n   - **Price**: $60.66 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: No free cancellation.\n   - **Reviews**: \n     - Average Rating: 4.6 (based on 201 reviews)\n   - [More Info](https://www.example.com/prbdadcwc90y-edge-sky-deck)\n\n### Additional Information:\n- **Location**: All attractions are in New York City.\n- **Popular Categories**:\n  - Tours\n  - Nature & outdoor\n  - Museums, arts & culture\n  - Entertainment & tickets\n  - Food & drinks\n\nIf you'd like more details about any specific attraction or need help with bookings, feel free to ask!"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"success_turn_num": 4, "total_turn_num": 4, "correct_call_num": 4, "total_call_num": 4, "real_turn_num": 4}, "resp_eval": {"complete"