iption**: A one, two, or three-day travel pass with a discount booklet.\n   - **Price**: $6.53 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: No free cancellation.\n   - **Reviews**: Average rating of 3.7 (based on 52 reviews).\n\n2. **Hiroshima Walking Tour: Why the A-Bomb was Dropped on Hiroshima**\n   - **Description**: A profound journey through Hiroshima to understand the historical context of the atomic bombing.\n   - **Price**: $45 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n   - **Reviews**: Average rating of 5 (based on 3 reviews).\n\n3. **Hiroshima Scenic Cycling Guided Tour**\n   - **Description**: Enjoy a scenic cycling tour with a small group, using battery-assisted bikes. You can use the bike all day even after the tour.\n   - **Price**: $93.82 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n   - **Reviews**: Average rating of 5 (based on 2 reviews).\n\n4. **Kimono and Tea Ceremony in Miyajima**\n   - **Description**: Experience a quiet and relaxing atmosphere in a 300-year-old temple away from tourist spots. Enjoy wearing a kimono and participating in a traditional tea ceremony.\n   - **Price**: $87.11 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n   - **Reviews**: Average rating of 5 (based on 2 reviews).\n\n5. **Kimono and Calligraphy Experience in Miyajima**\n   - **Description**: Participate in a kimono and calligraphy experience at a 300-year-old Zen temple, offering a peaceful retreat from tourist crowds.\n   - **Price**: $87.11 USD\n   - **Cancellation Policy**: Free cancellation available.\n   - **Reviews**: Average rating of 5 (based on 1 review).\n\n### Additional Options:\n- **Museums, Arts & Culture**: 3 options available.\n- **Tours**: 3 options available.\n- **Entertainment & Tickets**: 2 options available.\n- **Food & Drinks**: 1 option available.\n- **Nature & Outdoor**: 1 option available.\n\nWould you like more details on any specific attraction?"}], "message": "Success.", "count_dict": {"